<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CH" style="id">- Selee Old Testament</book>
  <para style="h">2 KRONIKA</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Kroni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kronika Kukũ Nyɔɔfa</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Kronika</para>
  <para style="mt2">KRONIKA KUKŨ</para>
  <para style="mt1">NYƆƆFA</para>
  <para style="imt">ODIKIOTUO</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Kronika Kukũ Nyɔɔfa</char> lekye kasɔ di nfũ di <char style="bk">Kronika Kukũ Kasale</char> lɛyɛntɛ nii. Kuotuo ni Ɔka Solomon sɛka ole, kuɔtɛ ni nsũ di obe wɔ di Yeroboam laleko ni katookasɔ batii ana katũ baataka baayila ni di Rehoboam suoto, Ɔka Solomon obisuɔtɔbi ku nnwɔ niale ni ɔka di sɛmaa nɔɔ suoto. Kuɔkyɛ sitũ kuɔkakatɛ di Yuda sɛka kalekɔ sekofolaa suoto dialaadu obe wɔ baabiɛ ni Yerusalem di alɛɛ alafa-anɔɔ afosi-anɛ-akuɔ kamɛ fiɛ baalofo ni Yesu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kukũ Nwu Kamɛ Sɛlaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Solomon sɛka olebee <char style="ior">1.1-9.31</char></para>
  <para style="io2">a. Alɛɛ ya niale ni katũ <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CH 1:1-17">1.1-17</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">b. Olekatakɔ nwu otofo<char style="ior">2.1-7.10</char></para>
  <para style="io2">c. Alɛɛ ya niatikanko ni sɛɛmaa <char style="ior">7.11-9.31</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Katookasɔ ana nwu ɔtaka oyila <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CH 10:1-19">10.1-19</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yuda baka <char style="ior">11.1-36.12</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yerusalem obiɛ <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CH 36:13-23">36.13-23</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔka Solomon Lapɛ Ɔlaa Aakaalɛ Ninumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 1:1" />Dawid obisuɔtɔbi Solomon lase suoto nɔɔ kpinkpĩ di sɛka kalekɔ nɔɔ suoto, diekye SAATE Yaa nɔɔ lasiɛko nwɔ, ni aatakatɛsa nwɔ katoo osie kanya nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 1:2" />Ninfɛ di Solomon lakakatɛ aata Israel omuu nɛ- nkpe nkpe kanyabayilatɛ ku alafa kanyabayilatɛ, bakantɛ ku batunletɛ bamuu di Israel, ayo kamɛ banɔɔfo- <verse eid="2CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 1:3" />ni di Solomon ku dikudi nwu nimuu lakyɛ katakalekɔ nwu di Gibeon nɛ, diekye Yaa Lɛkpaayo le Mansi ni lawɛ ninfa, nle di SAATE nwu kpɛmblatɛ Mose lapɛ ni di ɔfaafuu kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 1:4" />Kafɔɔ di obe nwu Dawid ntɔlaayɔ Yaa lɛlakaa nwu eekyeko Kiriat Yearim ɛɛwako lɛba le aalolaa aata ni nii, diekye aapɛ lɛkpaayo aata ni di Yerusalem. <verse eid="2CH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 1:5" />Kafɔɔ lɛbɔɔsaa sɛɛle oleɔta akyikye ya di Hur ɔwa Besalel, wɔ niale ni Uri obisuɔtɔbi, lapɛ ni lawɛ di Gibeon di SAATE nwu akpanta klekle anu; nioso Solomon ku batii nwu lakyɛ baalawolaa SAATE nwu ninfa. <verse eid="2CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 1:6" />Ni di Solomon lakata aakyɛ lɛbɔɔsaa sɛɛle oleɔta akyikye nwu di SAATE nwu anu di Lɛkpaayo le Mansi ni, ni baata ofiɛ asaaɔta kakpe ninya suoto nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 1:7" />Yaa ladiki suoto aatuo Solomon ku kakyɛ nwu nkpo, ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Kaalɛ lɛsaa lele foomiɛ falɛ nta fɔ ni.”<verse eid="2CH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 1:8" />Ninfɛ di Solomon ladiki Yaa kanya alɛ, “Fatoole teemi Dawid sifutulɛ kplɛ, ni fatoose mi sɛka di kayilakɔ nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 1:9" />Kanunua yi, SAATE Yaa, tika difuɔ di ɔlaa wɔ faabuɛ faatɛ faata ni teemi Dawid, diekye fatoose mi sɛka di batii ba niɛtɛ bapɔ ni fɛ kasɔ kudu suoto. <verse eid="2CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 1:10" />Tɛɛ ninumbe ku lɛsaatofo, alɛ kaleko batii ba mmle katũ. Diekye owe nimafuo batii kpinwu lɛfɔ ba mmle ɔkpà?”<verse eid="2CH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 1:11" />Ni di Yaa latɔkɔ Solomon alɛ, “Ta nle mmle ninle fɔ ni otu kamɛ dibiesaa, fanankaalɛ ni kafɔɔ lɛsaawɛ, lɛlɛ ee dibu, ee fakaalɛ ni balo lɛfɔ kukpi, fanakaalɛ ni kafɔɔ nkpa kaanale, kafɔɔ ninumbe ku lɛsaatofo alɛ faaleko ni batii nii katũ, mba suoto lese fɔ ni sɛka oso yi, <verse eid="2CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 1:12" />lɛyɔ ninumbe ku lɛsaatofo lɛta fɔ. Kamata fɔ kafɔɔ lɛsaawɛ, lɛlɛ ku dibu, alɛ ɔka kuonwii niawɛ ni ditawɛ nini diidii, fiɛ di afɔ, di kuonwii kafɔɔ dilɔbawɛ nini di sɛmaa lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="2CH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Osie Ku Lɛsaawɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 1:13" />Ninfɛ di Solomon ladie di katakalekɔ nwu di Gibeon di Lɛkpaayo le Mansi ni anu aasifi Yerusalem nɛ. Ni aale sɛka di Israel suoto nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 1:14" />Solomon lasiisa bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni ku bapɔnkɔ; aawɛ bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni kakpe alafa-ana ku bapɔnkɔ lefosi nkpe nnyɔ, mma aayɔ aase di bakeke sekpoo kplɛ nwu ku ɔkyɛ nɔɔ di Yerusalem kafɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 1:15" />Ɔka lata koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle labawɛ di Yerusalem fɛ afuɔ, seda kafɔɔ labapɔ fɛ kowoso ko manlɛɛ ni sikamɔ-abue awoso di akpenkpe nkpaa. <verse eid="2CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 1:16" />Ɔya baaya Solomon bapɔnkɔ baakyeko Egipte ku Kue baawako- ɔka asaa bayatɛ niaya ma baakyeko Kue. <verse eid="2CH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 1:17" />Baaya keke wɔ di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni onwii di Egipte fɛle koto fututu bakilo bakuɛnsĩ, pɔnkɔ onwii kafɔɔ fɛle bakilo banyɔ okle. Mansunsũ ma kafɔɔ manta Heti batii ku Siria batii baka bamuu.<verse eid="2CH 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Suoto Ololaa Ɔta Olekatakɔ Nwu Otofo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 2:1" />Solomon lata osuku alɛ batofo olekatakɔ bata SAATE nwu Leyooto ku lɛkayo bata nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ. <verse eid="2CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 2:2" />Aadiki batii nkpe afosi-akuɛnsĩ fɛ atoo batukatɛ ku batii nkpe afosi-anɛ fɛ afuɔ babiɛtɛ di akpenkpe nwu ku batii nkpe ntiɛ-alafa-akuɔ kafɔɔ fɛ ɔkpɛ banyuntɛ di bakpɛntɛ nwu suoto.<verse eid="2CH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 2:3" />Solomon lata Tiro ɔka Huram kanya ka mmle alɛ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 2:3">“Kyesee mi sidar awosoku fɛ mmle faabla faata ni teemi Dawid di obe wɔ faakyesee nwɔ ni sidar sewoso aatofo ni lɛkayo aasiɛ ni kaamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 2:4" />Nyu, nfɛ kɔwa olekatakɔ ɔbatofo ɔta SAATE Yaa nii Leyooto, ninkleklesa ni ntɔɔ diɛta ni olufui kɔnɔnkɔnɔ ofiɛ di anu nɔɔ, ninta bloblo wɔ beekleklesa ni odiki otika obe biala, ninta kafɔɔ ofiɛ asaaɔta olesɛ ku kɔtɔɔfɔ biala ku Anyɛɛtɛyi ku Awɛntɛ Fɔle ku ayi ole ya bɛɛtɛ bɛɛta ni SAATE Yaa loo ole. Nle mmle ninle ɔsaabla wɔ nimate kunta ni Israel dinaa ni kaloo nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 2:5" />“Olekatakɔ ka kɔɔwa ni ɔbatofo kamamuɔ, diekye Yaa loo lemuɔ alenke bayaa bamba bamuu. <verse eid="2CH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 2:6" />Kafɔɔ owe nimafuo olekatakɔ otofo ɔtɔɔ, di obe wɔ di osi, bia osi-osi wɔ niɛtaka katoo dilenke ni diemuɔ ditɔɔ ni? Ni owe nfɛ di ami nle alɛ katofo olekatakɔ ntɔɔ, dilenkee lɛba le babata ni ofiɛ seleɔta di anu nɔɔ?<verse eid="2CH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 2:7" />“Nioso, kyesee mi otii wɔ ninkpe ni lɛsaatofo di koto sɛɛle, koto fututu, abɔɔsaa sɛɛle ku abɔɔsaa wɛɛfɛɛ, ku abula fɛnɛnɛɛ ya niɛbla ni fɛ ɔsɛɛ, asɛɛle-bɔmbɔ ku bluu ale, aye ni kamɛ nwaa kafɔɔ di mmle manwola kɔkpana mantika ni di asaa suoto, alɛ aabla ɔkpɛ di Yuda ku Yerusalem manko batii nii ba nin-ye ni nnɛɛ kamɛ sɛkpɛ, mba di teemi Dawid lata ni.<verse eid="2CH 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 2:8" />“Kyesee mi kafɔɔ sidar, odum sewoso ku sewoso se niefũ ni kɔya fakyeko Lebanon, diekye n-ye nlɛ batii lɛfɔ n-ye awoso obudi kamɛ nwaa ninfa. Batii nii kamabla ɔkpɛ ku bale fɔ <verse eid="2CH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 2:9" />alɛ baatɛɛ sewoso kpinwu, diekye dikpeni olekatakɔ ka kamatofo ni lemuɔ kɛɛlɛ kafɔɔ onyu nwaa. <verse eid="2CH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 2:10" />Kamata bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ, bakpɛmblatɛ ba nimbudi ni awoso, akpaa fɛ bakankyi nkpe kɔlafa lefosi, kamɔɔ fɛ bakankyi nkpe kɔlafa lefosi, nta fɛ abukii nkpe kɔlafa-lefosi ku awosobi nnɔnyi fɛ bakpoko nkpe kɔlafa-lefosi.”<verse eid="2CH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 2:11" />Tiro ɔka Huram ladiki kanya di kukũ ɔkpana kamɛ aata Solomon alɛ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 2:11">“Ta SAATE nwu mbɔmbɔ ni batii nɔɔ oso, ni atɔɔbla fɔ ɔka lɛma nɛ.”<verse eid="2CH 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 2:12" />Huram lakple aabuɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 2:12">“Baatansa SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa nwu, nnwɔ niɛbla ni osi ku kasɔ! Nnwɔɔ niɛta ɔka Dawid obisuɔtɔbi numbentɛ, ɛɛtɔɔ lɛsaatofo ku lɛsɔnu, nnwɔ nimatofo ni olekatakɔ anta ni SAATE nwu ku lɛkayo anta ni nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ.<verse eid="2CH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 2:13" />“Kokyesee fɔ Huram-Abi. Ale otii wɔ nin-ye ni kɔnɛɛ kamɛ sɛkpɛ kpinwu, <verse eid="2CH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 2:14" />di ɔya lakye ni Dan banantii kamɛ di ote kafɔɔ lakye ni Tiro. Eefũ lɛnanfi di koto sɛɛle ku koto fututu, lɛbɔɔsaa sɛɛle ku lɛbɔɔsaa wɛɛfɛɛ, difuɔ ku owoso, dibula biene fɛnɛnɛɛ le niɛbla ni fɛ ɔsɛɛ ku bluu ku lɛsɛɛle bɔmbɔ ɔkpɛ ɔbla suoto. Aye kamɛ nwaa di mmle manwola ni kɔkpana kumuu ateate mantika ni di asaa suoto, an-fuo kafɔɔ letembi lele bɛɛtɔɔ alɛ abla ni ɔbla. Ababla ɔkpɛ ku batii lɛfɔ ba nin-ye ni nnɛɛ kamɛ sɛkpɛ ku mba ninle ni saate nii, teefɔ Dawid bale.<verse eid="2CH 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 2:15" />“Kanunua yi, ta saate nii akyesee bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ akpaa ku kamɔɔ ku awosobi nnɔnyi ku nta be aabuɛ aatɛ alɛ abata ni, <verse eid="2CH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 2:16" />bubabudi sewoso nwu simuu foomiɛ ni munkyeko Lebanon, muntikasĩ di seklo suoto munfenko di lekpo suoto munsooko munwako Yopa. Nfɛ faafuo sĩ ɔyɔ ninfa fansifiko Yerusalem.”<verse eid="2CH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 2:17" />Solomon laka bafɔɔ ba bamuu niawɛ ni di Israel, di ote Dawid batii ɔka wɔ aaka ni sɛmaa; ni baawɛ batii nkpe kɔlafa afosi-anɔɔ-nkpe ntiɛ-alafa akuɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 2:18" />Ni aata batii nkpe afosi-akuɛnsĩ lɛma alɛ bale atoo batukatɛ, aata kafɔɔ nkpe afosi-anɛ alɛ bale afuɔ babiɛtɛ di akpenkpe, di ɔkpɛ banyuntɛ nkpe ntiɛ alafa-akuɔ di suoto lɛma alɛ baatoonyu batii nwu mantɔɔbla ɔkpɛ nwu nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon Latofo Olekatakɔ Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 3:1" />Ninfɛ di Solomon lakyekasɔ aatootofo SAATE nwu olekatakɔ di Yerusalem di Moria Kobokote osi nɛ, di nfũ di SAATE nwu ladiki suoto aatuo ni ote Dawid. Yebus otii nwu Ornan kakpaa kaale, lɛba le di Dawid ladiki aata nii. <verse eid="2CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 3:2" />Solomon lakye katofosɔ di Israel batii kɔwɛntɛ nyɔɔfa dii nyɔɔfa suoto di sɛka nɔɔ ole lɛlɛɛ naafa kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 3:3" />Lɛsɔse le di Solomon lase aata ni Yaa olekatakɔ nwu otofo lɛkaana labla nkpaa afosi-anaasĩ, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ labla nkpaa afosi-atiɛ (di lɛklapoosaa kofole kanya nɛ). <verse eid="2CH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 3:4" />Lɛkpata nwu di olekatakɔ anu lɛkaana labla nkpaa afosi-atiɛ diasana diafe olekatakɔ nwu lɛblɛfɛ kanya, lɛtaka kafɔɔ labla nkpaa kɔlafa afosi-anɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 3:4">Aayɔ koto sɛɛle nwaa aakakaasa kaamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 3:5" />Aayɔ odum ntaaboo aapɛ aakyisa lɛkpata nwu nimu, ni aatĩtĩi mi ku koto sɛɛle nwaa, ni aabla awɔsɔ ku kɔnyɛnɛ atembi aatika di suoto ninya nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 3:6" />Aakpee olekatakɔ nwu sɛlɛ ku afuɔ ya niefũ ni kɔya. Koto sɛɛle ko aablako ni ɔkpɛ kafɔɔ lale Parwaim koto sɛɛle. <verse eid="2CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 3:7" />Aayɔ koto sɛɛle aafifia di sɛkyan-woso, kayokontũ sewoso, seyoyiɛ ku olekatakɔ nwu akloo suoto, ni aawola kerubim atembi aatitika di seyoyiɛ nwu suoto nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 3:8" />Aatofo Kakleklekɔ Kaamɛ Kakleklekɔ, di lɛkaana nini lakyɛkyɛ ni ku olekatakɔ nwu lɛblɛfɛ- lɛkaana labla nkpaa afosi-atiɛ, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ labla nkpaa afosi-atiɛ. Aayɔ koto sɛɛle nwaa onutũ bakilo afosi-anyɔ nkpe ntiɛ aatĩtĩi kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 3:9" />Koto sɛɛle sibuɛ onutũ labla fɛ kilo ɔfã okle. Aatĩtĩi kafɔɔ osi lɛkyɛ ku koto sɛɛle.<verse eid="2CH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 3:10" />Aabla bakerubim banyɔ aase di Kakleklekɔ Kaamɛ Kakleklekɔ nwu ni aatĩtĩi nya ku koto sɛɛle nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 3:11" />Bakerubim nwu afoko amuu lɛkaana labla fɛle nkpaa afosi-atiɛ. Kerubim nwu kasale kofoko kunwii lɛkaana labla nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ-anɛɛkpa-akuɔ dialakaa di olekatakɔ nwu oyoyiɛ, di kofoko nyɔɔfa nini kafɔɔ labla ni fɛle nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ-anɛɛkpa-akuɔ, diakaa ni di kerubim nwu nyɔɔfa kofoko. <verse eid="2CH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 3:12" />Nkpo okle di kerubim nyɔɔfa nwu kofoko kunwii labla fɛle nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ-anɛɛkpa-akuɔ dialakaa di olekatakɔ nwu oyoyiɛ nyɔɔfa, kofoko nyɔɔfa nini kafɔɔ lɛkaana labla fɛle nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ-anɛɛkpa-akuɔ, dialakaa di kerubim kofoko kasale nwu suoto nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 3:13" />Bakerubim ba mmle afoko lɛblɛfɛ lawo nkpaa afosi-atiɛ. Baayila di nkpaa ninya suoto, baakyɔɔ lɛkpata kplɛ nwu anu.<verse eid="2CH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 3:14" />Solomon lata baabla dibula le mansaka ni di leyo ku sikũ bluu ku n-se niɛbla ni fɛ ɔsɛɛ ku okũ sɛɛle bɔmbɔ ku dibula biene fɛnɛnɛɛ, ku kerubim letembi baakpee ni kaamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Labla Abɔɔsaa Sɛɛle Nkyɛ Nnyɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 3:15" />Baabla akpaka anyɔ di olekatakɔ nwu anu, di amuu lɛkaana labla ni nkpaa afosi-anɔɔ-nnyɔ, dibiala lawɛ ditikasaa di osi di lɛkaana labla ni nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ-anɛɛkpa-akuɔ. <verse eid="2CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 3:16" />Aaloso anyɛnɛ aayɔ aatika di akpaka nwu osi. Aabla kafɔɔ awosobi ya ninte ni fɛle goowa kɔlafa, aayɔ nya aakyasa di anyɛnɛ nwu suoto. <verse eid="2CH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 3:17" />Aatakatɛ akpaka nwu aase di olekatakɔ nwu anu, ninwii layila di kala kasɔ lɛkyɛ ninwii kafɔɔ layila di katookasɔ lɛkyɛ. Aata nle niayila ni di kalakasɔ leyooto alɛ Yakin, katookasɔ lele kafɔɔ alɛ Boas.<verse eid="2CH 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Olekatakɔ Nwu Kamɛ Asaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 4:1" />Ɔka Solomon lata baabla abɔɔsaa sɛɛle oleɔta akyikye, lɛkaana labla nkpaa afosi-atiɛ, lɛblɛfɛ nkpaa afosi-atiɛ, lɛtaka kafɔɔ labla lefosi nkpaa nnɔɔ. <verse eid="2CH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 4:2" />Aayɔ lɛbɔɔsaa aabla bɛɛsi fɛle lekpo, di letembi munumunu kanya, atokosi nimunumunu labla lefosi nkpaa nnɔɔ, lɛtaka kafɔɔ labla nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ-anɛɛkpa-akuɔ. Nse bɛɛklapoosa ni beekyisa kafɔɔ yi, diabla nkpaa afosi-ana-nnɔɔ. <verse eid="2CH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 4:3" />Di bɛɛsi nwu atokosi kalɔ yi, baabla kukuiikuii baakyisa ni- di lefosi biala obo kɔkpaa kunwii late nii. Baabla kukuiikuii nwu di ɛkaa ɛnyɔ diakaa di bɛɛsi nwu suoto.<verse eid="2CH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 4:4" />Lekpo bɛɛsi nwu latika di banankyue-suɔtɔ lefosi-banyɔ suoto, batiɛ lakyɔɔ anu katookasɔ, batiɛ lakyɔɔ anu kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ, batiɛ lakyɔɔ anu kalakasɔ, batiɛ kafɔɔ lakyɔɔ anu kufĩ katunkɔ. Lekpo bɛɛsi nwu latika ma di suoto, akyeke lɛma kafɔɔ lawɛ di kamɛ lɛkyɛ. <verse eid="2CH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 4:5" />Lekpo bɛɛsi nwu opĩ lawo anɛɛkpa atiɛ, atokosi nɔɔ kafɔɔ late fɛle opũ atokosi, fɛle atoto ya niefukuti nii. Diaklee ntu bakpoko fɛle lefosi-nkpe-nnɛ.<verse eid="2CH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 4:6" />Ninfɛ baabla babɛɛsi lefosi ba manfoto ni suoto, aayɔ banɔɔ aase di kalakasɔ lɛkyɛ, aayɔ kafɔɔ banɔɔ aase di katookasɔ lɛkyɛ. Nnya kamɛ mansakatɛ asaa ya babayɔ manta ni ofiɛ asaaɔta nɛ, kafɔɔ olebatatɛ nwu nin-yɔ Lekpo babɛɛsi nwu manfoto suoto.<verse eid="2CH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 4:7" />Baabla koto sɛɛle kandiɛ atikasaa lefosi di mmle bɛɛtɛ bɛɛta nya ni kanya, ni aayɔ nya aase di olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ nɛ, anɔɔ di kalakasɔ lɛkyɛ anɔɔ kafɔɔ di katookasɔ lɛkyɛ.<verse eid="2CH 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 4:8" />Baabla sipunu lefosi, ni baayɔ sĩ baase di olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ nɛ, ɛnɔɔ di kalakasɔ lɛkyɛ, ɛnɔɔ kafɔɔ di katookasɔ lɛkyɛ. Baabla kafɔɔ koto sɛɛle babɛɛsi kɔlafa.<verse eid="2CH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 4:9" />Baabla olebatatɛ kaflɔnkɔ, ku kaflɔnkɔ kplɛ ku akloo aata kaflɔnkɔ nwu, ni aatĩtĩi akloo nwu ku abɔɔsaa sɛɛle nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 4:10" />Ni baayɔ Lekpo bɛɛsi nwu baase di kalakasɔ lɛkyɛ, di olekatakɔ nwu kalakasɔ oletanɛɛkyɛ di kufĩ katunkɔ lɛkyɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 4:11" />Huram labla kafɔɔ abukii ku basoofi ku babɛɛsi ba manwanwayi in asaa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 4:11">Nioso Huram laloo ɔkpɛ wɔ aaklee ni ɔbla ɔta Ɔka Solomon di Yaa olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ:<verse eid="2CH 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 4:12" />Aabla akpaka nwu anyɔ;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:12">atikasaa munumunu anyɔ aatika di akpaka nwu osi;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:12">anyɛnɛ anyɔ aasakasa di atikasaa munumunu nwu di akpaka nwu osi;<verse eid="2CH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 4:13" />awosobi ya ninte ni fɛle goowa alafa-ana ya aabla aata ni anyɛnɛ nwu anyɔ (ele ɛnyɔ ɛɛta ni kɔnyɛnɛ biala, aata ni atikasaa munumunu nwu suoto di akpaka nwu osi ololaa);<verse eid="2CH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 4:14" />atikasaa ku babɛɛsi ninya;<verse eid="2CH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 4:15" />Lekpo bɛɛsi nwu ku banankyue-suɔtɔ lefosi-banyɔ nwu di kalɔ nini;<verse eid="2CH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 4:16" />abukii, basoofi, sina amunikĩisasaa ku akpɛmblasaa amuu ɛɛta ni ɔkpɛ nwu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CH 4:16" />
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 4:16">Abɔɔsaa sɛɛle biene di Huram-Abi layɔ aabla asaa ya amuu aabla aata ni Ɔka Solomon aata ni SAATE nwu olekatakɔ. <verse eid="2CH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 4:17" />Ɔka nwu lata baabla nya baakyeko kasɔ kɔtɛ ko di Yordan ɔtaata di Sukot ku Saretan obo. <verse eid="2CH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 4:18" />Asaa ya mmle amuu di Solomon labla ni latɛ aapɔ, nioso batafuo abɔɔsaa sɛɛle nwu onutũ ɔklapoosa.<verse eid="2CH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 4:19" />Solomon kafɔɔ labla asaa ya amuu niayila ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kamɛ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CH 4:19" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:19">koto sɛɛle oleɔta akyikye;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:19">koto sɛɛle sipunu se suoto di bloblo wɔ di SAATE nwu Anu ntika nii;<verse eid="2CH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 4:20" />Koto sɛɛle nwaa kandiɛ atikasaa ku bakandiɛ ninya, alɛ diakpa ni di kamɛ, kaamɛ kakleklekɔ nwu sitũ fɛ mmle bɛɛkpana bɛɛtɛ ni kanya;<verse eid="2CH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 4:21" />koto sɛɛle atoto ɔkpɛ nwu ku bakandiɛ ku kɔmaasa; (koto sɛɛle nwaa kuale);<verse eid="2CH 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 4:22" />koto sɛɛle nwaa kandiɛ sikũ, babɛɛsi ba manwanwanyi ni asaa, nsɛfɛ ku olufui afiɛsaa; ku olekatakɔ koto sɛɛle akloo: kamɛ, kaamɛ akloo ɛɛta ni Kakleklekɔ kaamɛ Kakleklekɔ ku olekatakɔ lɛkpata nwu nimu akloo.<verse eid="2CH 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="2CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 5:1" />Obe wɔ di Solomon laloo ni ɔkpɛ nwu omuu di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ɔbla yi, ni aayɔ asaa ya amuu di ote Dawid lakleklesa ni- aale ni koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle ku olekatakɔ nwu asaa amuu- ni aayɔ nya aalaatɛ di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ asaa katɛkɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baayɔ Kanya Ninii Lɛlakaa Nwu Baawako Olekatakɔ Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 5:2" />Ninfɛ di Solomon lalɛɛ Israel batii banɔɔfo, ana nwu amuu banɔɔfo ku Israel ayo kamɛ baka aawako Yerusalem, alɛ bakatako SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛlakaa nwu bakyeko Dawid okpoo kplɛ nwu, Sion bawako nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 5:3" />Ni di Israel batii bamuu lasi baawa ɔka nwu nfũ di Israel batii kɔwɛntɛ kuɛnsinle dii olebee kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 5:4" />Di Israel banɔɔfo nwu bamuu lawa nii yi, Lewi batii lakɛnkɛ lɛlakaa nwu, <verse eid="2CH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 5:5" />ni baakatako lɛlakaa nwu ku Lɛkpaayo le Mansi ni ku akleklesaa ya amuu ninsi nini kaamɛ baawako nɛ. Olebatatɛ ba niale ni Lewi batii niatuka nya; <verse eid="2CH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 5:6" />ni di Ɔka Solomon ku Israel dikudi nwu nimuu niasi ni di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ layila di lɛlakaa nwu anu, baatɔɔta oleɔta ku bafoso ku banankyue kpinwu, batafuo lɛpɔ lɛma ɔkpana ɔtɛ ee baka ma nii.<verse eid="2CH 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 5:7" />Ninfɛ di olebatatɛ layɔ SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛlakaa nwu baawako kayilakɔ nini di olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ, Kakleklekɔ, kaamɛ Kakleklekɔ nwu baabayɔ ni baase di bakerubim nwu afoko obo nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 5:8" />Bakerubim nwu lafukuti afoko lɛma di lɛlakaa lɛba nwu aatĩi lɛlakaa nwu ku sewoso se mantuka ni nii. <verse eid="2CH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 5:9" />Sewoso se mmle latɛ siakaana alɛ sɛnya nisĩ lalaadu lɛlakaa nwu, nioso baatɔɔnya sĩ di olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ, kaamɛ sitũ. Kafɔɔ batatɔɔnya sĩ di Kakleklekɔ nwu kayi lɛkyɛ; nioso siakple site ninfa diabadu obe wɔ baakpana ni ɔlaa wɔ mmle. <verse eid="2CH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 5:10" />Lɛsalɛsaa ditasiɛ di lɛlakaa nwu kamɛ diediki afuɔ nkyɛ nnyɔ be di Mose layɔ aakpee nini kaamɛ di Horeb lete, nfũ di SAATE nwu labla ni kanya ninii ku Israel batii di obe wɔ baadie ni di Egipte sɛmaa.<verse eid="2CH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 5:11" />Ninfɛ di olebatatɛ nwu ladie di Kakleklekɔ nwu nɛ. Olebatatɛ nwu bamuu ba niawɛ ni ninfa lakleklesa suoto lɛma, batakpee kasɛ di akudi lɛma nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 5:12" />Lewi batii ba bamuu niale ni sinu basantɛ- Asaf, Heman, Yedutun ku babisuɔtɔbi lɛma ku banantii lɛma- layila di oleɔta akyikye nwu di kufĩ katunkɔ lɛkyɛ, baakpee akpeele fɛnɛnɛ biene, ni baatɔɔsa abɔɔsaa anɛɛkya, bakyitaa ku basanku nɛ. Olebatatɛ kɔlafa-afosi-anyɔ lawɛ ku mma baatɔɔfɛ akyukyoo. <verse eid="2CH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 5:13" />Akyukyoo bafɛtɛ ku sinu basantɛ nwu nkyɛkyɛ mammufũ onu ku sɛlɔ sinwii, manta SAATE nwu katansa ku sɛfa ɔpɛ. Baatakatɛ sɛlɔ lɛma katoo ku akyukyoo, abɔɔsaa anɛɛkya ku asansaa bamba di katansa kamɛ baata SAATE nwu, ni baasa alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 5:13">“SAATE nwu nlɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 5:13">lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 5:13">Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ layii ku lelokonkyɛ nɛ, <verse eid="2CH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 5:14" />nioso olebatatɛ nwu ditansinfuo kasumu lɛma ɔkpɛ ɔbla ta lelokonkyɛ nwu oso, diekye SAATE nwu lɛkpa layii Yaa olekatakɔ nwu.<verse eid="2CH 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon Lakakatɛ Aata Israel Batii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 6:1" />Ninfɛ di Solomon labuɛ alɛ, “SAATE nwu labuɛ alɛ abasiɛ di lelokonkyɛ tunutunu kamɛ; <verse eid="2CH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 6:2" />Ntotofo olekatakɔ ka nikɔlɛ ni onyu lɛta fɔ, lɛba le fabasiɛ, dinaa ni kaloo.”<verse eid="2CH 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 6:3" />Obe wɔ di Israel dikudi nwu nimuu layila ni ninfa yi, ɔka nwu lamunikĩi aakyɔɔ ma anu aata ma lɛtɔtrɔ. <verse eid="2CH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 6:4" />Ninfɛ aabuɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 6:4">“Baatansa SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa nwu, nnwɔ nintɔɔbla ni ku nnɛɛ nɔɔ di ɔlaa wɔ aabuɛ ni ku kanya nɔɔ aatɛ aata ni teemi Dawid. Diekye aabuɛ alɛ, <verse eid="2CH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 6:5" />‘Diayɔ ni di dii le lakpaa batii nii ladieko ni di Egipte kasɔ suoto yi, nindiki okpo kplɛ di Israel kɔna kukunwii kamɛ alɛ baatofo olekatakɔ manta Leyooto nii alɛ diate ninfa, ee ndiki otii owo nlɛ ale kanyayilatɛ di batii nii Israel suoto. <verse eid="2CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 6:6" />Kafɔɔ kanunua ntoodiki Yerusalem nlɛ Leyooto nii dite ninfa, ni ntoodiki Dawid nlɛ ale sɛka di batii nii Israel suoto nɛ.’<verse eid="2CH 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 6:7" />“Diasiɛ di teemi Dawid otu kamɛ alɛ ootofo olekatakɔ anta SAATE nwu Leyooto, Israel Yaa nwu. <verse eid="2CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 6:8" />Kafɔɔ SAATE nwu latɔkɔ teemi Dawid alɛ, ‘Ta disi fɔ ni di otu kamɛ falɛ footofo ni olekatakɔ fanta ni Leyooto nii oso yi, feelolaa fɛɛbla alɛ fɛɛwɛ nle mmle di otu lɛfɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 6:9" />Kafɔɔ, diele afɔ ninle nnwɔ ninmatofo ni olekatakɔ nwu, kafɔɔ obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ, nnwɔ ninle ni afɔ omu suoto sina ku ntɔ- nnwɔɔ ninle nnwɔ ninmatofo ni olekatakɔ nwu anta ni Leyooto nii nɛ.’<verse eid="2CH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 6:10" />“SAATE nwu ntɔɔbla di ɔlaa wɔ aabuɛ aatɛ ni suoto. Ntɔɔbale teemi Dawid atesaa ni di kanunua nfɛ nsi di Israel lɛkakpomii suoto fɛ mmle okle di SAATE nwu labuɛ aatɛ nii, ni ntootofo olekatakɔ nwu lɛta SAATE nwu Leyooto, Israel Yaa nwu nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 6:11" />Nfa lɛyɔ kanya ninii lɛlakaa nwu lese nɛ, nle kamɛ di SAATE nwu kanya ninii le aabla ni ku Israel batii nsi nii.”<verse eid="2CH 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 6:12" />Ninfɛ di Solomon layila di SAATE nwu oleɔta akyikye anu di Israel dikudi nwu nimuu anu ni aablɛfɛsa nnɛɛ nɔɔ aakyɔɔ osi nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 6:13" />Solomon labla abɔɔsaa sɛɛle akpa, lɛkaana labla nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ-anɛɛkpa-akuɔ, lɛblɛfɛ nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ-anɛɛkpa-akuɔ, lɛtaka kafɔɔ nkpaa nna-anɛɛkpa-akuɔ, ni aayɔ ni aase di kayi kaflɔnkɔ ntɛɛntɛɛ nɛ. Aayie aayila di akpa nwu suoto ni aapɛ akunkyi di Israel dikudi nwu nimuu anu ni aablɛfɛsa nnɛɛ nɔɔ aakyɔɔ osi nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 6:14" />Ni aabuɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 6:14">“Oo SAATE, Israel Yaa, Yaa kuonwii nnaa ate ni fɛle afɔ di osi ee kasɔ suoto- afɔ wɔ ninklee ni lɛbɔmbɔ kanya ninii lɛfɔ ku bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ba ninwini mankyɛ ni di osuku lɛfɔ suoto ku otu lɛma omuu. <verse eid="2CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 6:15" />Fatɔɔbla di ɔlaa wɔ faabuɛ faatɛ faata ni kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ teemi Dawid; ku kanya lɛfɔ faabuɛ faatɛ ku kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ kafɔɔ fatɔɔbla ni- fɛ mmle dite ni miɛ.<verse eid="2CH 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 6:16" />“Kanunua SAATE, Israel Yaa, bla fata kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ teemi Dawid sɛlaa se faabuɛ faatɛ faatɔɔ ni di obe wɔ faabuɛ ni falɛ, ‘Dilɔbawa diidii alɛ faawɛ otii aasiɛ ni di Israel lɛkakpomii suoto di anu nii, nse babisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ lelolaa beenyu di asaa ya amuu bɔɔbla ni kamɛ, bɛɛkyɛ di anu nii di kufiofa nii kanya, fɛ mmle fatɔɔbla nii.’ <verse eid="2CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 6:17" />Kanunua kafɔɔ yi, Oo SAATE, Israel Yaa, ta ɔlaa lɛfɔ wɔ faabuɛ faatɛ faata ni kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kuwa kaanya.<verse eid="2CH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 6:18" />“Kafɔɔ kubio, Yaa kamadiki kasiɛ kaasɔ suoto ku batii? Osi, bia osi-osi wɔ niɛtaka katoo dilenke ni diemuɔ dita fɔ. Ni lɛ nfɛ di olekatakɔ ka mmle letofo ni! <verse eid="2CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 6:19" />Oo SAATE Yaa nii, kafɔɔ kyɔɔ atoko di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ɔlaa ɔpɛ ku lekoto le otikiti anta ni nyaami ɔnya suoto. Nu lɛfaa ku ɔlaa ɔpɛ wɔ di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kɔpɛ ni di anu lɛfɔ. <verse eid="2CH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 6:20" />Ta anu lɛfɔ atikiti akyɔɔ olekatakɔ ka mmle anu kakũ ku kakyɛ, di lɛba le mmle faabuɛ ni falɛ fabayɔ Leyooto lɛfɔ fantɛ ni ninfa. Nu ɔlaa ɔpɛ wɔ di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kɔpɛ ni di lɛba le mmle ɛɛkyɔɔ ni anu. <verse eid="2CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 6:21" />Nu kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ku batii lɛfɔ Israel sɛlaa nse bɛɛkyɔɔ anu di lɛba le mmle bɛɛpɛ ɔlaa. Nu fakyeko osi, kasiɛkɔ lɛfɔ; nse feenu kafɔɔ yi, faayɔ fakyɛ.<verse eid="2CH 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 6:22" />“Nse otii lɛbla owo nɔɔ okpile dikaatɛ kafɔɔ alɛ ɛɛka ntam, ɛɛwa ɛɛbaka ntam nwu di oleɔta akyikye lɛfɔ anu di olekatakɔ ka mmle yi, <verse eid="2CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 6:23" />ni faanu fakyeko osi faadiki kɔkpaa. Ka lɛka fata bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ, faata lɛpɔɔ kpitɛ nwu koto, faayɔ lɛsaa le ɛɛbla ni fatika di nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ disi. Ta nnwɔ ole ninkpe ni lɛbɛ, faabla fatɔɔ di lɛbɛ nɔɔ kanya.<verse eid="2CH 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 6:24" />“Nse beelenkee batii lɛfɔ Israel di kakpɛ kamɛ ta bɛɛbla ni okpile di suoto lɛfɔ oso, bɛɛpɛbeekple bɛɛwa bɛɛbadiki sikpile lɛma beebuɛ, bɛɛlɛɛ leyooto lɛfɔ, bɛɛpɛ ɔlaa beetikiti lekoto di anu lɛfɔ di olekatakɔ ka mmle kamɛ yi, <verse eid="2CH 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 6:25" />ni faanu fakyeko osi, faayɔ batii lɛfɔ Israel okpile fakyɛ ma faakplesa ma kafɔɔ fawako kasɔ ka faayɔ faata ma ni ku bate lɛma.<verse eid="2CH 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 6:26" />“Nse fɛɛsɛɛ osi, di kanto kafɔɔ diloosinnɔɔ ta batii lɛfɔ lɛbla ni okpile di suoto lɛfɔ oso, ni nse bɛɛkyɔɔ anu di lɛba le mmle bɛɛlɛɛ leyooto lɛfɔ, beekyi kafɔɔ di sikpile lɛma suoto ta faatɔɔnanfi ma ni kootoko oso yi, <verse eid="2CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 6:27" />ni faanu fakyeko osi, faayɔ kafɔɔ bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ, batii lɛfɔ Israel sikpile fakyɛ ma. Tuo ma osuku biene wɔ suoto baasiɛ ni nkpa, faata kafɔɔ kanto anɔɔ di kasɔ ka faata ni batii lɛfɔ fɛ atesaa.<verse eid="2CH 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 6:28" />“Nse kɔka ee ofiɛ kpile lɛwa di kasɔ nwu suoto, ee alesaa lɛlalaa ee kabiene lɛkpɛ, balososo ee atroee, ee nse balo lɛbamana sekpoo kplɛ lɛma lele beekyi, di anyasaa lele ee ɔfiɛ owo lɛwa yi, <verse eid="2CH 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 6:29" />ni nse Israel otii lɛfɔ lele lɛpɛ ɔlaa ee eetikiti lekoto- di obiala letofo dibuo nɔɔ ku ninyɛnyɛ nɔɔ, ɛɛblɛfɛsa nnɛɛ nɔɔ kafɔɔ ɛɛkyɔɔ olekatakɔ ka mmle yi- <verse eid="2CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 6:30" />ni faanu fakyeko osi, kasiɛkɔ lɛfɔ nwu. Yɔ fakyɛ, fanaanfi otii biala kootoko di asaa ya amuu ɛɛbla ni kanya, di obe wɔ faye ni otu nɔɔ kamɛ (diekye lete lɛfɔ nin-ye batii situ kamɛ), <verse eid="2CH 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 6:31" />alɛ baayɛkɛ fɔ mankyɛ kafɔɔ di sisuku lɛfɔ di obe wɔ omuu basi ni di kasɔ ka faata ni bate loo suoto.<verse eid="2CH 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 6:32" />“Ɔfɔɔ wɔ ninanle ni batii lɛfɔ Israel kafɔɔ eekye ni kasɔ ka niɛkyo ni ɛɛwa ni ta leyooto lɛfɔ kplɛ ku kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ osie ku kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ lɛnaanfi oso yi- nse ɛɛwa ɛɛbakyɔɔ anu di olekatakɔ ka mmle ɛɛpɛ ɔlaa yi, <verse eid="2CH 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 6:33" />ni faanu fakyeko osi, kasiɛkɔ lɛfɔ nwu, faabla lɛsaa lele di ɔfɔɔ nwu lɛkaalɛ eekyeko ni ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ fatɔɔ, di mmle di batii ba bamuu di kasɔ suoto kamatofo ni leyooto lɛfɔ manyɛkɛ fɔ ni kafɔɔ, fɛ mmle di batii lɛfɔ bamu Israel mbla ni, baatofo kafɔɔ alɛ Leyooto lɛfɔ ntika di leyo le mmle ntootofo ni suoto.<verse eid="2CH 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 6:34" />“Nse batii lɛfɔ lɛtaka kakpɛ di balo lɛma suoto, di kakɔ lele feekpee ma, nse bɛɛpɛ ɔlaa bɛɛkyɔɔ anu kafɔɔ di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle feediki ni ku olekatakɔ ka ntootofo lɛta ni Leyooto lɛfɔ yi, <verse eid="2CH 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 6:35" />ni faanu ɔlaa ɔpɛ ku lekoto otikiti lɛma fakyeko osi, faata ma lelenkee.<verse eid="2CH 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 6:36" />“Nse bɛɛbla okpile di suoto lɛfɔ- diekye kuonwii nnaa alɛ nnwɔɔ ambla ni okpile oso yi- fɛɛnya ɔblɔ feekpeeko ma fɛɛyɔ ma feekpee di lo lɛma nnɛɛ, ɛɛmufũ ma eesifiko kasɔ ka niekyo ni fanfanfa ee nka niɛtɛɛtɛɛ nii; <verse eid="2CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 6:37" />nse bɛɛwɛ dikyi di situ lɛma kamɛ di kasɔ ka beemufũ ma beesifiko ni, beekyi di sikpile lɛma, beetikiti fɔ lekoto kafɔɔ di kasɔ ka beemufũ ma beesifiko ni, beebuɛ alɛ, ‘Buɔbla okpile, buɔbla lɛsaa le ninanlɛ nii buodiki kafɔɔ kɔkpaa kpile’; <verse eid="2CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2CH 6:38" />ni nse beekple bɛɛwa ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ ku otu lɛma omuu ku ɔkla lɛma omuu di kasɔ ka baamufũ ma baasifiko ni suoto, bɛɛkyɔɔ anu kafɔɔ di kasɔ ka faata ni bate lɛma, bɛɛkyɔɔ anu di okpoo kplɛ wɔ fatodiki ni, bɛɛkyɔɔ anu kafɔɔ di olekatakɔ ka ntootofo lɛta ni Leyooto lɛfɔ bɛɛpɛ ɔlaa yi; <verse eid="2CH 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2CH 6:39" />ni nu ɔlaa ɔpɛ lɛma ku lekoto otikiti lɛma fakyeko osi, kasiɛkɔ lɛfɔ nwu, faata ma lelenkee. Ni faayɔ fakyɛ batii lɛfɔ ba niabla ni okpile di suoto lɛfɔ.<verse eid="2CH 6:39" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2CH 6:40" />“Kanunua yi, Yaa nii, ta anu lɛfɔ atikiti di atoko lɛfɔ kafɔɔ anu sɛlaa se kɔpɛ nta fɔ ni di lɛba le mmle.<verse eid="2CH 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="qm1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2CH 6:41" />“Oo SAATE Yaa, taka kanunua, faawa ɔnyɛɛ katɛkɔ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="2CH 6:41">afɔ ku lɛlakaa lɛfɔ osie.</para>
  <para style="qm1" vid="2CH 6:41">Oo SAATE Yaa, ta olebatatɛ lɛfɔ bayɔ didiki akpeele bakpee,</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="2CH 6:41">ta baklekletɛ lɛfɔ bapɔ̀ di dibiene lɛfɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 6:41" /></para>
  <para style="qm1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2CH 6:42" />Oo SAATE Yaa, tansĩ otii lɛfɔ wɔ fɛɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="2CH 6:42">Nyuma lɛbɔmbɔ kplɛ le faabuɛ faatɛ faata ni kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ Dawid.”<verse eid="2CH 6:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CH 7" />
  <para style="s1">Olekatakɔ Nwu Kayi-Odiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 7:1" />Di Solomon laloo ni ɔlaa ɔpɛ yi, ɔtɔ lakye osi kuabafiɛ ofiɛ asaaɔta nwu ku seleɔta nwu, ni di SAATE nwu lɛkpa layii olekatakɔ nwu nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 7:2" />Olebatatɛ ditafuo SAATE nwu olekatakɔ obuo ta SAATE nwu lɛkpa layii nini kamɛ pɔ oso. <verse eid="2CH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 7:3" />Obe wɔ di Israel batii nwu bamuu lanya ni ɔtɔ nwu kosoo kunwa ni kasɔ di SAATE nwu lɛkpa kafɔɔ ntika ni di olekatakɔ nwu osi yi, baapɛ akunkyi di afuɔ ya baatɛtɛɛ ni suoto, baafuusa anu lɛma kaasɔ, baasumu SAATE nwu baapɛ nwɔ sɛfa baabuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 7:3">“SAATE nwu nlɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 7:3">lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.”<verse eid="2CH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 7:4" />Ninfɛ di ɔka nwu ku batii nwu bamuu lata seleɔta di SAATE nwu anu nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 7:5" />Ni di Ɔka Solomon layɔ banankyue nkpe afosi-anyɔ-banyɔ ku bafoso ku batie nkpe kɔlafa-afosi-anyɔ aata ole nɛ. Nioso ɔka nwu ku batii nwu bamuu ladiki Yaa olekatakɔ nwu kayi. <verse eid="2CH 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 7:6" />Olebatatɛ nwu layila di n-yilakɔ lɛma, fɛ mmle di Lewi batii labla ni ku SAATE nwu sinu asansaa ya di Ɔka Dawid labla aata ni SAATE nwu katansa ku n-ya baablako ni ɔkpɛ di obe wɔ aapɛ ni sɛfa, aabuɛ ni alɛ, “Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.” Di Lewi batii kakyɛ nnyɔɔfa yi, olebatatɛ nwu lafɛ akyukyoo lɛma, ni di Israel batii bamuu layiyila ninfa nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 7:7" />Solomon lakleklesa kaflɔnkɔ nwu ntɛɛntɛɛ nwu di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ anu, ni aata ofiɛ asaaɔta ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole lɛla asaaɔta ninfa nɛ. Diekye abɔɔsaa sɛɛle oleɔta akyikye ya aabla ni ditamuɔ aata ofiɛ asaaɔta ku alesaa asaaɔta ku lɛla aba nwu.<verse eid="2CH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 7:8" />Nioso Solomon lale dii ole nwu ayi akuɛnsĩ di obe nwu kamɛ, ku Israel batii ba bamuu niawɛ ni ku nnwɔɔ- kasikɔ kplɛ nwu batii lakye Lebo Hamat dialaadu Egipte Kaklenyii nwu baawa. <verse eid="2CH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 7:9" />Di dii nɛnle suoto baasi dikudi, diekye baale oleɔta akyikye kayi-odiki nwu ayi akuɛnsĩ, ni baale kafɔɔ dii ole nwu ayi akuɛnsĩ baakyakaa nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 7:10" />Di afosi-anyɔ dii tiɛfa di Israel batii kɔwɛntɛ kuɛnsinle suoto aata batii nwu lasifi ayo lɛma. Baasifi ku lɛpɔ̀ ku suoto lɛyɔɔ di otu lɛma kamɛ di asaa biene ya di SAATE nwu ntɔɔbla ɛɛta ni Dawid ku Solomon ku batii nɔɔ Israel.<verse eid="2CH 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lakple Aadiki Suoto Aatuo Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 7:11" />Di Solomon laloo ni SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ku lɛkayo nwu, aafuo ni kafɔɔ asaa ya amuu niasiɛ nwɔ ni diisi alɛ ɔɔbla ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ ku lɛkayo nɔɔ nimu kamɛ ɔbla yi, <verse eid="2CH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 7:12" />ni di SAATE nwu ladiki suoto aatuo nwɔ ku kakyɛ ni aabuɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 7:12">“Ntonu ɔlaa ɔpɛ lɛfɔ, ni ntoodiki lɛba le mmle lɛta suoto nii fɛ olekatakɔ diɛta ni seleɔta nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 7:13" />“Nse lɛsɛɛ osi diɛta alɛ kanto dilosinnɔɔ, ee lɛta balososo lɛlalaasa kasɔ nwu asaa ee lekyesee ofiɛ kpile di batii nii kamɛ, <verse eid="2CH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 7:14" />nse batii nii ba manlɛɛ ni ku leyooto nii, kamawakosa suoto lɛma kasɔ mampɛ ɔlaa kafɔɔ manwolaa anu nii, mankyi di asiosie sisuku lɛma nwu yi, ni kamanu nkyeko osi, n-yɔ kafɔɔ sikpile lɛma nkyɛ ma, n-yɔɔsa kafɔɔ kasɔ lɛma nwu ofiɛ. <verse eid="2CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 7:15" />Kamatikiti anu nii, nkyɔɔ atoko nii kafɔɔ nnu sɛlaa se bɔɔpɛ ni di lɛba le mmle. <verse eid="2CH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 7:16" />Ntodiki olekatakɔ ka mmle lekleklesa ka alɛ Leyooto nii kaate ninfa dinaa ni kaloo. Anu nii ku otu nii kamawɛ ninfa obe lele.<verse eid="2CH 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 7:17" />“Afɔ yi, nse fɛɛkyɛ di anu nii fɛ mmle di teefɔ Dawid labla nii, fɛɛbla kafɔɔ di ɔlaa wɔ omuu lebuɛ nii, feeklee sɛsaabla nii ku afiofa nii yi, <verse eid="2CH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 7:18" />kamase lɛkakpomii lɛfɔ kpinkpĩ, fɛ mmle labla ni kanya ninii ku teefɔ Dawid di obe wɔ labuɛ ni nlɛ, ‘Dilɔbawa alɛ flɔbawɛ otii ale ni sɛka di Israel suoto diidii.’<verse eid="2CH 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 7:19" />“Kafɔɔ nse biemunikĩi biediɛ sɛsaabla ku afiofa ya lɛta ye nii, biɛkyɛ biɛlaasumu bayaa bamba yi, <verse eid="2CH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 7:20" />ni kamabudi Israel ndiki di kasɔ ka layɔ lata ma ni suoto, kamasĩ kafɔɔ olekatakɔ ka mmle ntookleklesa lɛta ni Leyooto nii. Kamabla ni okyonsanu ku lɛmansaa di batii bamuu kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 7:21" />Ni kuntɛ olekatakɔ ka mmle ntɔɔtɛ keefũ leyooto yi, dibabla batii ba bamuu nikɔwaalɛ manfe ni ninfa ɔkpɛ, mambuɛ kafɔɔ alɛ, ‘Obe oso di SAATE nwu lɛbla lɛsaa nwu okle di kasɔ ka mmle suoto ku olekatakɔ ka mmle?’ <verse eid="2CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 7:22" />Ni batii kamadiki kanya alɛ, ‘Ta batoosĩ ni SAATE nwu, bate lɛma Yaa nwu, nnwɔ niakpaa ma aadieko ni di Egipte kasɔ oso yi, ni bɛɛlaapaataa bayaa bamba boosumu, mantɔ nya kafɔɔ nɛ- nkpo oso ɛɛyɔ anyasaa ya mmle amuu ɛɛwako ma di suoto nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 7:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CH 8" />
  <para style="s1">Asaa Ya Di Solomon Lafuo Ni Ɔbla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 8:1" />Di alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ kayɛntɛkɔ, di obe wɔ kamɛ di Solomon latofo ni SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ku lɛkayo nɔɔ nimu yi, <verse eid="2CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 8:2" />Solomon lase sekpoenyii se di Huram latɔɔ ni ose dibudi, ni aata Israel batii lasiɛ sĩ kaamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 8:3" />Ninfɛ di Solomon lakyɛ Hamat-Soba aalaafũ nwu nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 8:4" />Aabudi kafɔɔ Tadmor di ɔfafuu kamɛ ku asaakatɛkɔ sekpoo kplɛ se simuu aabudi ni di Hamat. <verse eid="2CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 8:5" />Aase Bet-Horon Katoo ku Bet-Horon Kala dibudi fɛ sekpoo se baatofo seyoyiɛ baakyisa ni ku n-yoko ku abɔɔsaa, <verse eid="2CH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 8:6" />diakyakaa ni ku Baalat ku asaakatɛkɔ sekpoo kplɛ nɔɔ simuu, ku sekpoo kplɛ simuu siɛta ni bakeke nɔɔ ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni ku bapɔnkɔ nɔɔ- ku lɛsaa lele aamiɛ alɛ ootofo ni di Yerusalem, Lebanon ku nsɔ be mmuu suoto aale ni sɛka kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 8:7" />Batii ba bamuu niabu ni baakye ni Hiti batii, Amori batii, Perisi batii, Hawi batii ku Yebusi batii kamɛ (batii ba mmle ditale Israel batii), <verse eid="2CH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 8:8" />mma niale banantii lɛma ba niabu ni di kasɔ nwu suoto di Israel batii ditawɔɔsa ni nɛ- mba mmle di Solomon layɔ aabla balanle nɔɔ ɔkpɛ sienle bablatɛ nɛ, fɛ mmle dite diɛbadu ni mmiɛ dii le mmle nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 8:9" />Kafɔɔ Solomon ditabla Israel batii balanle aata ɔkpɛ nɔɔ; aayɔ Israel batii aabla bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ, ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ banɔɔfo kanyabayilatɛ, ku kanyabayilatɛ di bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni ku bakatɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="2CH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 8:10" />Baale kafɔɔ Ɔka Solomon banɔɔfotii-nɔɔfo- banɔɔfotii alafa-anyɔ-afosi-anɔɔ ba niatoonyu ni batii ba niatɔɔbla ni sɛkpɛ.<verse eid="2CH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 8:11" />Solomon lakpaa Farao obisankobi aakyeko Dawid Okpoo kplɛ nwu aawako lɛkayo le aatofo aatɔɔ nii, diekye aabuɛ alɛ, “Ɔsɔfɔ nii dilɔbasiɛ di Israel ɔka Dawid lɛkayo kamɛ, diekye abaya di SAATE nwu lɛlakaa ntoobuo ni lɛbla Klekle.”<verse eid="2CH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 8:12" />Di SAATE nwu oleɔta akyikye ya aapɛ ni di lɛkpata nwu anu yi, Solomon lata ofiɛ asaaɔta seleɔta aata SAATE nwu, <verse eid="2CH 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 8:13" />fɛ mmle kanya diakaatɛɛ diɛta ni dii biala asaaɔta wɔ di Mose latɛ aata ni Anyɛɛtɛyi, Awɛntɛ Fɔle ku lɛlɛɛ ɔkyaka ayi ole sitiɛ nwu- Bloblo wɔ Ninantaka ni Dii ole, Banawɔkyi Dii ole ku Akpanta Dii ole nwu. <verse eid="2CH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 8:14" />Di mmle aale ni kufiofa ko di ote Dawid latɛ nii yi, Solomon lase olebatatɛ nwu akudi aata sɛkpɛ lɛma. Lewi batii male katũ di katansa sinu, mankyakaako olebatatɛ kafɔɔ di dii biala sɛsaabla kanya. Aadiki kafɔɔ n-yoko banyuntɛ di akudi kanya aase di n-yoko ateate kanya, diekye nkpo niale nle di Yaa otii nwu Dawid labuɛ aatɛ ni nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 8:15" />Batakyi kamaa di afiofa ya di ɔka nwu lakpee aata ni olebatatɛ ee Lewi batii di osuku kuninwii suoto, diakyakaa ni di ato-ntɛkɔ nwu.<verse eid="2CH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 8:16" />Baaloo Solomon ɔkpɛ nwu omuu ɔbla, diayɔ ni di dii le baase ni SAATE nwu olekatakɔ lɛsɔse dialaadu ni obe wɔ baaloo ni nii. Nioso baaloo SAATE nwu olekatakɔ otofo.<verse eid="2CH 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 8:17" />Ninfɛ di Solomon lasifi Esion Geber ku Elot di Edom lekpo kotoko nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 8:18" />Ni di Huram lakyesee Solomon seklo kplɛ ku nnwɔɔ omu seklo kamɛ banɔɔfotii, batii ba niatofo ni lekpo kamɛ nwaa. Mba mmle ku Solomon batii lasiɛ seklo nwu baakyɛ Ofir baalaayɔ koto sɛɛle bakilo fɛ lefosi nkpe-nnɔɔ baawako, ni baayɔ kũ baawako Ɔka Solomon nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CH 9" />
  <para style="s1">Seba Ɔkasanko Lawa Solomon Ɔkyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 9:1" />Di Seba ɔkasanko lanu ni Solomon leyooto yi, ni aawa Yerusalem aabasɔ nwɔ aanyu ku sɛlaa kaalɛle se ninkpe ni osie nɛ. Aawa aababuo Yerusalem ku atoo kpinwu- ku kapubapɔnkɔ ba niatuka ni akɔnɔkɔnɔsaa, koto sɛɛlɛ kpinwu, ku afuɔ ya niefũ ni kɔya- ɔsanko nwu lawa Solomon nfũ aabakakatɛko nwɔ ku sɛlaa se simuu niasiɛ nwɔ ni di disi kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 9:2" />Ni di Solomon ladiki sɛlaa kaalɛle nɔɔ simuu kanya nɛ; lɛsalɛsaa kuninwii ditawɛ nwɔ osie ku kasɔ odiki ɔta ɔkasanko nwu. <verse eid="2CH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 9:3" />Di Seba ɔkasanko nwu lanya ni Solomon ninumbe, ku lɛkayo le aatofo nii, <verse eid="2CH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 9:4" />alesaa ya di opunu nɔɔ suoto, banɔɔfotii nɔɔ nsiɛkɔ, akpeele ya di bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ lakpee nii, akpeele ya di nta banyɛɛnɛtɛ nɔɔ lakpee nii, ku ofiɛ asaaɔta ya anta ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ yi, diabla ɔkasanko nwu ɔkpɛ.<verse eid="2CH 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 9:5" />Ni aatɔkɔ ɔka Solomon alɛ, “Ɔlaa wɔ lanu ni di kale nii kamu lakyeko ni asaa ya fatɔɔbla ni ku ninumbe lɛfɔ nte nkpo. <verse eid="2CH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 9:6" />Kafɔɔ ntafũ ɔlaa wɔ baabuɛ ni lanu diediki ntɔɔwa lɛbanya ku anu nii amu. Nwaako, batatɔkɔ mi bia ninumbe lɛfɔ kplɛ nwu kakyɛ nini; fatɔɔwaalɛ sɛlaa se lanu ni fanfa. <verse eid="2CH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 9:7" />Nyu mmle di disi nlɛ ni batii lɛfɔ! Nyu mmle di suoto kɔyɔɔ ni banɔɔfotii lɛfɔ ba ninyila ni di anu lɛfɔ obe lele. man-nu ni kafɔɔ ninumbe lɛfɔ nwu! <verse eid="2CH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 9:8" />Baatansa SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ nwu, nnwɔ feebuo ni anu ɛɛyɔ fɔ eesiɛsa ni di SAATE nwu lɛkakpomii suoto fɛ ɔka, alɛ faale sɛka fanta ni SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ nwu. Ta Yaa lɛfɔ lɛbɔmbɔ le akpe ɛɛta ni Israel ku mmle dile nwɔ ni dibiesaa alɛ ɔɔtakatɛsa ma ni katoo dinaa ni kaloo, oso eese fɔ ɔka di suoto lɛma, alɛ faaka lɛka tinini ku sɛsaabla tinini nɛ.”<verse eid="2CH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 9:9" />Ninfɛ di ɔkasanko nwu lata ɔka koto sɛɛle onutũ fɛ bakilo nkpe-nna, akɔnɔkɔnɔsaa kpinwu, ku afuɔ ya niefũ ni kɔya nɛ. Diidii kuonwii ditasinwako akɔnɔkɔnɔsaa kpinwu ya mmle okle fɛ n-ya di Seba ɔkasanko nwu lata ni Ɔka Solomon.<verse eid="2CH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 9:10" />(Huram batii ku Solomon batii lakyeko koto sɛɛle Ofir baawako; baayɔ kafɔɔ sewoso se niafũ ni kɔya ku afuɔ ya niafũ ni kɔya kpinwu baawako. <verse eid="2CH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 9:11" />Ni di Ɔka Solomon layɔ sewoso nwu niafũ ni kɔya aabla nkatakɔ aata SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ku lɛkayo nwu nɛ, baabla kafɔɔ bakyitaa ku basanku baata sinu basantɛ. Badisin-nya lɛsalɛsaa fɛ nnya nkpo okle diidii di Yuda.)<verse eid="2CH 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 9:12" />Ɔka Solomon lata Seba ɔkasanko nwu asaa ya amuu oomiɛ ni, aakaalɛ nwɔ nii; aata ɔkasanko nwu asaa aalenkesa n-ya aawako nwɔ nii. Ninfɛ di ɔsanko nwu ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ lakple baasifi kale lɛma kamu nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔka Solomon Lɛsaawɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 9:13" />Koto sɛɛle ko di Solomon nfũ ni lɛlɛɛ biala onutũ labla bakilo nkpe afosi-anyɔ-nnyɔ, <verse eid="2CH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 9:14" />di akpooto ya di asaa-bayatɛ ku asaa basunsũtɛ nkyeko manwako ni diesi ni kaamɛ. Arabia baka bamuu ku kasɔ nwu abaa kanyabayilatɛ kafɔɔ nkyeko koto sɛɛle ku koto fututu manwako Solomon.<verse eid="2CH 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 9:15" />Ɔka Solomon labla koto sɛɛle bɛɛbɛntɛ ni kubiafunsaa kplɛ alafa-anyɔ; kubidifunsaa biala lafũ fɛ koto sɛɛle bɛɛbɛntɛ ni bakilo bakuɔ. <verse eid="2CH 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 9:16" />Aabla kafɔɔ koto sɛɛle bɛɛbɛntɛ ni kubiafunsaa biibii alafa-atiɛ, di kubidifunsaa biala lafũ ni fɛle koto sɛɛle bakilo banyɔ. Ni di ɔka layɔ nya aalaatɛ di lɛba le bɔɔlɛɛ ni Lebanon Lepoo Lɛkayo kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 9:17" />Ninfɛ di ɔka labla lɛkakpomii kplɛ ku bato anyɛɛ, aayɔ koto sɛɛle nwaa aakakaasa nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 9:18" />Lɛkakpomii nwu lawɛ nkatakɔ nkuɔ, baabla kafɔɔ nkpaa ditikasaa baakaasa ninni. Di lekpomii nwu sɛlɔɔkɔ nwu nnyɔ yi, nnɛɛ ntikakɔ lawɛ, di kyata layila ni di kabiala ɔlɔɔkɔ. <verse eid="2CH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 9:19" />Bakyata lefosi-banyɔ layila di nkatakɔ nkuɔ nwu suoto, di onwii, onwii layila ni di kakatakɔ nwu biala kayɛntɛlekɔ. Badibla nninkpo okle di sɛka kalekɔ bamba kukanwii diidii. <verse eid="2CH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 9:20" />Koto sɛɛle baayɔ baabla Ɔka Solomon sipũ simuu, leyo kamɛ awansaa amuu di Lebanon Lepoo Lɛkayo nwu kamɛ kafɔɔ lale koto sɛɛle nwaa. Batayɔ koto fututu baabla lɛsalɛsaa, diekye baanyu alɛ koto fututu diedie lɛsalɛsaa di Solomon obe kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 9:21" />Ɔka lawɛ seklo se niatɔɔkyɛ ni lekpo osi manaaya ni asaa, Huram batii niatɔɔwa seklo nwu. Di alɛɛ atiɛ biala kamɛ yi, seklo nwu nkple sinwa ninwii, batuka ni koto sɛɛle, koto fututu, bato anyɛɛ, bakuo ku basɛ̀.<verse eid="2CH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 9:22" />Ɔka Solomon lawɛ lɛsaawɛ kplɛ ku ninumbe aalenkee kasɔ ka mmle baka bule bamuu. <verse eid="2CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 9:23" />Kasɔ ka mmle baka bamuu nkyɛ Solomon ɔkyɛ manaanu ninumbe le di Yaa lɛyɔ eekpee ni di otu nɔɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 9:24" />Lɛlɛɛ biala yi, otii biala niɛkyɛ ɔkyɛ nɔɔ nkyɛnko nwɔ lɛkyɛsaa- fɛ koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle awansaa, ku akpeele, akpɛsaa ku akɔnɔkɔnɔsaa, bapɔnkɔ ku babɔkɛɛ ba ninte ni fɛ pɔnkɔ.<verse eid="2CH 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 9:25" />Solomon lawɛ bapɔnkɔ ayo nkpe nna aata bapɔnkɔ ku bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni, ku bapɔnkɔ basiɛtɛ nkpe lefosi-nnyɔ, mma aayɔ aase di bakeke sekpoo kplɛ nwu ku ɔkyɛ nɔɔ di Yerusalem nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 9:26" />Solomon lale sɛka di baka bamuu suoto diayɔ ni di Eufrate Okle dialaase di Filisti batii kasɔ, dialaadu bia Egipte kasɔ kɔmɛ. <verse eid="2CH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 9:27" />Ɔka lata koto fututu labawɛ di Yerusalem fɛ afuɔ, sedar kafɔɔ labapɔ fɛ kowoso ko manlɛɛ ni sikamɔ-abue awoso di akpenkpe nkpaa. <verse eid="2CH 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 9:28" />Ɔklaa baaklaa Solomon bapɔnkɔ nwu baakyeko Egipte ku nnle bamba mmuu baawako.<verse eid="2CH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Sɛka Ole Sɛlaa Kakui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 9:29" />Asaa bule ya di Solomon labla ni di sɛka olebee nɔɔ kamɛ, diayɔ ni di kasɔ kakyekɔ dialaase ni di kayɛntɛlekɔ nnya yi, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Nathan sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ, di Silo otii nwu Ahiya ɔlaa obuɛ ɔtɛ kamɛ, ku odiki otuo wɔ di asaanyatɛ Ido lanya aakyeko ni Nebat obisuɔtɔbi Yeroboam suoto. <verse eid="2CH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 9:30" />Solomon lale sɛka di Israel omuu suoto di Yerusalem alɛɛ afosi-ana. <verse eid="2CH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 9:31" />Ninfɛ aatɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ, ni baakookaa nwɔ di ote Dawid okpoo kplɛ nwu nɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Rehoboam layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 9:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CH 10" />
  <para style="s1">Katookasɔ Kɔna Lataka Baayila Di Rehoboam Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 10:1" />Rehoboam lakyɛ Sekem, diekye Israel batii bamuu lasifi nfa alɛ bɔɔlase nwɔ sɛka. <verse eid="2CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 10:2" />Obe wɔ di Nebat obisuɔtɔbi Yeroboam lanu ni ɔlaa wɔ mmle yi, (aawɛ di Egipte, nfũ aatoso ni Ɔka Solomon anu aasifi nii), ni aakple aadie di Egipte aawa nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 10:3" />Nioso baakpee baalaalɛɛ Yeroboam baawako, ni di nnwɔɔ ku Israel omuu lakyɛ Rehoboam ɔkyɛ baalaatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ: <verse eid="2CH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 10:4" />“Teefɔ letukasa wo atoo nutũle, kafɔɔ nunua kɔkɔlɛ ɔkpɛ sienle nwu ku atoo nutũle nwu eetukasa wo ni, ni bubasumu fɔ.”<verse eid="2CH 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 10:5" />Ni di Rehoboam ladiki kanya alɛ, “Bitɔɔkyɛ, biekple biwa ɔkyɛ nii di ayi atiɛ kamɛ.” Nioso batii nwu lakyɛ baasifi.<verse eid="2CH 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 10:6" />Ninfɛ di Ɔka Rehoboam lakaalɛ banɔɔfo ba niasumu ni ote Solomon di obe wɔ aasiɛ ni nkpa nɛ. Aakaalɛ ma alɛ, “Lɛ bibaka mi, di mmle kadiki ni batii ba mmle kanya?”<verse eid="2CH 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 10:7" />Ni baadiki Kanya alɛ, “Nse fabale batii ba mmle sifutulɛ, fambuo ma anu fankakatɛ kafɔɔ di osuku biene suoto fanta ma yi, ni obe lele babale fɔ bakpɛmblatɛ.”<verse eid="2CH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 10:8" />Kafɔɔ Rehoboam lasĩ kɔkà nwu di banɔɔfo nwu laka nwɔ nii. Ni aalaakaalɛ bakosopo akyɛ wo nɔɔ ba niatoosumu nwɔ ni nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 10:9" />Aakaalɛ ma alɛ, “Be ninle ye disibu? Lɛ buɔtɔkɔ batii ba mmle niɛtɔkɔ mi ni alɛ, ‘Kɔkɔlɛ ni atoo ya di teefɔ letukasa wo ni’?”<verse eid="2CH 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 10:10" />Ninfɛ di bakosopo akyɛ wo nɔɔ nwu ladiki nwɔ kanya alɛ, “Tɔkɔ batii ba niɛbuɛ bɛɛtɔkɔ fɔ ni alɛ, ‘Teefɔ letukasa wo atoo nutũle, kafɔɔ ta atoo loo afɛnfɛlɛ nii’- tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Lɛnɛɛbi nii le biibii nkpe opĩ dilenke teemi ɔtɔ̀. <verse eid="2CH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 10:11" />Teemi letukasa ye atoo nutũle; ami kamata nya anwɛ bia onutũ anlenkee. Teemi lapɛ ye ku kowesee; ami kamapɛ ye ku kowesee ko ninfifiɛ ni fɛ nkpakana lɛtaa.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 10:12" />Di ayi atiɛ sɛmaa, Yeroboam ku batii nwu bamuu lakple baakyɛ Rehoboam nfũ, fɛ mmle di ɔka labuɛ ni alɛ, “Bikple biwa ni ɔkyɛ nii di ayi atiɛ kamɛ.” <verse eid="2CH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 10:13" />Ni di ɔka ladiki ma kanya ku ɔblɔ nɛ. Aasĩ kɔkà ko di banɔɔfo nwu lakà nwɔ nii, <verse eid="2CH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 10:14" />aatikanko bakosopo nwu kɔkà, ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Teemi lata atoo lee lawɛ onutũ; ami kamata nya anwɛ bia onutũ anlenkee. Teemi lapɛ ye ku kowesee; ami kamapɛ ye ku kowesee ko ninfifiɛ fɛ nkpakana lɛtaa.” <verse eid="2CH 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 10:15" />Nioso ɔka nwu ditakyɔɔ batii nwu atoko, diekye sɛsaabla se mmle dikyi lakye Yaa nfũ, alɛ ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu labuɛ aatɔkɔ ni Nebat obisuɔtɔbi Yeroboam aafenko ni di Silo otii nwu Ahiya suoto.<verse eid="2CH 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 10:16" />Di Israel omuu lanya alɛ ɔka lesĩ ma ni atoko ɔkyɔɔ yi, ni baadiki baatɔkɔ ɔka alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 10:16">“ Kamɛnlekɔ ninkpe wo di Dawid kamɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 10:16">Bunaa atesaa di Yese obisuɔtɔbi kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 10:16">Oo Israel, bikple bisifi ayo lee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 10:16">Oo Dawid, nyu leyo lɛfɔ nimu disi!"</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CH 10:16">Nioso Israel batii nwu bamuu lasifi ayo lɛma. <verse eid="2CH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 10:17" />Kafɔɔ Israel batii ba niawɛ ni di Yuda sekpoo kamɛ mma yi, Rehoboam niatoole ole sɛka di suoto lɛma.<verse eid="2CH 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 10:18" />Ninfɛ di ɔka Rehoboam lakpee Adoram, nnwɔɔ niayila ni di sɛkpɛ siene kanya di Israel batii nfũ nɛ, kafɔɔ Israel batii lasafɔ nwɔ afuɔ baalo. Kafɔɔ ɔka Rehoboam lapɛsɛwa aabuo di keke nɔɔ wɔ di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni aatoso aasifi Yerusalem nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 10:19" />Nioso Israel lataka baayila di Dawid leyo suoto diɛbadu dii le baakpana ni sɛlaa se mmle.<verse eid="2CH 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CH 11" />
  <para style="s1">Semaia Sɛlaa Obuɛ Ɔtɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 11:1" />Obe wɔ di Rehoboam labuo ni Yerusalem yi, aasiisa Yuda ku Benyamin leyo kamɛ batii- bakpɛtɛ nkpe kɔlafa-afosi-anɛ- alɛ balaakpɛko Israel, baakple bafũ sɛka kalekɔ nwu bata Solomon obisuɔtɔbi Rehoboam.<verse eid="2CH 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 11:2" />Kafɔɔ SAATE nwu ɔlaa wɔ mmle lawa kuata Semaia, Yaa otii nwu alɛ: <verse eid="2CH 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 11:3" />“Tɔkɔ Yuda ɔka, Solomon obisuɔtɔbi Rehoboam ku Israel batii bamuu di Yuda ku Benyamin falɛ, <verse eid="2CH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 11:4" />‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Bitankata biakyɛ bialaakpɛko babilee. Obiala lee atɔɔkyɛ leyo, diekye ami niɛbla nle mmle.’ ” Nioso baanu SAATE nwu ɔlaa, baapɛ baakple baadiɛ Yeroboam ɔlaakpɛko.<verse eid="2CH 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rehoboam Latofo Seyoyiɛ Aakyisa Sekpoo Kplɛ Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 11:5" />Rehoboam lasiɛ di Yerusalem ni aabudi sekpoo aatĩi kakpɛ osuku di Yuda nɛ: <verse eid="2CH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 11:6" />Betlehem, Etam, Tekoa, <verse eid="2CH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 11:7" />Bet-Sur, Soko, Adulam, <verse eid="2CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 11:8" />Gat, Maresa, Sif, <verse eid="2CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 11:9" />Adoraim, Lakis, Aseka, <verse eid="2CH 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 11:10" />Sora, Ayalon ku Hebron. Nse mmle niale kakpɛ sekpoo kplɛ di Yuda ku Benyamin nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 11:11" />Aata sĩ siawɛ osie, ni aayɔ kakpɛ kanyabayilatɛ aase sĩ kaanya nɛ, anta ma alesaa, nnɔnyi ku nta. <verse eid="2CH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 11:12" />Aayɔ kubiafunsaa ku akplɔ aatɛ di sekpoo kplɛ nwu simuu kamɛ, ni aabla ma baawɛ osie nwaa nɛ. Nioso Yuda ku Benyamin lale Rehoboam sekpoo kplɛ.<verse eid="2CH 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 11:13" />Olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii ba niakye ni kale akudi lɛma sekpoo simuu di Israel omuu layila nwɔ kamaa. <verse eid="2CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 11:14" />Bia Lewi batii nwu ladiɛ babɔkɛɛ lɛma sɛfa nweekɔ ku asaawɛ lɛma baatɛ, ni baawa Yuda ku Yerusalem nɛ. Diekye Yeroboam ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ lasĩ ma fɛ SAATE nwu olebatatɛ. <verse eid="2CH 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 11:15" />Ni aadiki nnwɔɔ omu olebatatɛ aata ntakalekɔ nwu ku tie ku lɛnankyuebi afiɔ ya aabla ni nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 11:16" />Mba niakye ni Israel kɔna biala kamɛ, niatɛ ni situ lɛma baatoowolaa ni SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa nwu, latikanko Lewi batii baakyɛ Yerusalem alɛ bɔɔlata seleɔta manta SAATE nwu, bate lɛma Yaa nwu. <verse eid="2CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 11:17" />Baakpee Yuda sɛka kalekɔ nwu osie, baakyakaako Solomon obisuɔtɔbi Rehoboam alɛɛ atiɛ, baatɔɔbla asaa di Dawid ku Solomon sisuku kanya di obe nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rehoboam Leyo Kamɛ Batii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 11:18" />Rehoboam layɔ Mahalat wɔ niale ni Dawid obisuɔtɔbi Yerimot obisankobi wɔ aalofo ni ku Abihail, aale ni Yese obisuɔtɔbi Eliab obisankobi. <verse eid="2CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 11:19" />Aalofo babisuɔtɔbi aatɔɔ: Mma niale Yeus, Semaria ku Saham nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 11:20" />Nni kamaa aayɔ Absalom obisankobi Maaka wɔ nialofo ni Abigya, Atai, Sisa ku Selomit aatɔɔ ni nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 11:21" />Rehoboam labɔmbɔ Absalom obisankobi Maaka aalenkee basɔfɔ ku basɔnɔ nɔɔ lele bamba. Baasiisa ni bamuu yi, aawɛ basɔfɔ lefosi-banɛ ku basɔnɔ afosi-akuɔ, babisuɔtɔbi afosi-anyɔ-banɛ ku babisankobi afosi-akuɔ.<verse eid="2CH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 11:22" />Rehoboam ladiki Maaka obisuɔtɔbi Abigya alɛ ale ɔka obi nɔɔfo di babilɛma-suɔtɔbi kamɛ, diekye aamiɛ alɛ ase nwɔ sɛka. <verse eid="2CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 11:23" />Aadiki kɔkpaa di ninumbe kanya, aasɛ babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ bawo aatɛ di Yuda ku Benyamin kale akudi nwu, ku kakpɛ sekpoo kplɛ nwu simuu aafenko. Aata ma alesaa asaa kpinwu, ni aadiki basɔfɔ kpinwu aata ma baayɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CH 12" />
  <para style="s1">Sisak Egipte Otii Nwu Ladieko Yuda Kakpɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 12:1" />Obe wɔ di Rehoboam sɛka ole layila ni, kuabawɛ ni osie sɛmaa yi, nnwɔɔ ku Israel bamuu ba niawɛ ni ku nnwɔɔ lasĩ SAATE nwu kufiofa. <verse eid="2CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 12:2" />Ta batale ni onukwale baata ni SAATE nwu oso yi, Egipte ɔka Sisak ladieko Yerusalem di Ɔka Rehoboam sɛka ole lɛlɛɛ nɔnle kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 12:3" />Aadieko ma ku bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni kakpe alafa-anyɔ ku bapɔnkɔ basiɛtɛ nkpe afosi-akuɔ ku Libia batii, Suki batii ku Kus batii bakpɛtɛ ba batafuo ni ɔka, baakye Egipte baawa ni ku nnwɔɔ. <verse eid="2CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 12:4" />Aafũ Yuda sekpoo kplɛ se baatofo seyoyiɛ baakyisa ni aalaadu bia Yerusalem.<verse eid="2CH 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 12:5" />Ninfɛ di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu Semaia lawa Rehoboam ku Yuda batunletɛ ba niasi ni di Yerusalem ɔkyɛ, ta baatɔɔyɛkɛ ni Sisak oso. Ni aabuɛ aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ, ‘Bitoodiɛ mi nnɛɛ; nkpo oso, kanunua amii ntoodiɛ ye lɛta Sisak.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 12:6" />Ninfɛ di Israel batunletɛ ku ɔka lawakosa suoto lɛma kasɔ baabuɛ alɛ, “SAATE nwu nte tinini.”<verse eid="2CH 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 12:7" />Di SAATE nwu lanya alɛ batɔɔwakosa ni suoto lɛma kasɔ yi, ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa wɔ mmle lawa kuata Semaia alɛ: “Ta batɔɔwakosa ni suoto lɛma kasɔ oso yi, nɔmawɔɔsa ma, kafɔɔ kamata ma didiki nunua. Nɔmasoosa ɔblɔ yakayaka nii di Yerusalem diefe ni di Sisak suoto. <verse eid="2CH 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 12:8" />Kafɔɔ yi, babasiɛ nwɔ kaalɔ, di mmle babatekete ni lɛsaa mankyeko ni kakyi ka ninsi ni di ami osumu ku kasɔ bamba baka osumu kamɛ.”<verse eid="2CH 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 12:9" />Di Egipte ɔka Sisak ladieko ni Yerusalem yi, aatuka SAATE nwu olekatakɔ lɛsaawɛ ku lɛkayo lɛsaawɛ aasifiko. Aayɔ lɛsaa biala, di koto sɛɛle kubiafunsaa ya di Solomon labla nii. <verse eid="2CH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 12:10" />Nioso Ɔka Rehoboam labla abɔɔsaa sɛɛle kubiafunsaa aase di nnya nkpo kanya, ni aayɔ nya aakpee di banyuntɛ nwu kanyabayilatɛ ba niatɔɔbla ni ɔkpɛ di lɛkayo kayoko kamɛ nnɛɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 12:11" />Obe lele di ɔka kɔkyɛ SAATE nwu olekatakɔ yi, banyuntɛ nwu nklee kubiafunsaa nwu, nni sɛmaa, mankplesa nya manaatɛ di banyuntɛ nwu leyo.<verse eid="2CH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 12:12" />Ta Rehoboam lawakosa ni suoto kasɔ oso yi, SAATE nwu ɔblɔ di suoto nɔɔ lakyi, nioso ataloo nwɔ ɔwɔɔsa. Nwaako lɛsaa biene lewo lawɛ di Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rehoboam Sɛka Ole Suoto Ɔlaa Kakui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 12:13" />Ninfɛ di Ɔka Rehoboam lase suoto nɔɔ kpinkpĩ di Yerusalem ni atoole sɛka nɛ. Alɛɛ afosi-ana-lɛlɛɛ-ninwii aafũ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka alɛɛ lefosi-akuɛnsĩ di Yerusalem nɛ, okpoo kplɛ nwu di SAATE nwu ladiki ni di Israel ana nwu amuu kamɛ alɛ ɔɔtɛ ni Leyooto nɔɔ. Rehoboam ɔya leyooto niale Naama; Amon otii aale. <verse eid="2CH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 12:14" />Rehoboam labla dikpilesaa diekye atayɔ otu nɔɔ aawolaa SAATE nwu.<verse eid="2CH 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 12:15" />Asaa ya di Rehoboam labla ni di sɛka olebee nɔɔ, diayɔ ni di kasɔ kakyekɔ dialaase ni di kayɛntɛlekɔ nnya yi, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Semaia ku asaanyatɛ, Ido otii nwu nimblako ni sekofolaa ɔkpɛ akũ kamɛ. Kakpɛ lasiɛ di Rehoboam ku Yeroboam ntɛɛ obe lele. <verse eid="2CH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 12:16" />Rehoboam latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ, ni baakookaa nwɔ di Dawid Okpoo kplɛ nɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Abigya layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CH 13" />
  <para style="s1">Abigya Lakpɛko Yeroboam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 13:1" />Di Yeroboam sɛka olebee lɛlɛɛ lefosi-lɛnɛnle kamɛ yi, Abigya labale Yuda ɔka, <verse eid="2CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 13:2" />ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ atiɛ nɛ. Ɔya leyooto niale Maaka nɛ. Uriel obisankobi aale, aakye ni Gebea.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 13:2">Kakpɛ lasiɛ di Abigya ku Yeroboam ntɛɛ. <verse eid="2CH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 13:3" />Abigya lakyɛ kakpɛ ku bakpɛtɛ ba ninfuo ni ɔkpɛ nwaa nkpe alafa-ana, ni di Yeroboam lakpɛko nwɔ ku bakpɛtɛ ba ninfuo ni ɔkpɛ nwaa nkpe alafa-anɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 13:4" />Ninfɛ di Abigya layila di Semaraim Kobokote osi, di Efraim lekpenkpe kale, aabuɛ alɛ, “Yeroboam ku Israel omuu, bikyɔɔ mi atoko! <verse eid="2CH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 13:5" />Bieye bilɛ SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa nwu, ntɔɔyɔ Israel sɛka ole nwu ɛɛta Dawid ku banantii nɔɔ di mmba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kanya ninii ka ninanlalaa ni diidii</char></note> kanya ninii ɔbla kamɛ dinaa ni kaloo? <verse eid="2CH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 13:6" />Kafɔɔ Nebat obisuɔtɔbi Yeroboam, aale ni Dawid obisuɔtɔbi Solomon ɔnɔɔfotii onwii lataka aayila di saate nɔɔ suoto. <verse eid="2CH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 13:7" />Ninfɛ di atiipɛ ya ninandie ni lɛsalɛsaa bawo lamana nwɔ baakyi, ni baataka baayila di Solomon obisuɔtɔbi Rehoboam suoto di obe wɔ aale ni obisɔ anadiyila ni kpinkpĩ anaa ni osie kafɔɔ alɛ aayilako ma ni nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 13:8" />“Ni di kanunua biɛbla disibu bilɛ biɔtaka di SAATE nwu sɛka kalekɔ ka ninsi ni di Dawid banantii nnɛɛ nɛ. Nwaako bakpɛtɛ kpinwu bile, bikpe kafɔɔ koto sɛɛle anankyuebi ya di Yeroboam labla alɛ ale ye ni bayaa lee. <verse eid="2CH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 13:9" />Kafɔɔ aye bietososa SAATE nwu olebatatɛ, Aron babisuɔtɔbi ku Lewi batii nwu, ni biese aye bamu olebatatɛ fɛ mmle di batii ba di nsɔ bamba mbla ni nɛ. Otii lele niɛwa ɛɛbakleklesa suoto nɔɔ ku lɛnankyuebi-suɔtɔ ku akunumuu akuɛnsĩ kafuo oletatɛ ole anta asaa ya ninanle ni bayaa.<verse eid="2CH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 13:10" />“Kafɔɔ awo yi, SAATE nwu ninle Yaa loo, buosĩ nwɔ kafɔɔ. Olebatatɛ ba ninsumu ni SAATE nwu nle Aron babisuɔtɔbi, di Lewi batii nkyakaako ma ni nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 13:11" />Olesɛ ku kɔtɔɔfɔ biala manta ofiɛ asaaɔta ku olufuii kɔnɔnkɔnɔ manta SAATE nwu. Mandiki bloblo mantika di opunu kleklesale nwu suoto, mansɔ kafɔɔ bakandiɛ ba di koto sɛɛle kandiɛ ditikasaa suoto kɔtɔɔfɔ biala. Bukyɛ di SAATE Yaa loo ablasaa osuku kanya. Kafɔɔ aye bitoosĩ nwɔ. <verse eid="2CH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 13:12" />Yaa nsiko wo; nnwɔɔ ninle wo tunletɛ nɛ. Olebatatɛ nɔɔ kamafɛ kakpɛ kudu akyukyoo lɛma di suoto lee. Israel batii, bitankpɛko SAATE nwu, bate lee Yaa nwu, diekye dilɔbalɛ ditaye.”<verse eid="2CH 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 13:13" />Kafɔɔ Yeroboam lata bakpɛtɛ lamana ma sɛɛmaa baakyi, diata alɛ di obe wɔ aawɛ ni di Yuda sitũ yi, bakpɛtɛ ba niate ni kalá lawɛ di sɛmaa lɛma. <verse eid="2CH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 13:14" />Ninfɛ di Yuda bakpɛtɛ lamunikĩi baanyu, ni baanya alɛ bɔɔkpɛ ma sitũ ku sɛmaa nɛ. Ni baafaa baalɛɛ SAATE nwu nɛ. Olebatatɛ lafɛ akyukyoo lɛma, <verse eid="2CH 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 13:15" />ni di Yuda batii layiisa kakpɛ kudù nɛ. Di kakpɛ lɛma kudù kanya didie yi, Yaa lalenkee Yeroboam ku Israel omuu di Abigya ku Yuda anu. <verse eid="2CH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 13:16" />Israel batii latoso kakpɛ di Yuda anu, ni di Yaa layɔ Israel batii aakpee di Yuda batii nnɛɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 13:17" />Abigya ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ lalenkee ma osie kanya, alɛ bakpɛtɛ ba nianɔɔ ni kakpɛ labla nkpe alafa-anɔɔ di Israel bakpɛtɛ siene kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 13:18" />Nioso baawakosa Israel batii kasɔ di ɔsaabla nwu kamɛ, ni di Yuda batii lalenkee nɛ, diekye baatika disi di SAATE nwu, bate lɛma Yaa suoto.<verse eid="2CH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 13:19" />Abigya latikanko Yeroboam, ni aalaafũ Betel, Yesana ku Efron sekpoo ku sekpoenyii ninsĩ di nnɛɛ nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 13:20" />Yeroboam ditansinkple aawɛ ɔnyɛɛ di Abigya obe kamɛ. Ni di SAATE nwu lapɛ nwɔ aatɛ, ni aakpi nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 13:21" />Kafɔɔ Abigya lawɛ ɔwɛ osie. Aayɔ basanko lefosi-bana ni aalofo babisuɔtɔbi afosi-anyɔ-banyɔ ku babisankobi lefosi-bakuɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 13:22" />Sɛsaabla bamba se di Abigya labla ni di sɛka olebee nɔɔ kamɛ, asaa ya aabla ni ku nse aabuɛ nii yi, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Ido suoto sɛlaa kukũ kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2CH 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔka Asa Lalenkee Etiopia Batii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 14:1" />Ninfɛ di Abigya latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ, ni baakookaa nwɔ di Dawid Okpoo kplɛ nwu nɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Asa labayila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka, di obe nɔɔ kamɛ, kale nwu lasiɛ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ alɛɛ lefosi.<verse eid="2CH 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 14:2" />Asa labla lɛsaa le nialɛ, diasiɛko ni kafɔɔ di SAATE Yaa nɔɔ anu. <verse eid="2CH 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 14:3" />Aakpakpaa bafɔɔ oleɔta akyikye ku ntakalekɔ nwu, aabibiɛ afiɔtii, ni aabudi Asera sewoso aatɛ kaasɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 14:4" />Ni aatɔkɔ Yuda batii alɛ bawolaa SAATE nwu, bate lɛma Yaa nwu, baakyɔɔ kafɔɔ afiofa nɔɔ ku sɛlaa nɔɔ atoko nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 14:5" />Aakpakpaa ntakalekɔ nwu ku olufui oleɔta akyikye di okpoo biala di Yuda kamɛ, ni di sɛka kalekɔ nwu lasiɛ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ di kalɔ nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 14:6" />Aabudi sekpoo kplɛ siene aatɛ di Yuda, diekye kasɔ nwu lasiɛ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ. Kuonwii dita dieko nwɔ kakpɛ di alɛɛ nwu nkpo kamɛ, diekye SAATE nwu latɔɔ ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ.<verse eid="2CH 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 14:7" />Ni aatɔkɔ Yuda batii alɛ, “Bita butɛ sekpoo se mmle, buotofo seyoyiɛ kafɔɔ bukyisa sĩ ku ayo takale, buokpee n-yoko ku abɔɔsaa. Kalewo di kasɔ nwu lekple kale, diekye buawolaa SAATE Yaa loo nwu; buawolaa nwɔ, ni atɔɔta wo ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ di ɔfankyi biala nɛ.” Nioso baatɛ sekpoo nwu, ni di asaa kafɔɔ lalɛ ɔkyɛ aata ma nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 14:8" />Asa lawɛ bakpɛtɛ nkpe-alafa-atiɛ baakye ni Yuda, baaklee ni kubiafunsaa kplɛ ku akplɔ, ku bakpɛtɛ nkpe-alafa-anyɔ-afosi-anɛ baakye ni Benyamin, baaklee ni kubiafunsaa biibii ku kɔtaa. Mba mmle bamuu lale bakpɛtɛ ku sɛkambi.<verse eid="2CH 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 14:9" />Etiopia otii nwu Serah lakyɛ aalaadieko ma kakpɛ ku bakpɛtɛ dikudi kplɛ ku bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni alafa-atiɛ, ni baawa baabadu bia Maresa nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 14:10" />Ni di Asa ladie aalakyakako nwɔ, ni baalaayila kakpɛ di Sefata Ɔtaata niɛkaako ni Maresa nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 14:11" />Ninfɛ di Asa lalɛɛ SAATE Yaa nɔɔ aabuɛ alɛ, “SAATE, kuonwii nnaa fɛle afɔ abakyakaako ni nnwɔ ninaa ni osie di sientɛ suoto. Oo SAATE Yaa loo, kyakaako wo, diekye afɔ buotika disi, di leyooto lɛfɔ kamɛ kafɔɔ buɔwa bakpɛtɛ dikudi kplɛ le mmle ɔkpɛko nɛ. Oo SAATE, afɔ ninle wo Yaa; tanta otii kuonwii lalenkee fɔ.”<verse eid="2CH 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 14:12" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu lapɛ Etiopia batii aatɛ kaasɔ di Asa ku Yuda batii anu nɛ. Etiopia batii latoso, <verse eid="2CH 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 14:13" />ni di Asa ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ latikanko ma baalaadu bia Gerar nɛ. Etiopia batii ba nianɔɔ ni kakpɛ latɛ baapɔ alɛ batansinfuo ɔtaka; baawɔɔsa ma di SAATE nwu ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ anu. Ni di Yuda bakpɛtɛ latuka kakpɛ kamɛ asaa kpinwu baasifiko nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 14:14" />Baawɔɔsa sekpoenyii se simuu niamana Gerar siakyi nii, diekye SAATE nwu lɛyɛkɛ lapɛ ma. Baalɛ sekpoenyii se mmle simuu kakpɛ kamɛ asaa baasifiko, ta asaa kpinwu lawɛ ni ninfa oso. <verse eid="2CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 14:15" />Baadieko kafɔɔ babɔkɛɛ bakpatɛ nsiɛkɔ, ni baakpaa bafoso ku batie ku babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo di akudi kanya baasifiko nɛ. Ninfɛ baakple baasifi Yerusalem nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2CH 15" />
  <para style="s1">Kakyi Asaa Ya Di Asa Labla Nii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 15:1" />Yaa Ninwuna labuo di Oded obisuɔtɔbi Asaria suoto. <verse eid="2CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 15:2" />Ni aadie aakyɛ aalaakyakako Asa aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Bikyɔɔ mi atoko, Asa ku Yuda ku Benyamin omuu. SAATE nwu nsiko ye di obe wɔ bisi ni ku nnwɔɔ. Nse biewolaa nwɔ, bibanyɔɔ, kafɔɔ nse biesĩ nwɔ yi, abasĩ ye. <verse eid="2CH 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 15:3" />Ditɔɔklɛ di Israel ditawɛ ni Yaa omuomu, batawɛ oletatɛ wɔ nikatuo ma ni asaa, batawɛ kufiofa kafɔɔ. <verse eid="2CH 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 15:4" />Kafɔɔ di nimiina lɛma kamɛ yi, baamunikĩi baawa SAATE nwu nfũ, Israel Yaa nwu, baawolaa nwɔ, ni baanyɔɔ kafɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 15:5" />Di obe nwu kamɛ yi, falaafuo osuku ɔkyɛ okyikyii di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ, diekye batii ba bamuu niasiɛ ni di kasɔ nwu suoto lasiɛ di amumu kplɛ ɔbla kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 15:6" />Kale kanwii ntaka di kale bamba suoto, okpoo kplɛ kafɔɔ ntaka di okpoo kplɛ bamba suoto, diekye Yaa latookpee ma kubuɛ ku amiina ateate biala. <verse eid="2CH 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 15:7" />Kafɔɔ aye yi, biwɛ osie, bitanta disi, diekye babata ye letota di ɔkpɛ wɔ biɔbla ni suoto.”<verse eid="2CH 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 15:8" />Obe wɔ di Asa lanu ni sɛlaa se mmle ku Oded obisuɔtɔbi ɔlabuɛtɛtɛ Aseria ɔlaa obuɛ ɔtɛ nwu yi, aawɛ otu. Aakpakpaa ayududusaa afiɔtii nwu di Yuda ku Benyamin kasɔ kamuu ku sekpoo se aafũ ni di Efraim akpenkpe kamɛ. Asa lalolaa SAATE nwu oleɔta akyikye ya niayila ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ lɛkpata sitũ.<verse eid="2CH 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 15:9" />Ninfɛ di Asa lasiisa Yuda ku Benyamin omuu ku batii ba niakye ni Efraim, Manase ku Simeon ba nintɔɔwa basi ni kaamɛ lɛma nɛ. Diekye batii kpinwu lakye Israel baawa ɔkyɛ nɔɔ di obe wɔ baanya alɛ SAATE Yaa nsiko nwɔ nii.<verse eid="2CH 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 15:10" />Baasi di Yerusalem di Asa sɛka olebee lefosi lɛlɛɛ nɔnle di kɔwɛntɛ tiɛfa kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 15:11" />Di obe nwu kamɛ baayɔ banankyue nkpe alafa-akuɛnsĩ, bafoso ku batie nkpe-nkuɛnsĩ ba baakyeko kakpɛ kamɛ asaa ya baayɔ baawako ni baata ole baata SAATE nwu. <verse eid="2CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 15:12" />Baabla kanya ninii kanwii alɛ boowolaa SAATE nwu, bate lɛma Yaa nwu, ku otu lɛma ku ɔkla lɛma omuu. <verse eid="2CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 15:13" />Batii bamuu ba ninamawolaa ni SAATE Israel Yaa nwu yi, babalo ma, obisɔ ee ɔnɔɔfo, osuɔtɔ ee ɔsanko. <verse eid="2CH 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 15:14" />Ni baaka ntam baata SAATE nwu, ku sɛlɔ siene ku kudu oyiisa ku akyukyoo ku babɔkɛɛ akya nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 15:15" />Yuda omuu lanya suoto lɛyɔɔ di ntam nwu ɔka suoto, diekye baaka mi ku otu lɛma omuu. Baawolaa Yaa osie kanya, ni baanyɔɔ nɛ. Nioso SAATE nwu lata ma ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ di ɔfankyi biala.<verse eid="2CH 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 15:16" />Ɔka Asa latakatɛ ɔwa nɔɔ sanko Maaka di lekpomii nɔɔ fɛ ɔkasanko, ta aabla ni afiɔ-sanko ya bɔɔlɛɛ ni Asera owoso diyududusaa oso. Asa labudi owoso nwu aatɛ kaasɔ, ni aabubudi nwu aakpee di ɔtɔ aafiɛ di Kidron Ɔtaata nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 15:17" />Nu atakpakpaa ntakalekɔ nwu di Israel yi, Asa otu omuu latika di SAATE nwu suoto di nkpa nɔɔ osiɛ mmuu kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 15:18" />Ni aayɔ koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle ku awansaa ya di nnwɔɔ ku ote ladiki ni kayi aawako di Yaa olekatakɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 15:19" />Kakpɛ kukanwii ditasinwɛ dialaase di ɔka Asa sɛka olebee alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ-lɛnɔnle kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 15:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2CH 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Lawa Di Israel Batii Ku Yuda Batii Ntɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 16:1" />Di ɔka Asa sɛka olebee alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ-dikuɔnle kamɛ yi, Israel ɔka Basa lakata aakyɛ aalaadieko Yuda, aatofo oyoyiɛ aakyisa Rama, aayɔ aatĩi osuku mmle di kuonwii dilɔbafuo ni odie ee abuo ni di Yuda ɔka Asa kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="2CH 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 16:2" />Ninfɛ di Asa layɔ koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle di SAATE nwu atokatɛkɔ ku lɛkayo nɔɔ nimu aayɔ nya aakyesee Siria ɔka Ben-Hadad wɔ niatoole ni sɛka di Damasko nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 16:3" />Ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Ta kanya ninii kasiɛ di ami ku afɔ ntɛɛ, fɛ mmle kaate ni di teemi ku teefɔ ntɛɛ. Nyu lo, ami lekyesee fɔ koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle. Kanunua kplesa kanya ninii lɛfɔ nwu ku Israel ɔka Basa di mmle abadiɛ mi ni otikanko.”<verse eid="2CH 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 16:4" />Ninfɛ di Ben-Hadad latunako Ɔka Asa nɛ. Ni aakpee bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ kanyabayilatɛ di Israel sekpoo nwu suoto nɛ. Baalenkee Iyon, Dan, Abel-Maim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nnwu mankple manlɛɛ Abel Bet Maaka nɛ</char></note> ku Naftali asaa ntɛkɔ sekpoo kplɛ simuu. <verse eid="2CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 16:5" />Di Basa lanu ni nnwɔ mmle yi, aadiɛ Rama oyoyiɛ nwu otofo, ni aadiɛ ɔkpɛ nɔɔ aatɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 16:6" />Ninfɛ di Ɔka Asa lakpaa Yuda batii bamuu aawako, baabatuka afuɔ ku sewoso se di Basa layɔ aatɔblako ni ɔkpɛ baasifiko nɛ. Ni aayɔ nya aatofo Geba ku Mispa seyoyiɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 16:7" />Di obe nwu kamɛ yi, asaanyatɛ Hanani nwu lawa ɔka Asa nfũ di Yuda ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ: “Ta faatika ni Siria ɔka disi, ni ditale ni SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ nwu oso yi, ni di Siria ɔka bakpɛtɛ latoso baadie di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 16:8" />Etiopia batii ku Libia batii ditale bakpɛtɛ sientɛ ku bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni ku bapɔnkɔ basiɛtɛ ba nimpɔ ni kpinwu? Kafɔɔ di obe wɔ faatika ni SAATE nwu disi yi, aayɔ ma aakpee fɔ ninnɛɛ. <verse eid="2CH 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 16:9" />Diekye SAATE nwu anu kɔnya kasɔ kamuu anfenko alɛ aakpee batii ba niɛyɔ situ lɛma simuu bɛɛtɔɔ ni osie. Fatɔɔbla dibuusaa, diɛyɔ ni di nunua diesifi nii, fabatɔɔkpɛ kakpɛ.”<verse eid="2CH 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 16:10" />Ni di Asa lanya ɔblɔ aakpeeko asaanyatɛ nwu ta nle mmle oso; ɔblɔ latɛ kuafiɛ nwɔ osie kanya alɛ aamufũ nwɔ aalaatɛ di leyo katenkɔ. Di obe nwu kamɛ Asa lanyinka batii nwu bawo amumu kanya.<verse eid="2CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asa Sɛka Ole Kayɛntɛkɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 16:11" />Asa sɛka olebee sɛsaabla, diayɔ ni di kasɔ kakyekɔ dialaadu ni kayɛntɛlekɔ yi, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di Yuda ku Israel baka kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 16:12" />Di sɛka nɔɔ olebee alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ-lɛnaasinle kamɛ yi, ofiɛ onwii lapɛ Asa di nkpaa nɔɔ. Nu di ofiɛ nɔɔ nwu kanya lawɛ osie, bia di ofiɛ nɔɔ kamɛ yi, atakaalɛ lɛkyakaako akyeko SAATE nwu nfũ, kafɔɔ afa bablatɛ nfũ lete aakaalɛ aakyeko. <verse eid="2CH 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 16:13" />Ninfɛ di sɛka olebee nɔɔ alɛɛ afosi-ana lɛlɛɛ kasale kamɛ aakpi aalaatɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 16:14" />Ni baakokaa nwɔ di ɔkya wɔ aakutu aatɛ aata ni suoto nɔɔ di Dawid Okpoo kplɛ nɛ. Baatensa nwɔ di atensaa ya baatitĩi ni ku afa ku akɔnɔkɔnɔsaa ateate ya baakpɔtɔɔsa nii, ni baakutaa ɔtɔ bembe, baatɔɔ dibu nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2CH 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yehosafat Labale Ɔka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 17:1" />Ɔka Asa obisuɔtɔbi Yehosafat nfɛ niabale ɔka, ni aasiensa suoto nɔɔ di Israel suoto nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 17:2" />Aadiki bakpɛtɛ aakpee di Yuda sekpoo kplɛ siene simuu kamɛ ni aatɛ bakpɛtɛ nsiɛkɔ di Efraim sekpoo se di ote Asa lafũ ni nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 17:3" />SAATE nwu lasiɛko Yehosafat, diekye di alɛɛ nɔɔ kasale kamɛ yi, aakyɛ di sisuku se di ɔwa nɔɔ Dawid latikanko ni suoto. Atawolaa asaa kamɛ aakyeko Baal nfũ, <verse eid="2CH 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 17:4" />kafɔɔ aawolaa ote nɔɔ Yaa nwu, aatikanko kafɔɔ afiofa nɔɔ ya nintale ni Israel sɛsaabla. <verse eid="2CH 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 17:5" />SAATE nwu lata sɛka kalekɔ nwu layila kpinkpĩ di kalɔ nɔɔ; ni di Yuda batii bamuu layɔ akyɛsaa baawako Yehosafat nɛ, nioso aawɛ lɛsaawɛ kplɛ ku dibu. <verse eid="2CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 17:6" />Otu nɔɔ latika di SAATE nwu sisuku suoto; diɛkyakaa nii yi, aakpakpaa ntakalekɔ nwu ku Asera sewoso di Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 17:7" />Di sɛka nɔɔ ole lɛlɛɛ tiɛfa kamɛ yi, aakpee banɔɔfotii nɔɔ Ben-Hail, Obadia, Sekaria, Netanel ku Mikaia alɛ balaatuo asaa di Yuda sekpoo. <verse eid="2CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 17:8" />Lewi batii bawo lawɛ ku mma- mma niale Semaia, Netania, Sebadia, Asahel, Semiramot, Yehonatan, Adonigya, Tobia ku Tob-Adonigya- ku olebatatɛ Elisama ku Yehoram. <verse eid="2CH 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 17:9" />Baayɔ SAATE nwu Kufiofa Kukũ baaklee, ni baatuo asaa di Yuda omuu; baakyɛ baakyi Yuda sekpoo simuu ni baatuo batii nwu asaa nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehosafat Asaa Kplɛ Ɔbla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 17:10" />SAATE nwu lɛyɛkɛ lapɛ sɛka nlekɔ nsɔ be mmuu niamana Yuda siakyi nii, nioso batataka kakpɛ di Yehosafat suoto. <verse eid="2CH 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 17:11" />Filisti batii bawo lawako Yehosafat akyɛsaa ku koto fututu fɛ kɔsɔsĩ, Arab batii kafɔɔ lawako nwɔ babɔkɛɛ: akunumuu nkpe nkuɛnsĩ-alafa-akuɛnsĩ ku batie nkpe nkuɛnsĩ-alafa-akuɛnsĩ.<verse eid="2CH 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 17:12" />Yehosafat latɔɔwɛ osie aatɔɔkyakaa. Aatofo ayo siene ku sekpoo kplɛ asaa ntɛkɔ di Yuda, <verse eid="2CH 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 17:13" />aawɛ asaa ntɛkɔ kpinwu di Yuda sekpoo kamɛ. Aawɛ kafɔɔ bakpɛtɛ ba niatofo ni kakpɛ nwaa di Yerusalem. <verse eid="2CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 17:14" />Nnya mmle baadiki ma ni di ayo lɛma kanya:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CH 17:14" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 17:14">Mba niakye ni Yuda, baale ni kanyabayilatɛ di kakpe kanya nɛ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 17:14">kanyayilatɛ nwu Adna, layila di bakpɛtɛ nkpe alafa-atiɛ kanya;<verse eid="2CH 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 17:15" />kanyayilatɛ Yehohanan nfɛ niatika, aayila di bakpɛtɛ nkpe alafa-anyɔ- afosi-anɛ kanya;<verse eid="2CH 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 17:16" />Sikri obisuɔtɔbi Amasia nfɛ niatika, nnwɔ niayɔ suoto nɔɔ aata ni SAATE nwu ɔkpɛ ɔbla kasakasa layila di bakpɛtɛ nkpe alafa-anyɔ kanya.<verse eid="2CH 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 17:17" />Mba niakye ni Benyamin niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 17:17">kpɛtɛ sientɛ nwu onwii niale ni Eliada, layila di bakpɛtɛ nkpe alafa-anyɔ ba niakpakũ ni kɔtaa ku kubiafunsaa kanya;<verse eid="2CH 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 17:18" />Nnwɔ nfɛ niatika ni niale, Yehosabad, aayila di bakpɛtɛ nkpe kɔlafa-afosi-anɛ ba niakpakũ ni akpɛsaa baata ni kakpɛ.<verse eid="2CH 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 17:19" />Mba mmle niale bakpɛtɛ ba niale ni ɔka bakpɛmblatɛ, baakyakaa ni di mba aayɔ aatɛ ni di sekpoo kplɛ siene nwu kamɛ di Yuda omuu nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 17:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2CH 18" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Mikaia Lasĩ Ɔlaa Aata Ahab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 18:1" />Yehosafat lawɛ lɛsaawɛ kplɛ ku dibu, ni aayɔ suoto nɔɔ aabla onwii ku Ahab di bawo odiki ɔyɔ kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 18:2" />Di alɛɛ awo sɛmaa, aasoo aakyɛ Ahab nfũ di Samaria. Ni di Ahab lalo bafoso ku banankyue kpinwu aata Yehosafat ku batii ba niakyɛ ni ku nnwɔɔ, ni aakyɔnkyɔ nwɔ alɛ alaadieko Ramot-Gilead nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 18:3" />Ni di Israel ɔka Ahab lakaalɛ Yuda ɔka Yehosafat alɛ, “Fabakyɛ ku ami munaakpɛko Ramot-Gilead?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:3">Ni di Yehosafat latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Nte fɛ mmle fate nii, batii nii kafɔɔ nte fɛ batii lɛfɔ; bubakyakaa di afɔ di kakpɛ nwu kamɛ.” <verse eid="2CH 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 18:4" />Kafɔɔ Yehosafat lakple aatɔkɔ Israel ɔka alɛ, “Lekatũ fawolaa kamɛ fakyeko SAATE nwu nfũ fiɛ.”<verse eid="2CH 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 18:5" />Nioso Israel ɔka lalɛɛ olebatatɛ nwu aasiisa- basuɔtɔ alafa-ana- ni aakaalɛ ma alɛ, “Bukyɛ bulaakpɛko Ramot-Gilead ɛɛ, ntankyɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:5">Ni baadiki kanya alɛ, “Kyɛ, diekye Yaa kamayɔ nwu ankpee di ɔka nnɛɛ.”<verse eid="2CH 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 18:6" />Kafɔɔ Yehosafat lakaalɛ alɛ, “SAATE nwu ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ kuonwii nnaa ninfũ, nnwɔ ɔkyɛ buakaalɛ ɔlaa munkyeko ni?”<verse eid="2CH 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 18:7" />Ni di Israel ɔka latɔkɔ Yehosafat alɛ, “Osuɔtɔ onwii lekple akpe, buafuo ni SAATE nwu ɔkaalɛ okyeko ni ɔkyɛ nɔɔ, kafɔɔ lekyidi nwɔ, diekye diidii ammbuɛ ɔlaa-obuɛɔtɛ biene kuonwii akyeko suoto nii, kafɔɔ obe lele dikpile ambuɛ. Nnwɔɔ ninle Imla obisuɔtɔbi Mikaia nɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:7">Ni di Yehosafat ladiki kanya alɛ, “Ɔka atambuɛ nkpo.”<verse eid="2CH 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 18:8" />Nioso Israel ɔka lalɛɛ banɔɔfotii nɔɔ onwii ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Tɔɔkyɛ falalɛɛ Imla obisuɔtɔbi nwu fawako kanunua.”<verse eid="2CH 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 18:9" />Di obe nwu kamɛ Israel ɔka Ahab ku Yuda ɔka Yehosafat lakpee sɛka akpeele wua baasiɛ di akakpomii lɛma suoto di Samaria kakpaa kayoko kanya, di ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ bamuu latoobuɛ sɛlaa baatɔɔtɛ ni di anu lɛma. <verse eid="2CH 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 18:10" />Ni di Kenaana obisuɔtɔbi Sedekia labla lɛbɔɔsaa akya, aabuɛ alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘N-ya mmle fabayɔ fan-wii Siria batii ntɔ kaasɔ ninnase di obe wɔ bɛɛwɔɔ ni nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 18:11" />Ni di ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ bamba latoobuɛ ɔlaa onwii nwu baatɔɔtɛ nɛ. Ni baabuɛ alɛ, “Die fakyɛ falaadieko Ramot-Gilead faalaalenkee nwu, diekye SAATE nwu kamayɔ nwu ankpee di ɔka nnɛɛ.”<verse eid="2CH 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 18:12" />Tɔkyɛntɛ wɔ niakyɛ ni Mikaia ɔlɛɛ labuɛ aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Nyu lo, fɛ otii onwii yi, ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ bamba kobuɛ sɛlaa biene manta ɔka. Ta ɔlaa lɛfɔ kukyɛkyɛ ku sele ma, faabuɛ sɛlaa biene kafɔɔ.”<verse eid="2CH 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 18:13" />Kafɔɔ Mikaia labuɛ alɛ, “Nwaako di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa yi, ɔlaa wɔ di Yaa nii lebuɛ ni lete ko kamafuo nwɔ ɔtɔkɔ.”<verse eid="2CH 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 18:14" />Obe wɔ aalaabuo ni nfa, ɔka lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Mikaia, bukyɛ bulaakpɛko Ramot-Gilead ɛɛ, ntankyɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:14">Ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Bilaakpɛ bibalenkee, diekye babayɔ ma mankpee di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="2CH 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 18:15" />Ni di ɔka lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Sɛsɛ dikpeni lɛta fɔ fɛɛka ntam alɛ fɛɛtɔkɔ mi onukwale di SAATE nwu leyooto kamɛ?”<verse eid="2CH 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 18:16" />Ninfɛ di Mikaia latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Lanya Israel omuu lɛsamii bakpete di akpenkpe nwu suoto fɛle bafoso ba ninaa ni kpatɛ, ni di SAATE nwu labuɛ alɛ, ‘Batii ba mmle nnaa saate. Ta obiala asifi leyo di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 18:17" />Ninfɛ di Israel ɔka labuɛ aatɔkɔ Yehosafat alɛ, “Nintɔkɔ fɔ nlɛ ammbuɛ ɔlaa obuɛɔtɛ biene kuonwii akyeko suoto nii diidii, kafɔɔ dikpile lete?”<verse eid="2CH 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 18:18" />Ni di Mikaia lakyɛ sitũ aabuɛ alɛ, “Nioso, nu SAATE nwu ɔlaa: Lɛnya SAATE nwu nsi di lɛkakpomii nɔɔ suoto di osi bakpɛtɛ bamuu n-yɛ ni di oletanɛɛkyɛ nɔɔ ku ɔmɛntukyɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="2CH 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 18:19" />Ni di SAATE nwu labuɛ alɛ, ‘Owe nimakyɔnkyɔ Israel ɔka Ahab alɛ aadieko Ramot-Gilead anaawɛ kafɔɔ kukpi nɔɔ ninfa?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:19">“Onwii mbuɛ mmle, ɔbamba kafɔɔ mbuɛ n-wɔ. <verse eid="2CH 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 18:20" />Yɛntɛyɛntɛ, ninwuna ninwii ladie aawa sitũ, aabaayila di SAATE nwu anu aabuɛ alɛ, ‘Ami kamakyɔnkyɔ nwɔ.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:20">“Ni di SAATE nwu lakaalɛ alɛ, ‘Di ɔmɛnsuku suoto?’<verse eid="2CH 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 18:21" />“Ni aabuɛ alɛ, ‘Kamakyɛ nnaale kakyɔnkyɔ ninwuna di ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu nnya kamɛ.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:21">“Ni di SAATE nwu labuɛ alɛ, ‘Fabafuo nwɔ ɔkyɔnkyɔ. Tɔɔkyɛ faalaabla ni.’<verse eid="2CH 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 18:22" />“Nioso SAATE nwu ntɔɔyɔ kakyɔnkyɔ ninwuna eekpee di ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ lɛfɔ ba mmle nnya kamɛ. SAATE nwu ntɔɔbla sɛlaa kpile ɛɛta fɔ.”<verse eid="2CH 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 18:23" />Ninfɛ di Kenaana obisuɔtɔbi Sedekia lakata aakyɛ aalaapɛ Mikaia kɔnɛɛ kootokosi aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Ɔmɛnsuku suoto di ninwuna le niakye ni SAATE nwu nfũ lafe, di obe aadie ni di ɔkyɛ nii aabakakatɛ aata fɔ ni?”<verse eid="2CH 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 18:24" />Ni di Mikaia latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Fabanya fankyeko di dii le fabakyɛ fanawofa ni di leyo le kaamɛ kamɛ.”<verse eid="2CH 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 18:25" />Ninfɛ di Israel ɔka ladiki kanya alɛ, “Bikpaa Mikaia biekplesa nwɔ bitɔkyɛnko okpoo kplɛ nwu ɔka Amon ku ɔka obisuɔtɔbi Yoas, <verse eid="2CH 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 18:26" />biebuɛ bilɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di ɔka kobuɛ ni alɛ: Biyɔ otii wɔ mmle bikpee di leyo katenkɔ, bitantɔɔ lɛsalɛsaa kafɔɔ, diediki bloblo ku ntu dilaase di obe wɔ lɛpɛlekple lɛwa ni di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 18:27" />Ni di Mikaia labuɛ alɛ, “Nse fɛɛpɛfeekple di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ yi, ni diele SAATE nwu niakakatɛ aafenko di suoto nii.” Ninfɛ aabuɛ aakyakaa alɛ, “Aye batii bamuu, bitɛ sɛlaa nii nsũ!”<verse eid="2CH 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahab Kukpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 18:28" />Nioso Israel ɔka Ahab ku Yuda ɔka Yehosafat lakata baakyɛ Ramot-Gilead. <verse eid="2CH 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 18:29" />Ni di Israel ɔka latɔkɔ Yehosafat alɛ, “Kamakyɛ kakpɛ kamɛ ku akpeele ya manamatofo mi nii, kafɔɔ afɔ kpee ɔka akpeele lɛfɔ.” Nioso Israel ɔka lakpee akpeele bamba, aamunikĩisa suoto, ni aasifi kakpɛ kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 18:30" />Ni di Siria ɔka latɔkɔ bakeke nɔɔ ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni bakpɛtɛ kanyabayilatɛ alɛ, “Bitankpɛko kuonwii, obisɔ ee ɔnɔɔfo, diediki Israel ɔka.” <verse eid="2CH 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 18:31" />Obe wɔ di bakeke nwu bakpɛtɛ kanyabayilatɛ lanya ni Yehosafat yi, baabuɛ alɛ, “Nnya Israel ɔka.” Nioso baamunikĩi alɛ bɔɔkpɛko nwɔ, kafɔɔ Yehosafat lafaa, ni di SAATE nwu lakyakaako nwɔ nɛ. Ni di Yaa latososa ma di suoto nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 18:32" />Diekye obe wɔ di bakeke nwu bakpɛtɛ kanyabayilatɛ lanya alɛ diele ni nnwɔɔ ninle ni Israel ɔka yi, baadiɛ nwɔ otikanko.<verse eid="2CH 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 18:33" />Kafɔɔ otii onwii lataa kɔtaa nɔɔ ko, ni kualaatofo Israel ɔka di akpɛsaa nɔɔ sebo nwu nɛ. Ni di ɔka nwu latɔkɔ keke nɔɔ katɛ alɛ, “Munikĩi faaka mi fadieko di kakpɛkɔ kamɛ. Diekye batootika mi kakɔ.” <verse eid="2CH 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 18:34" />Dii nwu kale kamuu kakpɛ kanya lawɛ osie, ni di Israel ɔka lamufũ suoto nɔɔ aaklee di keke nɔɔ kamɛ, aakyɔɔ Siria batii anu dialaadu kɔtɔɔfɔ nɛ. Ninfɛ aakpi di obe wɔ di kufĩ lamɛɛ ni nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 18:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2CH 19" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yehu Lasĩ Ɔlaa Aata Yehosafat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 19:1" />Obe wɔ di Yuda ɔka Yehosafat lapɛ aakple aasifi ni lɛkayo nɔɔ di Yerusalem buɛɛ yi, <verse eid="2CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 19:2" />Hanani obisuɔtɔbi Yehu asaanyatɛ nwu, ladie aakyɛ aalaakyakako ɔka, ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Dilɛ alɛ faakyakaako kpiletɛ, fambɔmbɔ mba niekyidi ni SAATE nwu? Ta nle mmle oso yi, SAATE nwu ɔblɔ yakayaka ntika fɔ di suoto. <verse eid="2CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 19:3" />Akpakpa dite yi, dibiene lewo nsi fɔ kaamɛ, diekye faakpakpaa Asera sewoso feekyisa di kasɔ nwu suoto, fɛɛyɔ otu lɛfɔ kafɔɔ fɛɛtɛ foowolaa Yaa.”<verse eid="2CH 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehosafat Lawako Dikyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 19:4" />Yehosafat lasiɛ di Yerusalem, ni aakple aadie di Beer-Seba batii kamɛ aakyɛ Efraim kale lekpenkpe aalaamunikĩisa ma aakplesa aawako SAATE nwu, bate lɛma Yaa nfũ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 19:5" />Aadiki bakantɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto, di Yuda okpoo kplɛ siene biala kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 19:6" />Ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bilolaa lɛsaa le biɔbla ni binyu nwaa, diekye diele batii biɔka lɛka minta kafɔɔ SAATE nwu, nnwɔ ninsiko ye ni, di obe lele biediki lɛbɛ ku lɛpɔɔ. <verse eid="2CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 19:7" />Nioso bita SAATE nwu lɛyɛkɛ disiɛ ye kaamɛ. Bielolaa lɛka bika, diekye katafaa ee anu onyu ee lewofa kamɛ asaa ofũ nnaa di SAATE Yaa loo nwu nfũ.”<verse eid="2CH 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 19:8" />Di Yerusalem kafɔɔ yi, Yehosafat ladiki Lewi batii, olebatatɛ ku Israel batii ayo kamɛ banɔɔfo bawo alɛ baablako SAATE nwu kufiofa ɔkpɛ, baalolaa kafɔɔ batii ntɛɛ. Batii ba mmle lasiɛ di Yerusalem. <verse eid="2CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 19:9" />Afiofa ya aakpee ma ni ninle n-ya mmle nɛ: “Dikpeni biɛbla ɔkpɛ di onukwale ole kamɛ ku otu lee omuu di SAATE nwu lɛyɛkɛ kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 19:10" />Ɔlaa biala nimakye kale lee batii ba ninsi ni di sekpoo kplɛ kamɛ kun-wa ni di anu lee- kuntɛ ntɔ owii ee sɛlaa bamba se niɛkaako ni kufiofa, ablasaa sisuku, sɛsaabla ee amanle yi- biká ma, di mmle manaabla ni okpile bayila ni di SAATE nwu suoto; nse diele nkpo, ɔblɔ nɔɔ kamawa di aye ku babilee suoto. Bibla nle mmle, ni bilɔbabla okpile.<verse eid="2CH 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 19:11" />“Oletatɛ nɔɔfo Amaria kamayila ye kaanya di ɔlaa lele niɛkaako ni SAATE nwu, Ismael obisuɔtɔbi Sebadia, Yuda kɔna kanyayilatɛ nwu kafɔɔ kamayila ye kaanya di ɔlaa lele niɛkaako ni ɔka, Lewi batii kafɔɔ kamabla ɔkpɛ fɛ banɔɔfotii di anu lee. Bikpee osie, di SAATE nwu kafɔɔ asiɛko mba nielolaa bɛɛbla ni.”<verse eid="2CH 19:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2CH 20" />
  <para style="s1">Moab Ku Amon Batii Lakpɛko Edom Batii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 20:1" />Di nle mmle sɛmaa yi, Moab batii ku Amon batii diɛkyakaa ni di Maon batii bawo lawa baabakpɛko Yehosafat.<verse eid="2CH 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 20:2" />Basuɔtɔ bawo lawa baabatɔkɔ Yehosafat alɛ, “Bakpɛtɛ dikudi kplɛ ninwii lekye Edom mamadieko fɔ, beekye Lekpo sɛmaa bɔɔwa fɔ ɔkpɛko. Nfɛ bakpe di Hasason-Tamar” (nfa ninle En-Gedi nɛ). <verse eid="2CH 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 20:3" />Lɛyɛkɛ lapɛ Yehosafat, ni aatɛ alɛ owolaa kamɛ di SAATE nwu nfũ, ni aata baayie lɛkya aata Yuda omuu kanya onii nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 20:4" />Ni di Yuda batii labla onwii baabakaalɛ lɛkyakaako baakyeko SAATE nwu nfũ nɛ; nwaako, baakye okpoo biala di Yuda baawa alɛ bɔɔbawolaa SAATE nwu.<verse eid="2CH 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 20:5" />Ninfɛ di Yehosafat lataka aayila di Yuda ku Yerusalem kasiisakɔ nwu di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ di kaflɔnkɔ fɔle nwu anu <verse eid="2CH 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 20:6" />aabuɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 20:6">“Oo SAATE, bate loo Yaa, diele afɔ ninle Yaa wɔ ninkpe ni di osi? Foole sɛka di nnle nwu sɛka nlekɔ mmuu suoto. Osie ku ɔnyɛɛ nsi di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ, kuonwii kafɔɔ dilɔbafuo fɔ oyilako. <verse eid="2CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 20:7" />Oo Yaa loo, diele afɔ niatososa batii ba niasiɛ ni di kasɔ ka mmle suoto di batii lɛfɔ Israel anu, ni fɛɛyɔ ka fɛɛta siɛwo lɛfɔ Abraham banantii dinaa ni kaloo? <verse eid="2CH 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 20:8" />Batoosiɛ ka di suoto, ni batootofo kakleklekɔ bɛɛta Leyooto lɛfɔ, beebuɛ alɛ, <verse eid="2CH 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 20:9" />‘Nse ɔlaa letũ wo, kuntɛ lɛkanko kapamii, ee ofiɛ kpile ee kɔka yi, bubayila di anu lɛfɔ di olekatakɔ ka mmle di Leyooto lɛfɔ ntika ni mun-wi munlɛɛ fɔ di nimiina loo kamɛ, ni fabanu wo lɛlɛɛ fandiki wo kafɔɔ.’<verse eid="2CH 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 20:10" />“Kafɔɔ nunua, batii lekye Amon, Moab ku Seir Kobokote bɛɛwa, mba kasɔ fatata Israel osuku baadieko ni di obe wɔ baakye Egipte baawa nii; nioso bawa loo lamunikĩi baasifi baadiɛ ma batawɔɔsa ma kafɔɔ. <verse eid="2CH 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 20:11" />Nyu mmle bɔɔta wo ni letota, bɛɛwa alɛ bɔɔbatososa wo mandiki ni di kasɔ ka faata wo ni fɛ atesaa. <verse eid="2CH 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 20:12" />Oo Yaa loo, flɔbakanko ma? Diekye bunaa osie kuonwii bubayilako ni bakpɛtɛ dikudi kplɛ le mmle nikodieko wo nii. Buoye lɛsaa le buabla nii, kafɔɔ anu loo ntika fɔ di suoto.”<verse eid="2CH 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 20:13" />Yuda batii bamuu, basɔfɔ lɛma ku babi lɛma ku babisɔ, layila ninfa di SAATE nwu anu.<verse eid="2CH 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 20:14" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ninwuna lawa di Matania obisuɔtɔbi Yeiel wɔ niale ni Benaia obisuɔtɔbi, aale ni Sakaria obisuɔtɔbi Yahasiel wɔ niale ni Matania obisuɔtɔbi aale ni Lewi otii, aakye ni kafɔɔ Asaf kɔna kamɛ, di obe wɔ aayila ni di kasikɔ nwu.<verse eid="2CH 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 20:15" />Ni aabuɛ alɛ: “Ɔka Yehosafat ku batii ba bamuu ba ninsi ni di Yuda ku Yerusalem, bikyɔɔ atoko! Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ antɔkɔ ye ni: ‘Bitan-yɛkɛ ee nnɛɛ lafee ye ta bakpɛtɛ dikudi kplɛ le mmle oso. Diekye kakpɛ nwu diele ye kale, kafɔɔ Yaa kakpɛ kale. <verse eid="2CH 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 20:16" />Kɔsɛɛ bisoo bikyɛ biɛlaakpɛko ma. Babakata manfe di Sis Osuku, bibanya ma kafɔɔ di okplo kyofole nwu kayɛntɛlekɔ di Yeruel Ɔfafuu kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 20:17" />Diele aye nimakpɛ kakpɛ ka mmle. Biyila di n-yilakɔ lee; Oo Yuda ku Yerusalem, biyila kpinkpĩ bienyu didiki le di SAATE nwu kamata ye ni. Bitan-yɛkɛ; bitanta nnɛɛ lafee ye. Bidie bikyɛ biɛlaakyakako ma kɔsɛɛ, SAATE nwu kafɔɔ kamasiɛko ye.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 20:18" />Ni di Yehosafat lawakasɔ aase katũ nɔɔ kaasɔ nɛ, ni di Yuda ku Yerusalem batii bamuu lapɛ akunkyi di SAATE nwu anu baasumu nwɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 20:19" />Ninfɛ di Lewi batii bawo ba niakye ni Kohat batii ku Kora batii kamɛ lataka baayila ni baatansa SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa, ku sɛlɔ siene nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 20:20" />Ni baadie ninfa ku kolesɛtũ baasifi Tekoa Ɔfafuu nɛ. Di obe wɔ booyefe ni osuku yi, Yehosafat layila aabuɛ alɛ, “Yuda ku Yerusalem batii, bikyɔɔ mi atoko! Biwɛ ofũ onu di SAATE nwu Yaa lee kamɛ, ni abata ye min-yila kpinkpĩ; biwɛ ofũ onu di ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ nɔɔ kamɛ ni dibalɛ ninta ye.” <verse eid="2CH 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 20:21" />Obe wɔ aatitika sɛlaa ku batii nwu aaloo nii, Yehosafat ladiki batii alɛ basa sinu bata SAATE nwu, baatansa kafɔɔ leklekle nɔɔ lɛklɛɛ di obe wɔ baadie baale ni bakpɛtɛ nwu katũ, ni baatɔɔsa alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 20:21">“Bipɛ SAATE nwu sɛfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 20:21">diekye lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.”<verse eid="2CH 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 20:22" />Di obe wɔ baakye kasɔ baatɔɔsa ni sinu baatɔɔtansa ni yi, SAATE nwu latɛ kalà di Amon, Moab ku Seir Kobokote bakpɛtɛ ba niatoodieko ni Yuda suoto, ni baalenkee nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 20:23" />Ni di Amon ku Moab bakpɛtɛ lataka baayila di bakpɛtɛ ba niakye ni Seir Kobokote suoto baawɔɔsa ma baadiki nɛ. Baaloo ni batii ba niakye ni Seir olo sɛmaa yi, baamunikĩi bakyɔɔ bawo anu baawɔɔsa bawo lɛma.<verse eid="2CH 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 20:24" />Obe wɔ di Yuda bakpɛtɛ labadu ni leyo takale le suoto man-yila man-nyunyuu ni di ɔfafuu nwu kamɛ, baanyu ni bakpɛtɛ dikudi kplɛ nwu yi, bakpi lete baanya bate kaasɔ; kuonwii ditatoso. <verse eid="2CH 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 20:25" />Nioso Yehosafat ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ lakyɛ baalatuka kakpɛ kamɛ asaa lɛma baasifiko, baawɛ kafɔɔ akpɛsaa kpinwu ku akpeele ku asaa ya niefũ ni kɔya- aapɔ aalenkee n-ya baafuo ni otuka osifiko. Kakpɛ kamɛ asaa nwu latɛ aapɔ oso, ayi atiɛ amu baayɔ baalɛ nya. <verse eid="2CH 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 20:26" />Di dii naafa suoto baasi di Beraka Ɔtaata, ni baatansa SAATE nwu nɛ. Nioso bɔɔlɛɛ nwu Beraka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beraka lɛsɔdiki ninle katansa nɛ</char></note> Ɔtaata diɛbadu miɛ dii le mmle nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 20:27" />Ninfɛ di Yehosafat laleko Yuda ku Yerusalem batii bamuu katũ baakple baasifi Yerusalem ku suoto lɛyɔɔ nɛ. Diekye SAATE nwu lata ma osuku alɛ banya suoto lɛyɔɔ di balo lɛma suoto. <verse eid="2CH 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 20:28" />Baabuo ni Yerusalem ni baasifi SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ku kukyukyue, bakyitaa ku akyukyoo ɔfɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 20:29" />Yaa lɛyɛkɛ labuo di nnle nwu mmuu sɛka nlekɔ kamɛ di obe wɔ baanu ni mmle di SAATE nwu lakpɛko ni Israel balo. <verse eid="2CH 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 20:30" />Ni di Yehosafat sɛka kalekɔ lasiɛ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ nɛ. Diekye Yaa nɔɔ latɔɔ ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ di ɔfankyi biala.<verse eid="2CH 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehosafat Sɛka Ole Kayɛntɛlekɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 20:31" />Nioso Yehosafat lale sɛka di Yuda suoto. Alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ-anɔɔ aafũ di obe wɔ aabale ni Yuda ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-anɔɔ nɛ. Ɔya leyooto niale Asuba, aale ni Silhi obisankobi. <verse eid="2CH 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 20:32" />Aakyɛ di ote Asa sisuku suoto, atakyi ninwu suoto kafɔɔ; aabla lɛsaa le niasiɛko ni di SAATE nwu anu. <verse eid="2CH 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 20:33" />Kafɔɔ batakpakpaa aba takale nwu, nioso batii nwu ditayɔ situ lɛma kafɔɔ baatika di bate lɛma Yaa suoto.<verse eid="2CH 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 20:34" />Asaa bamba ya di Yehosafat labla ni di sɛka olebee nɔɔ kamɛ, diayɔ ni di kasɔkakyekɔ dialaase ni di kayɛntɛlekɔ yi, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di Hanani obisuɔtɔbi Yehu sekofolaa kamɛ, n-se bɛɛkpana beekpee ni di Israel baka kukũ kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 20:35" />Nni sɛmaa yi, Yuda ɔka Yehosafat labla kanya kanwii ku Israel ɔka Ahasia wɔ niakpi ni lɛpɔɔ di amumu ɔbla suoto. <verse eid="2CH 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 20:36" />Aatunako nwɔ baawola seklo se nikatɔɔbla ni sɛkpɛ. Baawolasĩ baaloo ni di Esion-Geber sɛmaa yi, <verse eid="2CH 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 20:37" />Dodawahu wɔ niakye ni Maresa obisuɔtɔbi Eliesa labuɛ ɔlaa aatɛ di Yehosafat suoto, aabuɛ alɛ, “Ta fatɔɔbla ni onwii ku Ahasia oso yi, SAATE nwu kamalalaasa lɛsaa le fɛɛbla nii.” Seklo nwu lababiɛ nioso sitasinfuo ɔkpɛ ɔbla di ntu osi.<verse eid="2CH 20:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2CH 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 21:1" />Ninfɛ di Yehosafat latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ, ni baakokaa nwɔ ku mma di Dawid Okpoo kplɛ nɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yehoram labayila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Yehoram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 21:2" />Yehoram lawɛ babilɛma-suɔtɔbi ba niale ni Yehosafat babisuɔtɔbi. Mma niale: Asaria, Yehiel, Sekaria, Asaria, Mikael ku Sefatia. Mba mmle bamuu niale Israel ɔka Yehosafat babisuɔtɔbi nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 21:3" />Ote lɛma lata ma koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle akyɛsaa kpinwu ku asaa ya niafũ ni kɔya, diakyakaa ni di Yuda sekpoo kplɛ siene, kafɔɔ aayɔ sɛka kalekɔ nwu aata Yehoram diekye nnwɔɔ niale nwɔ obisuɔtɔbi kasale nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 21:4" />Di Yehoram lase ni suoto nɔɔ kpinkpĩ di ote sɛka kalekɔ suoto yi, aalo babilɛma-suɔtɔbi bamuu ku Israel batii finle bawo. <verse eid="2CH 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 21:5" />Yehoram lafũ alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ-anyɔ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ anɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 21:6" />Aakyɛ di Israel baka sisuku suoto, fɛ mmle di Ahab leyo kamɛ batii labla nii, diekye Ahab obisankobi aayɔ. Aabla dikpile di SAATE nwu anu. <verse eid="2CH 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 21:7" />Kafɔɔ, ta kanya ninii le di SAATE nwu labla ni ku Dawid oso yi, SAATE nwu ditamiɛ alɛ ɔɔwɔɔsa Dawid leyo kamɛ. Aabuɛ aatɛ alɛ abata kandiɛ n-wɛ anta nnwɔɔ ku banantii nɔɔ dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="2CH 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 21:8" />Di Yehoram obe kamɛ yi, Edom batii lataka baayila di Yuda suoto ni baase mma bamu ɔka nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 21:9" />Nioso Yehoram lakyɛ nfa ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ ku bakeke nɔɔ ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni bamuu. Edom batii lamana nwɔ ku bakeke nɔɔ kanyabayilatɛ baakyi, kafɔɔ baataka ku kakyɛ baabuo ma kaamɛ baafe. <verse eid="2CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 21:10" />Nioso di Edom ntaka an-yila di Yuda suoto diɛbase bia miɛ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 21:10">Obe nwu onwii kamɛ di Libna okpoo lataka kuayila di Yehoram suoto nɛ, ta aasĩ ni SAATE nwu, bate nɔɔ Yaa oso. <verse eid="2CH 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 21:11" />Aatofo kafɔɔ ntakalekɔ di Yuda akpenkpe osi, ni aata Yerusalem batii layɔ suoto lɛma baata afiɔ osumu, ni aaleko kafɔɔ Yuda batii katũ baadiɛ SAATE nwu osumu nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 21:12" />Ni di Yehoram lafũ kukũ aakyeko ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Elia nfũ, kuabuɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="2CH 21:12">“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, teefɔ Dawid Yaa, kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Fatakyɛ di teefɔ Yehosafat ee Yuda ɔka Asa sisuku suoto. <verse eid="2CH 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 21:13" />Kafɔɔ fɛɛkyɛ di Israel baka sisuku suoto, ni feeleko Yuda ku Yerusalem batii katũ bɛɛlayɔ suoto lɛma bɛɛta afiɔ osumu, fɛ mmle okle di Ahab leyo kamɛ batii labla nii. Feelo kafɔɔ afɔ omu babilee-suɔtɔbi, teefɔ leyo kamɛ batii, batii ba nialɛ ni nwaa baalenkee fɔ nii. <verse eid="2CH 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 21:14" />Nioso nunua yi, SAATE nwu nfɛ kamasafɔ batii lɛfɔ, babisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ, basɔfɔ lɛfɔ ku lɛsaa biala le ninle fɔ ni lele ku lɛklɔɛklɔɛ nutule. <verse eid="2CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 21:15" />Afɔ omu lɛfɔ fababuo ofiɛ osie kanya, kafutu ofiɛ kamapɛ fɔ, ninaase di obe wɔ di ofiɛ nwu kamata sɛfɔtɔ lɛfɔ ndie nii.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 21:16" />Ni di SAATE nwu lata Filisti ku Arab batii ba niasiɛ baakaako ni Etiopia batii lataka baayila di Yehoram suoto nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 21:17" />Baadieko Yuda, baafũ nwu, ni baayɔ asaa ya amuu baanya ni di ɔka lɛkayo kamɛ baasifiko nɛ. Baamufũ kafɔɔ basɔfɔ nɔɔ ku babi nɔɔ baasifiko. Obisuɔtɔbi kuonwii ditabu nwɔ dilenkee Ahasia, obisɔnle nwu.<verse eid="2CH 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 21:18" />Di n-ya mmle amuu sɛmaa yi, SAATE nwu lakpee Yehoram kafutu kamɛ ofiɛ kpile wɔ manamafuo ni kɔfa omiɛ. <verse eid="2CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 21:19" />Di obe owo kamɛ, di ofiɛ nɔɔ lɛlɛɛ nyɔɔfa kayɛntɛkɔ yi, sɛfɔtɔ nɔɔ ladie ta ofiɛ nwu oso, ni aakpi di dibuo kplɛ ɔnya kamɛ nɛ. Batii nɔɔ ditakutaa ɔtɔ kuonwii bakpee nwɔ dibu, fɛ mmle baabla baata ni bate nɔɔ.<verse eid="2CH 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 21:20" />Alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ-anyɔ di Yehoram lafũ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ anɛ nɛ. Aakpi, kafɔɔ kukpi nɔɔ ditabuo otii kuonwii suoto, ni baakookaa nwɔ di Dawid Okpoo kplɛ kamɛ nɛ. Kafɔɔ batakookaa nwɔ di baka sɛkya kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 21:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2CH 22" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Ahasia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 22:1" />Yerusalem batii layɔ Ahasia wɔ niale ni Yehoram obisuɔtɔbi bisɔnle, baase sɛka di disi nɔɔ, diekye bayu ba niawa ni kasikɔ nwu lalo babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔfole bamuu. Nioso Yuda ɔka Yehoram obisuɔtɔbi Ahasia lakyekasɔ aatoole sɛka.<verse eid="2CH 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 22:2" />Alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-anyɔ di Ahasia lafũ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem lɛlɛɛ ninwii nɛ. Ɔya leyooto niale Atalia, aale ni Omri ɔwa sankobi.<verse eid="2CH 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 22:3" />Nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ aakyɛ di Ahab leyo sisuku, diekye ɔya lakpee nwɔ osie di ɔtanlolaa ɔbla suoto. <verse eid="2CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 22:4" />Aabla okpile di SAATE nwu anu, fɛ mmle di Ahab leyo kamɛ batii labla nii, diekye di ote kukpi kamaa yi, baabakple nwɔ asibubatatɛ, diata kawɔɔ nɔɔ. <verse eid="2CH 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 22:5" />Kɔkà lɛma kafɔɔ aatikanko di obe wɔ aakyɛ ni ku Israel ɔka Yoram wɔ niale ni Ahab obisuɔtɔbi baalakpɛko ni Siria ɔka Hasael di Ramot Gilead. Ni di Siria batii latitika Yoram nkɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 22:6" />Nioso Ɔka Ahasia lapɛakple aasifi Yesreel alɛ ɔɔlaabla suoto kɔfa di nkɔ be baatika nwɔ ni di suoto di Ramot, di kakpɛ nɔɔ ɔkpɛ kamɛ ku Siria ɔka Hasael.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 22:6">Ninfɛ di Yuda ɔka Yehoram obisuɔtɔbi Asaria<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nnwɔɔ nwu manlɛɛ alɛ Ahasia nɛ</char></note> lasoo aakyɛ Yesreel alɛ ɔɔlanyu Ahab obisuɔtɔbi Yoram ta baatika nwɔ ni nkɔ oso.<verse eid="2CH 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 22:7" />Diefe ni di ɔkyɛ wɔ di Ahasia lakyɛ ni Yoram nfũ oso di Yaa lata Ahasia lapɛ kaasɔ nɛ. Obe wɔ di Ahasia lalaabuo ni yi, aadie aakyɛ manko Yoram baalaakyakako Nimsi obisuɔtɔbi Yehu, nnwɔ di SAATE nwu lapɛ ni ɔfɔɔ alɛ awɔɔsa ni Ahab leyo kamɛ batii. <verse eid="2CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 22:8" />Di Yehu latɔɔkanko ni Ahab leyo kamɛ batii yi, aanya Yuda banɔɔfotii ku Ahasia babisuɔtɔbi batii, mba niatoonyu ni Ahasia, ni aalo ma nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 22:9" />Ninfɛ aakyɛ aalaawolaa Ahasia, ni di batii nɔɔ lamufũ nwɔ di obe wɔ aawofa ni di Samaria nɛ. Ni baakpaa nwɔ baawako Yehu baabalo nɛ. Baakokaa nwɔ, diekye baabuɛ alɛ, “Yehosafat obisuɔtɔbi aale, nnwɔ niawolaa ni SAATE nwu ku otu nɔɔ omuu.” Nioso otii kuonwii ditasinwɛ di Ahasia leyo kamɛ aawɛ ni osie aata ni sɛka kalekɔ nwu.<verse eid="2CH 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔkasanko Atalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 22:10" />Di Ahasia ɔya Atalia lanya alɛ obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ ntookpi ni yi, ni aakyɛ aalaawɔɔsa Yuda leyo kamɛ sɛka baletɛ bamuu nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 22:11" />Kafɔɔ Ɔka Yehoram obisankobi Yehosabat, lakpaa Ahasia obisuɔtɔbi Yoas aatosoko di ɔka banɔɔfotii ba alɛ babalo ni kamɛ aasifiko, ni aayɔ nwɔ ku nyuntɛ nɔɔ aalaakpee di leyotenle ninwii kamɛ nɛ. Ta di Yehosabat, Ɔka Yehoram obisankobi ku oletatɛ Yehoida ɔsɔfɔ lale ni Ahasia obilema-sankobi oso yi, aayɔ obisɔ nwu aawofasa, nioso Atalia ditafuo nwɔ olo. <verse eid="2CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 22:12" />Aasiɛ di kawofakɔ nwu di Yaa olekatakɔ kamɛ alɛɛ akuɔ di obe wɔ di Atalia latoole ni sɛka di kasɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="2CH 22:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2CH 23" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔtaka Oyila Di Ɔkasanko Atalia Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 23:1" />Yehoiada ladiki osie nɔɔ aatuo di lɛlɛɛ kuɛnsinle kamɛ. Aabla kanya ninii ku bakpɛtɛ kɔlafa akudi kanyabayilatɛ: Yeroham obisuɔtɔbi Asaria, Yehohanan obisuɔtɔbi Ismael, Obed obisuɔtɔbi Asaria, Adaia obisuɔtɔbi Maaseia ku Sikri obisuɔtɔbi Elisafat. <verse eid="2CH 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 23:2" />Baakyɛ baakyi Yuda omuu baasiisa Lewi batii ku Israel ayo kamɛ banɔɔfo baakyeko sekpoo nwu simuu. Baabadu ni Yerusalem yi, <verse eid="2CH 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 23:3" />kasiisakɔ nwu kamuu labla kanya ninii ku ɔka di Yaa olekatakɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 23:3">Yehoiada latɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Ɔka obisuɔtɔbi nwu kamale sɛka, fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu labuɛ aatɛ aata ni Dawid banantii. <verse eid="2CH 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 23:4" />Kanunua yi, nya lɛsaa le biɛbla ni: Aye olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii dikyuu tiɛfa ninwii le ninkyɛ ni ɔkpɛ kamɛ di Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi suoto batoonyu n-yoko, <verse eid="2CH 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 23:5" />dikyuu tiɛfa lee ninwii bawɛ di lɛkayo, di dikyuu tiɛfa ninwii kafɔɔ bawɛ di Lɛsɔse Kayoko. Batii bule bamuu kafɔɔ bawɛ di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ nflɔnkɔ. <verse eid="2CH 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 23:6" />Kuonwii atambuo SAATE nwu olekatakɔ diediki olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii ba ninkpe ni di ɔkpɛ kamɛ; baafuo obuo diekye beekleklesa ma suoto, kafɔɔ batii bule bamuu batoonyu ɔkpɛ wɔ di SAATE nwu lɛta ma ni. <verse eid="2CH 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 23:7" />Lewi batii bamana ɔka bakyi, otii biala lɛma aklee lɛkpɛsaa nɔɔ di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ. Dikpe ni beelo otii lele niebuo olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ. Bikaako ɔka di kakɔ lele oofe.”<verse eid="2CH 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 23:8" />Lewi batii ku Yuda batii nwu bamuu labla fɛ mmle okle di oletatɛ Yehoiada labuɛ ni kanya. Obiala lakpaa batii nɔɔ- mba ninkyɛ ni ɔkpɛ kamɛ di Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi suoto ku mba nikokple ni di ɔkpɛ kamɛ- diekye oletatɛ Yehoiada ditadiɛ bakpɛmblatɛ dikudi kuninwii alɛ asifi leyo. <verse eid="2CH 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 23:9" />Ninfɛ di oletatɛ Yehoiada layɔ akplɔ ku kubiafunsaa akplɛ ku abibii ya niale ni Ɔka Dawid ale ya niate ni di Yaa olekatakɔ kamɛ aata akudi kɔlafa kanyabayilatɛ nwu nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 23:10" />Aayɔ batii nwu bamuu aasesee, obiala laklee lɛkpɛsaa nɔɔ di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ, baamana ɔka baakyi- diakaako ni oleɔta akyikye ku olekatakɔ nwu, diayɔ ni di kalakasɔ lɛkyɛ dialaadu ni olekatakɔ nwu katookasɔ lɛkyɛ.<verse eid="2CH 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 23:11" />Ni di Yehoiada ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ ladiki ɔka obisuɔtɔbi nwu baawako, ni baayɔ lɛkakoto baatukũsa nwɔ di disi; ni baayɔ kanya ninii kukũ nwu baakpee nwɔ ninnɛɛ, ni baase nwɔ sɛka nɛ. Baapɛ nwɔ ɔfɔɔ, baataa siwidi baabuɛ alɛ, “Yiiyiiduu, Ɔka asiɛ nkpa aklɛ!”<verse eid="2CH 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 23:12" />Obe wɔ di Atalia lanu ni batii nwu kotoso, mantaa ni siwidi, mantansa ni kafɔɔ ɔka yi, ni aakyɛ ɔkyɛ lɛma di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 23:13" />Aanyu nii, ni aanya ɔka n-yɛ di lɛkpaka nɔɔ ɔlɔɔkɔ di kayoko nɛ. Bakpɛtɛ banɔɔfotii ku akyukyoo bafɛtɛ layila di ɔka ɔlɔɔkɔ, kasɔ nwu suoto batii bamuu kafɔɔ latɔɔnya suoto lɛyɔɔ, baatɔɔfɛ kafɔɔ akyukyoo, sinubasantɛ kafɔɔ laklee sinu asansaa baatɔɔsa katansa sinu. Ninfɛ di Atalia labɛbɛɛ akpeele wua nɔɔ, aafaa aabuɛ alɛ, “Kale abiɛsaa nɛ! Kale abiɛsaa nɛ!<verse eid="2CH 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 23:14" />Ni di oletatɛ Yehoiada lalɛɛ akudi kɔlafa kanyabayilatɛ nwu aasifiko kayi, mba niayila ni di bakpɛtɛ akudi kanya, ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ: “Bidieko ɔsanko nwu di banyuntɛ nwɔ obo biwako kayi, bielo kafɔɔ otii lele nintikanko nwɔ ni ku kapamii.” Diekye oletatɛ nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Bitanlo nwɔ di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kamɛ.” <verse eid="2CH 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 23:15" />Nioso baamufũ nwɔ di obe wɔ aadu ni Pɔnkɔ Kayoko kanya di lɛkayo kaflɔnkɔ, ni baalo nwɔ ninfa nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehoiada Lawako Kakyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 23:16" />Ninfɛ di Yehoiada labla kanya ninii alɛ nnwɔɔ ku batii nwu ku ɔka kamale SAATE nwu batii nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 23:17" />Ni di batii nwu bamuu ladie baakyɛ Baal olekatakɔ baalaabiɛ ka baatɛ kaasɔ nɛ. Baabibiɛ oleɔta akyikye ku afiɔtii nwu, ni baalo Baal oletatɛ Matan di oleɔta akyikye nwu anu nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 23:18" />Ninfɛ di Yehoiada layɔ SAATE nwu olekatakɔ onyu aakpee di olebatatɛ ba niale ni Lewi batii nnɛɛ nɛ. Mba di Dawid lata ni sɛkpɛ di olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ, alɛ baatɔɔta ni SAATE nwu ofiɛ asaaɔta fɛ mmle bɛɛkpana beekpee ni di Mose Kufiofa kukũ kamɛ. Di suoto lɛyɔɔ ku sinu ɔsa kamɛ, fɛ mmle di Dawid labuɛ ni kanya. <verse eid="2CH 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 23:19" />Aasesee kafɔɔ n-yoko banyuntɛ di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ n-yoko alɛ otii kuonwii di osuku lele suoto ananklekle ni dilaabuo nii.<verse eid="2CH 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 23:20" />Ni di Yehoiada lakpaa akudi kɔlafa kanyabayilatɛ, banɔɔfotii kplɛ, batii nwu batunletɛ ku kasɔ nwu batii bamuu ku nnwɔɔ, ni baasooko ɔka baakyeko SAATE nwu olekatakɔ baawako nɛ. Baafe di Katoo Kayoko baabuo lɛkayo nwu kamɛ, ni baasiɛsa ɔka di lɛkakpomii suoto, <verse eid="2CH 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 23:21" />ni di kasɔ nwu suoto batii bamuu lanya suoto lɛyɔɔ nɛ. Ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu lalo kanana nɛ, diekye baalo Atalia ku kapamii.<verse eid="2CH 23:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2CH 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Yoas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 24:1" />Alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ di Yoas lafũ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ afosi-ana nɛ. Ɔya leyooto niale Sibia; aakye ni Beer-Seba. <verse eid="2CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 24:2" />Yoas labla lɛsaa le niasiɛko ni di SAATE nwu anu di oletatɛ Yehoiada alɛɛ amuu kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 24:3" />Yehoiada ladiki basɔfɔ banyɔ aatɔɔ, ni aalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 24:4" />Di obe owo sɛmaa yi, Yoas latɛ alɛ oose SAATE nwu olekatakɔ lelolaa. <verse eid="2CH 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 24:5" />Ni aalɛɛ olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii aasiisa aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bitɔɔkyɛ Yuda sekpoo biɛlaafũ ato ya manta ni lɛlɛɛ biala bikyeko Israel omuu nfũ, diɛta ni Yaa lee olekatakɔ ololaa. Bibla ni kanunua.” Kafɔɔ Lewi batii ditadiki kɔkpaa wla.<verse eid="2CH 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 24:6" />Nioso ɔka lalɛɛ oletatɛ nɔɔfo Yehoiada ni aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Obe lɛsaa oso fananyu falɛ Lewi batii lɛkyɛ Yuda ku Yerusalem bɛɛlaafũ akpooto ya di SAATE nwu kpɛmblatɛ Mose ku Israel kasiisakɔ nwu latika baata ni Kanya Ninii Lekpaayo le Mansi ni?”<verse eid="2CH 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 24:7" />Nunua Atalia ɔsanko kpiletɛ nwu batii ntoobiɛ Yaa olekatakɔ nwu beebuo bɛɛlaayɔ bia asaa klekle nwu bɛɛblako ɔkpɛ bɛɛta Baal.<verse eid="2CH 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 24:8" />Ni di ɔka lata baabla asaaɔta lɛlakaa, ni baayɔ ni baase kaayi, di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kayoko nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 24:9" />Ni baayie lɛkya di Yuda ku Yerusalem alɛ bayɔ akpooto ya di Yaa kpɛmblatɛ nwu Mose lakaalɛ aakyeko ni Israel batii nfũ di ɔfaafuu kamɛ bawako SAATE nwu nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 24:10" />Ni di banɔɔfotii nwu bamuu ku batii nwu bamuu layɔ asaa okũ lɛma baawako ku suoto lɛyɔɔ, baayɔ nya baatookpee di lɛlakaa nwu kamɛ dilaase di obe wɔ di lɛlakaa nwu layii nii. <verse eid="2CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 24:11" />Obe lele di Lewi batii lɛyɔ lɛlakaa nwu bɛɛwako ɔka banɔɔfotii, bɛɛnya alɛ koto kpinwu nsi di lɛlakaa nwu kamɛ yi, lɛkayo kukũ kpanatɛ ku oletatɛ nɔɔfo nwu ɔnɔɔfotii nkyɛ manaanyɛɛnɛ koto nwu di lɛlakaa nwu kamɛ, mankplesa lɛlakaa nwu manaase di lɛba nini. Mambla nle mmle obe biala, ni baawɛ koto kpinwu nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 24:12" />Ninfɛ di ɔka ku Yehoiada layɔ koto nwu baata batii ba niabla ni ɔkpɛ wɔ niafĩ ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ nɛ. Baata ayo batofotɛ ku ayo babantɛ koto alɛ base SAATE nwu olekatakɔ lelolaa. Baata kafɔɔ bakpɛntɛ ba nimbla ni sɛkpɛ di abɔɔsaa wɛɛfɛɛ ku abɔɔsaa sɛɛle suoto alɛ balolaa olekatakɔ nwu.<verse eid="2CH 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 24:13" />Batii ba niayila ni di ɔkpɛ nwu kanya labla ɔkpɛ ku okyiini, ɔkpɛ nwu lakyɛ sitũ di kalɔ lɛma. Baase Yaa olekatakɔ nwu letofo di nninimu letembi kanya, baata ni diakple diawɛ osie nwaa. <verse eid="2CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 24:14" />Obe wɔ baaloo ni yi, baayɔ koto bule baawako ɔka ku Yehoiada, ni baayɔ kũ baabla SAATE nwu olekatakɔ anwansaa nɛ: anwansaa diata ni kasumu ɔkpɛ ku ofiɛ asaaɔta, akaku ku koto sɛɛle ku koto fututu asaa bamba. Ni baatɔɔta ofiɛ asaaɔta di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kamɛ obe lele, di Yehoiada lanya aasiɛ ni osiɛ nkpa nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 24:15" />Yehoiada labe, aafũ alɛɛ kpinwu, ni aakpi di obe wɔ aafũ ni alɛɛ kɔlafa-afosi-atiɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 24:16" />Baakookaa nwɔ ku baka di Dawid Okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ, ta dibiene le aabla ni di Israel aata ni Yaa ku olekatakɔ nɔɔ oso.<verse eid="2CH 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoas Asiensiesaa Ɔbla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 24:17" />Di Yehoiada lakpi ni sɛmaa yi, Yuda banɔɔfotii lawa baabasɛɛsa ɔka, ɔka kafɔɔ lanu ma ɔlaa. <verse eid="2CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 24:18" />Ni baadiɛ SAATE nwu olekatakɔ, bate lɛma Yaa nwu baatɛ, ni baalaasumu Asera sewoso ku afiɔtii nɛ. Ta lɛpɔɔ lɛma nwu okpi oso yi, Yaa ɔblɔ lasoo di Yuda ku Yerusalem suoto. <verse eid="2CH 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 24:19" />Nu di SAATE nwu lakpee batii nwu ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ alɛ baakplesa ma manwako ɔkyɛ nɔɔ, nu baasĩ kafɔɔ ɔlaa baata ma yi, batanu.<verse eid="2CH 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 24:20" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu Ninwuna labuo di oletatɛ Yehoiada obisuɔtɔbi Sakaria suoto nɛ. Ni aayila di batii nwu anu aabuɛ alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di Yaa kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Obe oso biesĩ SAATE nwu afiofa? Asaa dilɔbalɛ ye ɔkyɛ. Ta bitoosĩ ni SAATE nwu oso yi, nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ atosĩ ye.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 24:21" />Kafɔɔ baakũ kanwumbe di suoto nɔɔ, ninfɛ di ɔka kanya didiki kanya yi, ni baasafɔ nwɔ afuɔ baalo di SAATE nwu kaflɔnkɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 24:22" />Ɔka Yoas ditanyuma sifutulɛ se di Sakaria ote Yehoiada lale nwɔ nii, kafɔɔ aalo ni obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ wɔ niabuɛ ni di obe wɔ aatookpi ni alɛ, “SAATE nwu anya nle mmle, aata letota ata fɔ.”<verse eid="2CH 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoas Sɛka Ole Kayɛntɛkɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 24:23" />Di lɛlɛɛ lakyi diawa ni yi, Siria batii bakpɛtɛ lataka kakpɛ di Yoas suoto; Baatu baabuo di Yuda ku Yerusalem suoto, ni baalo batii nwu kanyabayilatɛ bamuu nɛ. Ni baayɔ kakpɛ kamɛ asaa amuu baakyɛnko ɔka lɛma di Damasko nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 24:24" />Nu di Siria batii bakpɛtɛ lakyɛ ku batii basɛɛ lete yi, SAATE nwu layɔ bakpɛtɛ ba niatɛbaapɔ ni aakpee ma ninnɛɛ. Ta Yuda lasĩ ni SAATE nwu, bate lɛma Yaa nwu oso di lɛkanko lawa di Yoas suoto nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 24:25" />Di obe wɔ di Siria batii ladie baasifi nii, baatika Yoas nkɔ di suoto osie kanya. Ni di Yoas banɔɔfotii nɔɔ lasi kanya di suoto nɔɔ, ta aalo ni oletatɛ Yehoiada obisuɔtɔbi oso, ni baalo nwɔ di atensaa nɔɔ suoto nɛ. Nioso aakpi, ni baakookaa nwɔ di Dawid Okpoo kplɛ nɛ, kafɔɔ batakookaa nwɔ di baka sɛkya kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 24:26" />Batii ba niasi ni kanya di suoto nɔɔ niale Sabad, Amon batii ɔsanko nwu Simat obisuɔtɔbi, ku Yehosabad, Moab batii ɔsanko nwu Simrit obisuɔtɔbi. <verse eid="2CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 24:27" />Yoas babisuɔtɔbi suoto sɛlaa, sɛlaa obuɛɔtɛ kpinwu okyeko suoto nɔɔ, ku asaa ya aabla ni di Yaa olekatakɔ ose lelolaa suoto yi, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di baka sɛlaa nsũ ɔtɛ kukũ kamɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Amasia layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2CH 25" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Amasia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 25:1" />Alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-anɔɔ di Amasia lafũ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-anansĩ nɛ. Ɔya leyooto niale Yehoadan; Yerusalem aakye. <verse eid="2CH 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 25:2" />Amasia labla lɛsaa le niasiɛko ni di SAATE nwu anu, kafɔɔ diele ku otu nɔɔ omuu. <verse eid="2CH 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 25:3" />Obe wɔ di sɛka kalekɔ nwu layila ni kpinkpĩ di kalɔ nɔɔ yi, aalo banɔɔfotii ba nialo ni ote ɔka. <verse eid="2CH 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 25:4" />Kafɔɔ atalo babisuɔtɔbi lɛma, kafɔɔ aabla di mmle bɛɛkpana ni di Kufiofa kamɛ, di Mose Kukũ kamɛ, lɛba le di SAATE nwu lakpee ni kufiofa alɛ: “Blɔbalo babi bate di babi lɛma disi, ee balo babi di bate lɛma disi; kafɔɔ obiala kamakpi di nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ sikpile suoto.”<verse eid="2CH 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amasia Lakpɛko Edom Batii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 25:5" />Amasia lalɛɛ Yuda batii aasiisa ni aase ma di ayo lɛma kanya aabla ma nkpe kanyabayilatɛ ku alafa kanyabayilatɛ aata Yuda ku Benyamin omuu. Ninfɛ aasiisa basuɔtɔ ba nitoofũ ni alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ ee batoofũ balenke nii, ni aanya alɛ basuɔtɔ nkpe alafa-atiɛ lalolaa suoto baata kakpɛ ɔkyɛ, baafuo ni lɛkplɔ ku kubidifunsaa oklee nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 25:6" />Aakyeko kafɔɔ bakpɛtɛ nkpe kɔlafa Israel aawako, aata ma koto fututu bakilo nkpe-ntiɛ-alafa-ana di kakpɛ ka babakpɛ ni kanya.<verse eid="2CH 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 25:7" />Kafɔɔ Yaa otii onwii lawa ɔkyɛ nɔɔ ni aabatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Oo ɔka, dinaa alɛ bakpɛtɛ ba mmle niekye ni Israel lɛkyɛ kakpɛ ku afɔ, diekye SAATE nwu diesiko Israel- aasi ku Efraim batii ba mmle kuonwii. <verse eid="2CH 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 25:8" />Bia nse fɛɛkyɛ fɛɛlaakpɛ kakpɛ di okyiini kamɛ yi, Yaa kamata fannɔɔ kakpɛ di balo lɛfɔ anu, diekye osie nkpe Yaa alɛ aakyakaako ee aata otii nnɔɔ kakpɛ.”<verse eid="2CH 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 25:9" />Ni di Amasia lakaalɛ Yaa otii nwu alɛ, “Ni lɛnfɛ kamabla nkyeko koto fututu bakilo nkpe-ntiɛ-alafa-ana ko lata ni Israel bakpɛtɛ nwu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 25:9">Ni di Yaa otii nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “SAATE nwu kamafuo fɔ ɔta olenkeesa nkpo.”<verse eid="2CH 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 25:10" />Nioso Amasia ladiki bakpɛtɛ ba niakye Efraim baawa ni osuku aata ma baasifi ayo lɛma. Ɔblɔ lafiɛ ma osie kanya di Yuda suoto ni baasifi ayo lɛma di lɛblɔfiɛ kplɛ kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 25:11" />Ninfɛ di Amasia lakpee suoto nɔɔ osie ni aaleko bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ katũ baakyɛ Mmba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kanya ninii ka ninlalaa ni diidii</char></note> Ɔtaata, lɛbale aalo ni Seir bakpɛtɛ nkpe lefosi nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 25:12" />Yuda bakpɛtɛ kafɔɔ lamufũ bakpɛtɛ ba ninkpe ni nkpa, nkpe lefosi, baakpaa ma baasifiko difuɔnkpaa nsintɛɛ, ni baatukusa ma baakpee di kalɔ nwu, bamuu lɛma labɛbɛɛ kɔkyɛɛkyɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 25:13" />Kafɔɔ bakpɛtɛ ba di Amasia lata baasifi ni ayo lɛma, atata ma osuku baakyɛ ni kakpɛ lalaatu baabuo di Yuda batii sekpoo kamɛ diayɔ ni di Samaria dialaadu ni Bet-Horon. Baalo batii nkpe ntiɛ ni baatuka kakpɛ kamɛ asaa kpinwu baasifiko nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 25:14" />Di Amasia lalaalo Edom batii aakple ni yi, aayɔ Seir batii afiɔ aawako. Ni aayɔ nya aatɛ fɛ nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ afiɔ, aawakasɔ aata nya, ni aata ofiɛ seleɔta aata nya nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 25:15" />Ɔblɔ lafiɛ SAATE nwu di Amasia suoto, ni aakpee ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ ɔkyɛ nɔɔ, aalaakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Obe lɛsaa oso fowolaa asaa kamɛ di batii ba mmle afiɔ ya nitafuo ni batii lɛma bamu nkpa ofũ okyeko nnɛɛ lɛfɔ?”<verse eid="2CH 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 25:16" />Di obe wɔ aatɔɔkakatɛ ni ɔkakatɛ yi, ni di ɔka nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Buodiki fɔ bulɛ le ɔka disibutatɛ? Lo kanana! Obe oso foomiɛ falɛ balo fɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 25:16">Nioso ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu lalo kanana, kafɔɔ aabuɛ alɛ, “N-ye nlɛ Yaa lɛtɛ alɛ abawɔɔsa fɔ, ta nle fatɔbla ni fanankyɔɔ ni kɔkà nii atoko oso.”<verse eid="2CH 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakpɛ Ku Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 25:17" />Di ɔka Amasia ku asibu batatɛ nɔɔ lakpee asi baawo baaloo ni sɛmaa yi, ni aata Israel ɔka Yoas wɔ niale ni Yehoahas obisuɔtɔbi, aale ni Yehu obisuɔtɔbi kanya ka mmle alɛ: “Wa, fabakyakakoe anu ku anu.”<verse eid="2CH 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 25:18" />Kafɔɔ Israel ɔka Yoas latɔkɔ Yuda ɔka Amasia alɛ: “Owuu di Lebanon lɛta sida kowoso di Lebanon kanya alɛ, ‘Yɔ obisankobi lɛfɔ fata obisuɔtɔbi nii ayɔ.’ Ninfɛ di lepoo kamɛ bɔkɛɛ lawa aabananafu owuu nwu aakaasa kaasɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 25:19" />Feebuɛ fɛɛtɔkɔ suoto lɛfɔ falɛ fatoolenkee Edom, nunua footuo suoto fantakatɛ suoto katoo kafɔɔ. Kafɔɔ siɛ leeyo! Be oso foomiɛ ɔlaa ku kasɔ ɔpɛ fanta afɔ omu lɛfɔ ku Yuda kafɔɔ?”<verse eid="2CH 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 25:20" />Kafɔɔ, Amasia ditanu, diekye Yaa niabla nle mmle alɛ aayɔ ma ankpee di Yoas nnɛɛ, diekye baawolaa asaa kamɛ baakyeko Edom afiɔ nfũ. <verse eid="2CH 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 25:21" />Nioso Israel ɔka Yoas ladieko ma kakpɛ. Nnwɔɔ ku Yuda ɔka Amasia lakyɔɔ bawo anu di Bet-Semes di Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 25:22" />Israel lalenkee Yuda, ni di otii biala latoso aasifi leyo nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 25:23" />Israel ɔka Yehoas lamufũ Yuda ɔka Amasia wɔ niale ni Yoas obisuɔtɔbi, aale ni Ahasia obisuɔtɔbi, di Bet-Semes. Ninfɛ di Yehoas lakpaa nwɔ aawako Yerusalem, ni di Yehoas labiɛ Yerusalem oyoyiɛ aatɛ kaasɔ diayɔ ni di Efraim Kayoko dialaadu Leyokɔ Kayoko- di lɛkaana labla ni fɛ nkpaa alafa-akuɔ. <verse eid="2CH 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 25:24" />Aayɔ koto sɛɛle ku koto fututu kumuu ku anwansaa ya amuu aanya ni di Yaa olekatakɔ nwu niawɛ ni di Obed-Edom kanyu kalɔ, diakyakaa ni ku lɛkayo lɛsaawɛ ku batii ba niasiɛ ni di sɛlanle kamɛ, ni aakple aasifi Samaria nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 25:25" />Yuda ɔka Amasia wɔ niale ni Yoas obisuɔtɔbi lasiɛ nkpa lefosi-alɛɛ-anɔɔ di Israel ɔka Yehoas wɔ niale ni Yehoahas obisuɔtɔbi kukpi sɛmaa. <verse eid="2CH 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 25:26" />Amasia sɛka olebee sɛsaabla bamba se aabla nii, diayɔ ni di kasɔ kakyekɔ dialaadu ni kayɛntɛkɔ yi, bɛɛkpana nya bɛɛkpee di Yuda ku Israel baka kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 25:27" />Diayɔ ni di obe wɔ di Amasia ladiɛ ni SAATE nwu otikanko, baasi ni kanya di suoto nɔɔ di Yerusalem aatoso aasifi Lakis, kafɔɔ baakpee batii baati nwɔ baakyɛ di Lakis baalalo nwɔ ninfa. <verse eid="2CH 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 25:28" />Baayɔ kpi nɔɔ baatika di pɔnkɔ suoto baawako baabakookaa nwɔ ku bate nɔɔ di Yuda Okpoo kplɛ.<verse eid="2CH 25:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="2CH 26" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Usia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 26:1" />Ni di Yuda batii bamuu layɔ Usia wɔ niafũ ni lefosi alɛɛ akuɔ, ni baayɔ nwɔ baase sɛka di ote Amasia kanya nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 26:2" />Nnwɔɔ niale nwɔ niase ni Elot okpoo dibudi aalolaa nwu aata Yuda di Amasia lalaatɛ ni ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ sɛmaa nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 26:3" />Lefosi alɛɛ akuɔ di Usia lafũ di obe wɔ aabale ni ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ afosi-anɔɔ-anyɔ nɛ. Ɔya leyooto niale Yekalia; aakye ni Yerusalem. <verse eid="2CH 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 26:4" />Aabla lɛsaa le niasiɛko ni di SAATE nwu anu, fɛ mmle okle di ote Amasia labla nii. <verse eid="2CH 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 26:5" />Aawolaa Yaa di Sakaria obe kamɛ, nnwɔ niatuo nwɔ ni asaa di Yaa ɔyɛkɛ kamɛ. Di Usia latoowolaa ni owolaa SAATE nwu yi, Yaa latɔɔ lɛtɔtrɔ.<verse eid="2CH 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 26:6" />Aakyɛ kakpɛ ku Filisti batii, ni aabiɛ Gat, Yabne ku Asdod seyoyiɛ aatɛ kaasɔ nɛ. Ni aase sekpoo se niakaako ni Asdod ku aba bamba di Filisti batii kamɛ dibudi nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 26:7" />Yaa lakyakaako nwɔ aakpɛko Filisti batii ku Arab batii ba niasiɛ ni di Gur-Baal ku Meun batii. <verse eid="2CH 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 26:8" />Amon batii lawako Usia kɔsɔsĩ, ni di leyooto nɔɔ lakpɛ̀ dialaadu bia Egipte kɔmɛ nɛ, diekye aabawɛ osie nwaa.<verse eid="2CH 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 26:9" />Usia latofo ayo takale di Yerusalem di Leyokɔ Kayoko, Ɔtaata Kayoko ku oyoyiɛ nwu lakɛ, ni aatofo oyoyiɛ aakyisa nya nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 26:10" />Aatofo kafɔɔ ayo takale di ɔfaafuu kamɛ aakutu kafɔɔ ntu abiɔ kpinwu, diekye babɔkɛɛ sele kpinwu lawɛ nwɔ di akpenkpe nkpaa ku kasɔ lakataa suoto. Aawɛ batii ba niatɔɔbla ni ɔkpɛ di afe nɔɔ ku nta awosobi afe di akpenkpe nwu ku nsɔ be di lɛla nsi ni suoto, diekye aabɔmbɔ kɔtɛ nwu.<verse eid="2CH 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 26:11" />Usia lawɛ bakpɛtɛ ba baananfi ni nwaa, baalolaa ni suoto baata ni kakpɛ ɔkyɛ di akudi lɛma kamɛ di lɛpɔ le kanya di kukũ kpanatɛ Yeiel ku ɔnɔɔfotii Maaseia lasiisa ni, baawɛ ni di lɛkayo ɔnɔɔfotii onwii, Hanania kanyu kalɔ. <verse eid="2CH 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 26:12" />Ayo kamɛ kanyabayilatɛ ba niayila ni di bakpɛtɛ nwu kanya lɛpɔ labla nkpe-nnyɔ-alafa akuɔ. <verse eid="2CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 26:13" />Bakpɛtɛ ba niasiɛ ma ni kaalɔ labla basuɔtɔ nkpe alafa-atiɛ-bakuɛnsĩ-alafa-anɔɔ, baananfi baata ni kakpɛ. Baale bakpɛtɛ siene baata ɔka lɛkyakaako di balo nɔɔ suoto. <verse eid="2CH 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 26:14" />Usia lata bakpɛtɛ nwu bamuu kubiafunsaa, akplɔ, abɔɔsaa akoto, akpakyaa, kɔtaa ku kutiabi. <verse eid="2CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 26:15" />Aabla kakpɛ kamɛ akpɛnsaa ya di batii ba ninkpe ni kɔnɛɛ kamɛ lɛsaatofo labla nii. Aabla nya aata ɔkpɛ ɔblako di ayo takale suoto ku ayokɔ suoto diata ni kɔtaa ɔtaa ku afuɔ kplɛ omunusa di Yerusalem. Leyooto nɔɔ lakpɛ̀ diakyɛ nkyonkɔ, diekye baatɔɔ lɛkyakaako osie kanya dialaase di obe wɔ aabawɛ ni osie nwaa.<verse eid="2CH 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lananfi Usia Kootoko Ta Suoto Nɔɔ Katoo Ɔtakatɛ Oso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 26:16" />Kafɔɔ di Usia labawɛ osie aaloo ni yi, suoto nɔɔ katoo ɔtakatɛ latɔɔ aapɛ kaasɔ. Atale onukwale aata SAATE Yaa nɔɔ nwu. Aabuo SAATE nwu olekatakɔ aalaafiɛ olufui di olufui oleɔta akyikye suoto. <verse eid="2CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 26:17" />Oletatɛ Asaria ku SAATE nwu olebatatɛ bamba ba niawɛ ni sɛkambi afosi-anɛ latikanko nwɔ baabuo olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 26:18" />Ni baasĩ ɔlaa baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Diɛlɛ alɛ afɔ, Usia, faafiɛ olufui fanta SAATE nwu. Nnwu yi, olebatatɛ ba ninle ni Aron banantii ba suoto beekleklesa bɛɛta ni olufui ofiɛ lete ninkpe osuku mambla. Die di kakleklekɔ nwu, diekye faale onukwale; SAATE Yaa nwu kafɔɔ dilɔbakpee fɔ dibu di suoto.”<verse eid="2CH 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 26:19" />Ni di Usia wɔ nialolaa suoto aaklee ni olufui lɛfiɛsaa di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ alɛ ɔbafiɛ ni olufui lanya ɔblɔ nɛ. Obe wɔ aatɔɔnya ɔblɔ aatookpeko ni olebatatɛ nwu di anu lɛma, di olufui oleɔta akyikye anu, di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kamɛ yi, ni di ofiɛ sɛɛle lakpete nwɔ di katũ nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 26:20" />Di oletatɛ-nɔɔfo Asaria ku olebatatɛ nwu bule bamuu lanyu nwɔ ni, baanya alɛ ofiɛ sɛɛle ntookpete nwɔ di katũ nɔɔ, nioso baapɛsɛwa baadieko nwɔ baasifiko kayi. Nwaako, nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ aapɛsɛwa alɛ oodie, diekye SAATE nwu lakpee nwɔ ofiɛ.<verse eid="2CH 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 26:21" />Ɔka Usia lawɛ ofiɛ sɛɛle dialase di dii le aakpi nii. Aasiɛ di leyo le niablasa ni suoto- ofiɛ sɛɛle leyo, batasintɔɔ osuku kafɔɔ aakyɛ SAATE nwu olekatakɔ. Obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yotam nfɛ niayila di lɛkayo kanya aatoonyu kafɔɔ kasɔ nwu batii.<verse eid="2CH 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 26:22" />Asaa ya bamba di Usia labla nii, diayɔ ni di kasɔkakyekɔ dialaase ni di kayɛntɛkɔ yi, ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Amos obisuɔtɔbi Yesaia lakpana nya aatɛ. <verse eid="2CH 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 26:23" />Usia latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ, ni baakookaa nwɔ di ɔlɔɔkɔ lɛma di batii kakookaakɔ ka niale ni baka kale nɛ. Diekye batii labuɛ alɛ, “Ofiɛ sɛɛle eefiɛ.” Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yotam labayila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 26:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="2CH 27" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Yotam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 27:1" />Alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-anɔɔ di Yotam lafũ di obe wɔ aabale ni ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ lefosi-akuɔ nɛ. Ɔya leyooto niale Yerusa, aale ni Sadok obisankobi. <verse eid="2CH 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 27:2" />Aabla lɛsaa le niasiɛko ni di SAATE nwu anu, fɛ mmle okle di ote Usia labla nii, kafɔɔ nnwɔɔ atabuo SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kamɛ. Kafɔɔ, batii nwu mma yi, baanwini baatɔɔbla kɔlalaa ablasaa lɛma nwu. <verse eid="2CH 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 27:3" />Yotam lase SAATE nwu olekatakɔ Osi Kayoko letofo ni aatofo oyoyiɛ wɔ di Ofel lekpenkpe aakyakaa nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 27:4" />Aabudi sekpoo di Yuda batii akpenkpe suoto ku ayo siene ku ayo takale di apookuu kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 27:5" />Yotam lakpɛko Amon batii ɔka ni aalenkee ma nɛ. Amon batii lata Yotam koto fututu bakilo nkpe ntiɛ-alafa-ana, kamɔɔ bakilo nkpe kɔlafa ku atitabi bakilo nkpe kɔlafa di lɛlɛɛ nwu kamɛ. Amon batii lawako nwɔ alesaa nwu okle di lɛpɔ kasale nwu kanya di lɛlɛɛ nyɔɔfa ku ditiɛfa kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 27:6" />Yotam labawɛ osie nwaa diekye aalolaa aakyɛ di SAATE Yaa nɔɔ nwu anu.<verse eid="2CH 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 27:7" />Asaa ya bamba di Yotam labla ni di sɛka olebee nɔɔ kamɛ, diɛkyakaa ni di nkpɛ nɔɔ be aakpɛ nii, ku asaa bamba ya aabla ni yi, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di Israel ku Yuda baka kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 27:8" />Alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-anɔɔ aafũ di obe wɔ aabale ni ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ lefosi akuɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 27:9" />Yotam lalaatɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ, ni baakookaa nwɔ di Dawid Okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ nɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Ahas labayila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 27:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="2CH 28" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Ahas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 28:1" />Alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ di Ahas lafũ di obe wɔ aabale ni ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem lefosi alɛɛ akuɔ nɛ. Atabla lɛsaa le niasiɛko ni di SAATE nwu anu fɛ ɔwa nɔɔ Dawid. <verse eid="2CH 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 28:2" />Aakyɛ di Israel baka sisuku suoto, ni aabla kafɔɔ afiɔtii aata Baal osumu nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 28:3" />Aafiɛ seleɔta di Hinom Ɔtaata kamɛ, ni aayɔ babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ kafɔɔ aata seleɔta di ɔtɔ kamɛ nɛ, aatikanko nnle be di SAATE nwu latososa aadiki ni di Israel batii anu ayududusaa sɛsaabla. <verse eid="2CH 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 28:4" />Aata seleɔta, aafiɛ kafɔɔ olufui di ntakalekɔ, di akpenkpe osi ku kowoso biala niabla ni krikyaa kalɔ.<verse eid="2CH 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Siria Batii Ku Israel Batii Kakpɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 28:5" />Nkpo oso SAATE Yaa nɔɔ layɔ Ɔka Ahas aakpee di Siria ɔka nnɛɛ. Siria batii lalenkee nwɔ, ni baamufũ batii nɔɔ kpinwu kafɔɔ fɛ ayo batentɛ, ni baakpaa ma baasifiko Damasko nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 28:5">Aayɔ nwɔ kafɔɔ aakpee di Israel ɔka nnɛɛ, ni aalo batii nɔɔ kpinwu nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 28:6" />Ninfɛ di Remalia obisuɔtɔbi Peka lalo bakpɛtɛ nkpe kɔlafa-afosi-anyɔ di Yuda di dii kufĩ kamɛ- ta Yuda lasĩ ni SAATE nwu, bate nɔɔ Yaa oso. <verse eid="2CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 28:7" />Sikri wɔ niale ni Efraim otii kpɛtɛ onwii lalo ɔka obisuɔtɔbi Maaseia, Asrikam wɔ niale ni ɔnɔɔfotii wɔ niayila ni di lɛkayo kanya, ku Elkana, nnwɔ di ɔka kamaa nnwɔ nfɛ niatika nii. <verse eid="2CH 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 28:8" />Ni di Israel batii lafũ balanle nkpe alafa-anyɔ baakyeko babilɛma Yuda batii ba di kalakasɔ ɔkyɛ. Baale ni basanko, babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi. Baayɔ kafɔɔ kakpɛ kamɛ asaa kpinwu, ni baatuka nya baakpleko baasifiko Samaria nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Oded</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 28:9" />Kafɔɔ SAATE nwu ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ onwii baatɔɔlɛɛ ni Oded lawɛ ninfa, ni aadie aakyɛ aalakyakako bakpɛtɛ nwu di obe wɔ baakple baasifi ni Samaria nɛ. Ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Ta SAATE nwu, bate lee Yaa nwu lanya ɔblɔ aakpeeko ni Yuda oso aayɔ ma aakpee ye ninnɛɛ nɛ. Kafɔɔ bitoolo ma di lɛblɔfiɛ kanya diɛlaadu osi. <verse eid="2CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 28:10" />Ni di nunua yi, biɛtɛ bilɛ biɔyɔ Yuda ku Yerusalem basuɔtɔ ku basanko mimbla balanle lee nɛ. Kafɔɔ ayee biekpi sikpile lɛpɔɔ di SAATE Yaa lee suoto? <verse eid="2CH 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 28:11" />Nunua bikyɔɔ mi atoko! Bikplesa kale lee batii ba biemufũ ni sɛlanle bisifiko, diekye SAATE nwu lɛnya ɔblɔ yakayaka di suoto lee.”<verse eid="2CH 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 28:12" />Ninfɛ di batunletɛ bawo di Efraim- niale ni Yehonan obisuɔtɔbi Asaria, Mesilemot obisuɔtɔbi Berekia, Salum obisuɔtɔbi Yehiskia, ku Hadlai obisuɔtɔbi Amasa- lasĩ ɔlaa baata mba niakye kakpɛ kamɛ baatɔɔwa ni nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 28:13" />Ni baatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bitankpaa balanle nwu biawako nfũ, se diele nkpo bubakpi lɛpɔɔ di SAATE nwu anu. Ɔtɛ biɛtɛ bilɛ biɔta okpile loo ku lɛpɔɔ loo okpi mpɔ ninkyakaa? Diekye lɛpɔɔ loo okpi nfɛ mpɔ kofokofoko, ɔblɔ nɔɔ yakayaka kafɔɔ ntika di Israel suoto.”<verse eid="2CH 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 28:14" />Nioso bakpɛtɛ nwu ladiɛ balanle nwu ku kakpɛ kamɛ asaa nwu di banɔɔfotii ku kasikɔ nwu kamuu anu. <verse eid="2CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 28:15" />Ninfɛ di basuɔtɔ ba ayooto baalɛlɛɛ ni lakpaa balanle nwu, ni baadiki aakpeele di asaa ya baakyeko kakpɛ kamɛ baawako ni baakpee mba bamuu niakyɛ ni akyɔtɔ nɛ. Baata ma akpeele ku nkpeele, alesaa ku nnyinle, ku kɔfa fifiale. Baayɔ mba bamuu nitawɛ ni ɔnyɛɛ baatika di babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo suoto. Nioso baakplesa ma baasifiko kale lɛma batii nfũ di Yeriko, Awɔsɔ Okpoo kplɛ nwu, ni baapɛbaakple baawa Samaria nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahas Lakaalɛ Lɛkyakaako Aakyeko Asiria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 28:16" />Di obe nwu kamɛ yi, Ɔka Ahas lakaalɛ lɛkyakaako aakyeko Asiria ɔka nfũ. <verse eid="2CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 28:17" />Edom batii lakple baawa baabadieko Yuda, baakpaa kafɔɔ balanle baasifiko. <verse eid="2CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 28:18" />Obe nwu kamɛ kafɔɔ di Filisti batii kafɔɔ lalaadieko sekpoo se niawɛ ni di akpenkpe nkpaa ku Yuda Nkpaalɔ kasɔ kamɛ. Baafũ Bet-Semes, Ayalon ku Gederot diɛkyakaa ni di Soko, Timna ku Gimso ku sekpoenyii se niamana sĩ nii, ni baasiɛ ninmi kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 28:19" />SAATE lawakosa Yuda kasɔ ta Israel ɔka Ahas oso, diekye aata amumu ole lakyɛ sitũ di Yuda osie kanya, atale onukwale kuonwii aata SAATE nwu kafɔɔ. <verse eid="2CH 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 28:20" />Asiria ɔka Tilgat-Pilneser lawa ɔkyɛ nɔɔ, kafɔɔ kubuɛ aabakpee nwɔ, dikaatɛ alɛ lɛkyakaako aatɔɔ nii. <verse eid="2CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 28:21" />Ahas layɔ asaa awo aakyeko SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ku lɛkayo ku banɔɔfotii nfũ ni aayɔ nya aata Asiria ɔka nɛ, kafɔɔ nninkpo ditakyakaako nwɔ.<verse eid="2CH 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahas Sikpile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 28:22" />Ɔka Ahas onukwale ɔtanle ɔta SAATE nwu labataka katoo bia dialenkee di sɛlaa otũbee nɔɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 28:23" />Aata seleɔta aata Damasko bayaa, mba nialenkee nwɔ nii; diekye aabuɛ alɛ, “Di Siria baka bayaa lɛkyakaako ma ni yi, amii kamata ole nta ma di mmle baakyakaako mi nii.” Kafɔɔ mma niale nwɔ kasɔ ɔpɛ ku Israel omuu kasɔ ɔpɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 28:24" />Ni di Ahas lasiisa akpɛnsaa nwu di Yaa olekatakɔ, ni aayɔ nya aasifiko nɛ. Aasɛɛ SAATE nwu olekatakɔ akloo ni aapɛ oleɔta akyikye di obombo biala di Yerusalem nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 28:25" />Aatofo ntakalekɔ di Yuda okpoo biala aata ofiɛ seleɔta ɔta bayaa bamba, aayɔ aakpee SAATE nwu, bate nɔɔ Yaa ɔblɔ.<verse eid="2CH 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 28:26" />Ahas sɛka olebee sɛsaabla bamba ku sisuku nɔɔ simuu, diayɔ ni di kasɔkakyekɔ dialaadu ni kayɛntɛkɔ yi, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di Yuda ku Israel baka kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 28:27" />Ahas latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ, ni baakookaa nwɔ di Yerusalem okpoo kplɛ nɛ, kafɔɔ batayɔ nwɔ baakpee di Israel baka sɛkya kamɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Hesekia labayila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 28:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="2CH 29" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Hesekia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 29:1" />Alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-anɔɔ di Hesekia lafũ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-anaasĩ nɛ. Ɔya leyooto niale Abigya nɛ, Sakaria obisankobi aale. <verse eid="2CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 29:2" />Aabla lɛsaa le niasiɛko ni di SAATE nwu anu, fɛ mmle okle di ɔwa nɔɔ Dawid labla nii.<verse eid="2CH 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Olekatakɔ Nwu Okleklesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 29:3" />Di Yuda batii kɔwɛntɛ kasale kamɛ di Hesekia sɛka olebee lɛlɛɛ kasale kamɛ yi, aasɛkɛtɛ SAATE nwu olekatakɔ akloo ni aalolaa nya nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 29:4" />Ni aakpaa olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii aawako, aasiisa ma di kaflɔnkɔ nwu di kufĩ katunkɔ lɛkyɛ nɛ, <verse eid="2CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 29:5" />ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ: “Lewi batii, bikyɔɔ mi atoko! Bikleklesa suoto lee kanunua biekleklesa kafɔɔ SAATE nwu, bate lee Yaa olekatakɔ. Bidiki asaa ya ninaklekle ni amuu di kakleklekɔ nwu. <verse eid="2CH 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 29:6" />Bate loo ditale onukwale; baabla dikpilesaa di SAATE nwu Yaa loo anu baasĩ nwɔ kafɔɔ. Baakyisa anu lɛma di SAATE nwu kasiɛkɔ, baamunikĩisa mmaa lɛma kafɔɔ baatɔɔ. <verse eid="2CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 29:7" />Baasɛɛ kafɔɔ lɛkpata nwu akloo, ni baaniisa bakandiɛ nɛ. Batafiɛ olufui ee bawako ofiɛ asaaɔta kuonwii di kakleklekɔ nwu babata Israel Yaa nwu. <verse eid="2CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 29:8" />Nioso, SAATE nwu ɔblɔ ntosoo di Yuda ku Yerusalem suoto; atɔɔbla ma lɛyɛkɛsaa ku difu ku lɛmansaa, fɛ mmle biɔnya ni ku anu lee amu. <verse eid="2CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 29:9" />Nle mmle oso di bate loo lanɔɔ di kapamii kanya nɛ. Nni kafɔɔ oso di babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi ku basɔfɔ loo nsi di sɛlanle kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 29:10" />Nunua yi, lɛtɛ nlɛ kɔbla kanya ninii ku SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa nwu, di mmle di ɔblɔ nɔɔ yakayaka nwu kakyɛ ni di suoto loo. <verse eid="2CH 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 29:11" />Babisuɔtɔbi nii, biyɔ nwu ole nunua, diekye SAATE nwu nitoodiki ye alɛ biyila nwɔ di anu biɛbla nwɔ ɔkpɛ, alɛ biabla kasumu ɔkpɛ di anu nɔɔ, biefiɛ kafɔɔ olufui.”<verse eid="2CH 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 29:12" />Ninfɛ di Lewi batii ba mmle lakye ɔkpɛ kasɔ nɛ:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:12">di Kohat batii kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:12">Amasai obisuɔtɔbi Mahat ku Asaria obisuɔtɔbi Yoel;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:12">di Merari batii kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:12">Abdi obisuɔtɔbi Kis ku Yehalelel obisuɔtɔbi Asaria;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:12">di Gerson batii kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:12">Sima obisuɔtɔbi Yoah ku Yoah obisuɔtɔbi Eden;<verse eid="2CH 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 29:13" />di Elisafan banantii kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:13">Simri ku Yeiel;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:13">di Asaf banantii kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:13">Sakaria ku Matania;<verse eid="2CH 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 29:14" />di Heman banantii kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:14">Yehiel ku Simei;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:14">di Yedutun banantii kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:14">Semaia ku Usiel.<verse eid="2CH 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 29:15" />Obe wɔ baasiisa ni babilɛma-suɔtɔbi baakleklesa suoto lɛma kafɔɔ baaloo ni yi, ni baabuo baalakleklesa SAATE nwu olekatakɔ nɛ. Fɛ mmle di ɔka lakpee ni kufiofa, di SAATE nwu ɔlaa kanya. <verse eid="2CH 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 29:16" />Olebatatɛ nwu labuo SAATE nwu kakleklekɔ kamɛ alɛ bɔɔlaakleklesa ni. Baadiki lɛsaa biala baanya ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ditaklekle ni baabatɛ di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kaflɔnkɔ. Ni di Lewi batii lafũ asaa nwu baasifiko Kidron Ɔtaata nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 29:17" />Baakye okleklesa nwu kasɔ di Yuda batii kɔwɛntɛ kasale di dii kasale suoto, ni baadu SAATE nwu lɛkpata di dii nɛnle di kɔwɛntɛ nwu kamɛ. Ni baayɔ ayi anɛ baakleklesa SAATE nwu olekatakɔ omu, baaloo di lefosi dii kuɔnle di kɔwɛntɛ kasale nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Olekatakɔ Nwu Kayi Ose Didiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 29:18" />Ninfɛ di Lewi batii nwu labuo kamɛ baalatɔkɔ Ɔka Hesekia alɛ: “Butookleklesa SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kamuu, ofiɛ asaaɔta oleɔta akyikye ku anwansaa ninya amuu, ku opunu wɔ mantika ni bloblo wɔ beekleklesa nii, ku akpɛnsaa ninya amuu. <verse eid="2CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 29:19" />Butoololaa buokleklesa kafɔɔ akpɛnsaa ya amuu di Ɔka Ahas layɔ aadieko ni di onukwale nɔɔ ɔtanle kamɛ di obe wɔ aale ni ɔka. Kanunua nfɛ ate di SAATE nwu oleɔta akyikye anu.”<verse eid="2CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 29:20" />Ni di kaleesɛ kuyitatũ Hesekia lalɛɛ okpoo kplɛ nwu banɔɔfotii aasiisa ni baakata baakyɛ SAATE nwu olekatakɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 29:21" />Baakyɛnko banankyue-suɔtɔ bakuɛnsĩ, akunumuu akuɛnsĩ, afosobi-suɔtɔ akuɛnsĩ ku ntiekpaa nkuɛnsĩ fɛ okpile asaaɔta diɛta ni sɛkakalekɔ nwu, diɛta ni kafɔɔ kakleklekɔ nwu ku Yuda. Ni di Ɔka latɔkɔ olebatatɛ, Aaron banantii nwu alɛ bayɔ n-ya mmle bata ole di SAATE nwu oleɔta akyikye suoto nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 29:22" />Nioso baalo banankyue-suɔtɔ nwu, ni di olebatatɛ nwu layɔ ntɔ nwu baawanwanyi di oleɔta akyikye nwu suoto nɛ; nni sɛmaa baalo akunumuu nwu ni baayɔ ntɔ lɛma baawanwanyi di oleɔta akyikye nwu suoto nɛ; ninfɛ baalo afosobi-suɔtɔ nwu baayɔ ntɔ lɛma baawanwanyi di oleɔta akyikye nwu suoto nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 29:23" />Baayɔ ntiekpaa nwu diɛta ni okpile asaaɔta baawako di ɔka ku kasikɔ nwu anu, ni baayɔ nnɛɛ lɛma baatika di ntiekpaa nwu suoto nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 29:24" />Ninfɛ di olebatatɛ nwu lalo ntiekpaa nwu baayɔ ntɔ lɛma baata di oleɔta akyikye suoto diɛta ni okpile asaaɔta alɛ diafoto Israel omuu sikpile, diekye ɔka labuɛ alɛ bata ofiɛ asaaɔta ku okpile asaaɔta aata Israel omuu disi.<verse eid="2CH 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 29:25" />Ni di ɔka layɔ Lewi batii aase di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ baaklee abɔɔsaa anɛɛkya, bakyitaa ku basanku di mmle di Dawid ku ɔka asaanyatɛ Gad ku ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Natan latuo ni kanya nɛ; SAATE nwu niakpee kufiofa ko mmle aafenko di ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ nɔɔ suoto. <verse eid="2CH 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 29:26" />Nioso Lewi batii lalolaa suoto baayila baaklee Dawid asansaa, olebatatɛ kafɔɔ laklee akyukyoo lɛma.<verse eid="2CH 29:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 29:27" />Ni di Hesekia lata osuku alɛ bata ofiɛ asaaɔta di oleɔta akyikye nwu suoto nɛ. Di asaaɔta nwu lakye ni kasɔ yi, sinu ɔsa ɔta SAATE nwu kafɔɔ lakye kasɔ, ni di akyukyoo ku Israel ɔka Dawid asansaa lakyakaa nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 29:28" />Kasikɔ nwu kamuu lawakasɔ di kasumu kanya, di obe wɔ di sinubasantɛ latɔɔsa ni sinu, di akyukyoo bafɛntɛ kafɔɔ latɔɔfɛ ni akyukyoo. Baatɔɔbla nle mmle nimuu dialaadu di obe wɔ baaloo ni ofiɛ asaaɔta nwu ɔta.<verse eid="2CH 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 29:29" />Di asaaɔta nwu laloo nii, ni di ɔka ku otii biala niawɛ ni ninfa ku nnwɔɔ lapɛ akunkyi baasumu SAATE nwu nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 29:30" />Ninfɛ di ɔka Hesekia ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ latɔkɔ Lewi batii alɛ bayɔ Dawid ku asaanyatɛ Asaf sɛlaa batansa SAATE nwu nɛ. Nioso baasa katansa sinu ku suoto lɛyɔɔ, ni baawakosa asi lɛma kasɔ baasumu SAATE nwu nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 29:31" />Ninfɛ di Hesekia labuɛ alɛ, “Bitokleklesa suoto lee biɛta SAATE nwu nfɛ. Biwa, biɛyɔ seleɔta ku sɛfa ɔpɛ asaaɔta biwako SAATE nwu olekatakɔ.” Nioso kasikɔ nwu lawako seleɔta ku sɛfa ɔpɛ asaaɔta, mba bamuu kafɔɔ diakpanko ni di otu lawako ofiɛ asaaɔta.<verse eid="2CH 29:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 29:32" />Asaaɔta ya di kasikɔ nwu lawako ni lɛpɔ labla banankyue-suɔtɔ afosi-akuɛnsĩ, akunumuu kɔlafa ku afosobi-suɔtɔ alafa-anyɔ- amuu lale ofiɛ asaaɔta diata SAATE nwu. <verse eid="2CH 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 29:33" />Babɔkɛɛ ba baakleklesa ni fɛ seleɔta lɛpɔ labla akunumuu alafa-akuɔ ku bafoso ku batie nkpe-ntiɛ. <verse eid="2CH 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 29:34" />Kafɔɔ yi, olebatatɛ nwu ditapɔ bata ofiɛ asaaɔta babɔkɛɛ bamuu akũ odiki; nioso babilɛma Lewi batii lakyakaako ma dialaase di obe wɔ di ɔkpɛ nwu laloo nii. Dialaase di obe wɔ baakleklesa ni olebatatɛ bamba kafɔɔ, diekye Lewi batii nlolaa mambla di suoto lɛma okleklesa suoto manlenkee mmle di olebatatɛ nwu mbla nii. <verse eid="2CH 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 29:35" />Ofiɛ asaaɔta kpinwu lawɛ, diakyakaa ni di atoko ɔkyɛ ole asaaɔta lɛla nwu ku nta asaaɔta be ninkyakaa ni di ofiɛ asaaɔta suoto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 29:35">Nioso baase SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kasumu lese lɛbla. <verse eid="2CH 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 29:36" />Ni di Hesekia ku batii nwu bamuu lanya suoto lɛyɔɔ di lɛsaa le di Yaa labla aata ni batii nɔɔ suoto nɛ, diekye aabla ni wlawla.<verse eid="2CH 29:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="2CH 30" />
  <para style="s1">Suoto Ololaa Ɔta Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii Ole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 30:1" />Hesekia lata Israel ku Yuda omuu kanya, ni aakpana akũ kafɔɔ aata Efraim ku Manase, aalɛɛ ma alɛ bawa SAATE nwu olekatakɔ di Yerusalem baabale Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii bata SAATE Israel Yaa nwu nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 30:2" />Ɔka ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ ku kasikɔ nwu kamuu di Yerusalem latɛ alɛ babale Okpi Diisi Ofe dii nwu di Yuda batii kɔwɛntɛ nyɔɔfa kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 30:3" />Batafuo dii nwu ole di obe ninwu kamɛ, diekye olebatatɛ ba niakleklesa ni suoto lɛma ditapɔ, batii nwu kafɔɔ ditasi di Yerusalem. <verse eid="2CH 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 30:4" />Mmle baatitika ni lakyɛkyɛ diata ɔka ku kasikɔ nwu kamuu, akyuu nwu anyɔ. <verse eid="2CH 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 30:5" />Ni baatɛ alɛ booyie lɛkya manfenko di Israel omuu, diayɔ ni di Beer-Seba dialaadu ni Dan, baatɔɔlɛɛ batii nwu alɛ bawa Yerusalem baabale Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii nwu bata SAATE Israel Yaa nwu nɛ. Badisinle dii nwu di lɛpɔ kplɛ kamɛ di mmle baakpana baatɛ ni kanya.<verse eid="2CH 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 30:6" />Ni di batɔkyɛntɛ nwu laklee akũ ya niakye ni ɔka ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ nfũ baafenko di Israel ku Yuda omuu, di ɔka kufiofa kanya, kuabuɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 30:6">“Israel batii, bipɛbikple biwa SAATE nwu nfũ, Abraham, Isak ku Israel Yaa ɔkyɛ, alɛ aapɛankple anwa aye ba niebu ni, biatoso biadie ni di Asiria baka nnɛɛ ɔkyɛ. <verse eid="2CH 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 30:7" />Bitante fɛ bate lee ku babilee ba nitale onukwale baata ni SAATE nwu, bate lɛma Yaa nwu, diata alɛ aabla ma baate fɛle lɛyɛkɛsaa, fɛ mmle biɔnya nii. <verse eid="2CH 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 30:8" />Bitanle batokopĩtɛ, fɛ mmle di bate lee late nii; biyɔ suoto lee bita SAATE nwu. Biwa kakleklekɔ ka atookleklesa ni dinaa ni kaloo. Bisumu SAATE Yaa lee nwu, mmle di ɔblɔ yakayaka nɔɔ kamunikĩi kunkyɛ ye ni di suoto. <verse eid="2CH 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 30:9" />Nse biɛpɛbiekple biɛwa SAATE nwu ɔkyɛ yi, ni babilee-suɔtɔbi ku babi lee bamufũtɛ kamanya ma nyaami mampɛmankple manwa kafɔɔ kasɔ ka mmle, diekye SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ nkpe sifutulɛ, an-nya kafɔɔ nyaami. Ɔlɔbakyisa anu nɔɔ di suoto lee nse biɛpɛbiekple biɛwa ɔkyɛ nɔɔ.”<verse eid="2CH 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 30:10" />Batɔkyɛntɛ nwu ladie baakyɛ okpoo biala di Efraim ku Manase, dialaadu bia Sebulon. Kafɔɔ batii nwu lama ma baanyu ma kafɔɔ nyakatãa. <verse eid="2CH 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 30:11" />Kafɔɔ yi, Aser, Manase ku Sebulon batii bawo lawakosa suoto lɛma kasɔ ni baadie baakyɛ Yerusalem nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 30:12" />Di Yuda kafɔɔ yi, Yaa kɔnɛɛ latika di batii nwu suoto diata alɛ disibu lɛma labla ninwii baayɔ baabla ɔkpɛ wɔ di ɔka ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ lakpee ma ni ɔbla, di SAATE nwu ɔlaa kanya.<verse eid="2CH 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baale Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 30:13" />Batii ɔlambu kplɛkplɛ lasi di Yerusalem alɛ boole Bloblo wɔ Ninantaka ni Dii di Yuda batii kɔwɛntɛ nyɔɔfa kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 30:14" />Baakpakpaa oleɔta akyikye ya niayila ni di Yerusalem, baalɛ kafɔɔ olufui oleɔta akyikye baalaawii di Kidron Ɔtaata.<verse eid="2CH 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 30:15" />Ni baalo Okpi Diisi Ofe lefosobi nwu di lefosi dii naafa di Yuda batii kɔwɛntɛ nyɔɔfa nwu suoto nɛ. Sinunsɔ lakpɛ olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii nwu ni baakleklesa suoto lɛma baayɔ ofiɛ asaaɔta baawako SAATE nwu olekatakɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 30:16" />Ninfɛ baayila di n-yilakɔ lɛma fɛ mmle bɛɛtɛ ni di Yaa otii nwu Mose Kufiofa kamɛ nɛ. Ninfɛ di olebatatɛ lanwanwanyi ntɔ be di Lewi batii layɔ baata ma ni nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 30:17" />Di batii kpinwu di ɔlambu nwu kamɛ diikleklesa ni suoto lɛma oso yi, Lewi batii nialo Okpi Diisi Ofe afosobi baata batii ba bamuu nitaklekle nii, batafuo ni afosobi lɛma okleklesa ɔta ni SAATE nwu. <verse eid="2CH 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 30:18" />Nu di batii dudu di batii kpinwu ba niakye ni Efraim, Manase, Isakar ku Sebulon baawa ni ditakleklesa ni suoto lɛma, kafɔɔ baale ni Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii nwu yi, baayila di lɛsaa le bɛɛkpana bɛɛtɛ ni suoto. Kafɔɔ Hesekia lapɛ ɔlaa aata ma, aabuɛ alɛ, “SAATE nwu, nnwɔ ninlɛ ni, ayɔ akyɛ otii biala <verse eid="2CH 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 30:19" />wɔ niɛyɔ ni otu nɔɔ ɛɛtɛ ɛɛta ni Yaa owolaa- SAATE nwu, bate nɔɔ Yaa- bia nse aaklekle di kakleklekɔ nwu afiofa kanya.” <verse eid="2CH 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 30:20" />Ni di SAATE nwu lanu aata Hesekia, ni aayɔɔsa batii nwu ofiɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 30:21" />Israel batii ba niawɛ ni di Yerusalem lale Bloblo wɔ Ninantaka ni dii ayi akuɛnsĩ ku suoto lɛyɔɔ kplɛ ɔnya, obe wɔ di Lewi batii ku olebatatɛ nwu latɔɔsa ni sinu baatɔɔta ni SAATE nwu dii biala, di SAATE nwu katansa asansaa lakyakaa nii.<verse eid="2CH 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 30:22" />Ninfɛ di Hesekia lakakatɛ osie okpee sɛlaa aata Lewi batii bamuu, mba niawɛ ni lɛsɔnu nwaa di SAATE nwu ɔkpɛ ɔbla suoto nɛ. Ayi akuɛnsĩ amu baale nlekɔ lɛma be baata ma nii, baata atoko ɔkyɛ ole asaaɔta, baatansa SAATE, bate lɛma Yaa nwu.<verse eid="2CH 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baakple Baase Dii Ole Lɛnyɔɔfa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 30:23" />Ni di kasikɔ nwu kamuu latuna alɛ boole dii nwu ayi akuɛnsĩ mankyakaa nɛ; nioso baale dii nwu ayi akuɛnsĩ bamba ku suoto lɛyɔɔ. <verse eid="2CH 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 30:24" />Yuda ɔka Hesekia lata kasikɔ nwu banankyue-suɔtɔ kakpe, bafoso ku batie nkpe nkuɛnsĩ, aata banɔɔfotii nwu kafɔɔ banankyue-suɔtɔ kakpe, bafoso ku batie nkpe lefosi. Olebatatɛ di lɛpɔ kpinwu kamɛ lakleklesa suoto lɛma. <verse eid="2CH 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 30:25" />Yuda kasikɔ nwu kamuu lanya suoto lɛyɔɔ, diakyakaa ni di olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii ku mba bamuu niakye Israel baabasi ni, dikyakaa ni di bafɔɔ ba niakye ni Israel ku mba niasiɛ ni di Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 30:26" />Suoto lɛyɔɔ kplɛ lawɛ di Yerusalem, diekye diayɔ ni di Israel ɔka Dawid obisuɔtɔbi Solomon obe kamɛ yi, lɛsalɛsaa kuninwii diiwɛ di Yerusalem fɛle nle mmle okle. <verse eid="2CH 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 30:27" />Ni di Olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii layila baata batii nwu lɛtɔtrɔ, ni di Yaa lanu aata ma nɛ. Diekye ɔlaa ɔpɛ lɛma ladu osi, di kasiɛkɔ klekle nɔɔ.<verse eid="2CH 30:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="2CH 31" />
  <para style="s1">Hesekia Lase Yaa Kasumu Nkpa Disiɛbi Lɛbla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 31:1" />Baaloo ni asaa ya mmle nwu amuu ɔbla yi, Israel batii ba niawɛ ni ninfa ladie baakyɛ Yuda sekpoo, baalaabibiɛ afiɔtii, baabubudi Asera sewoso kafɔɔ baatɛ kaasɔ. Baalalaasa ntakalekɔ nwu ku seleɔta akyikye di Yuda, Benyamin, Efraim ku Manase omuu baafenko. Baalalaasa nya amuu baaloo nii, ni di Israel batii lapɛbaakple baasifi mma bamu sekpoo ku mma bamu lɛsaawɛ kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 31:2" />Ni di Hesekia lasɛ sɛkpɛ aata olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii di akudi kanya- obiala lɛma di sɛkpɛ lɛma kanya fɛ olebatatɛ ee Lewi batii- alɛ baata ofiɛ asaaɔta ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole asaaɔta, mambla kasumu, mampɛ sɛfa, mansa katansa sinu kafɔɔ di SAATE nwu kasiɛkɔ n-yoko. <verse eid="2CH 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 31:3" />Ɔka lata asaa aakyeko lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ amu kamɛ diata ni olesɛ ku kɔtɔɔfɔ ofiɛ asaaɔta, diata ni kafɔɔ ofiɛ asaaɔta di Anyɛɛtɛyi suoto, Awɛntɛ Fɔle ku ayi finle fɛ mmle bɛɛkpana ni di SAATE nwu Kufiofa kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 31:4" />Aatɔkɔ batii ba ninsi ni di Yerusalem alɛ bata olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii kalekɔ ka ninle ma ni kale, di mmle baayɔ suoto lɛma manta ni SAATE nwu Kufiofa ole. <verse eid="2CH 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 31:5" />Nfanwu di kufiofa nwu ladie ni yi, Israel batii lata alesaa kasale lɛma ku sifutulɛ niale ni atitabi, nta fɔle, nnɔnyi ku bablɔ ku asaa ya amuu man-wɛ mankyeko ni afe. Baawako lɛsaa biala dikyuu fosile, di lɛpɔ kplɛ kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 31:6" />Israel ku Yuda batii ba niasiɛ ni di Yuda sekpoo kafɔɔ lawako banankyue ku bafoso lɛma dikyuu fosile ku asaa klekle ya beekleklesa bɛɛta ni SAATE Yaa lɛma nwu dikyuu fosile. Ni baasiisa nya di akudi kanya nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 31:7" />Baakye nle mmle ɔbla kasɔ di Yuda batii kɔwɛntɛ tiɛfa kamɛ, ni baaloo di kɔwɛntɛ kuɛnsinle kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 31:8" />Di Hesekia ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ lawa baabanya ni asaa akudi nwu yi, baatansa SAATE nwu ni baata batii nɔɔ Israel lɛtɔtrɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 31:9" />Ni di Hesekia lakaalɛ olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii ɔlaa di asaa akudi nwu suoto nɛ; <verse eid="2CH 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 31:10" />ni di oletatɛ-nɔɔfo Asaria, niakye ni Sadok leyo kamɛ ladiki kanya alɛ, “Diayɔ ni di obe wɔ di batii nwu lakye kasɔ baatɔɔwako ni asaa okũ lɛma di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ yi, buɔwɛ alesaa kpinwu munle, kpinwu kafɔɔ kobu ante, diekye SAATE nwu ntɔɔta batii nɔɔ lɛtɔtrɔ, ni di n-ya mmle kpinwu lebu di lɛpɔ kamɛ ate nɛ.”<verse eid="2CH 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 31:11" />Ni di Hesekia latɔkɔ ma alɛ babla asaa ntɛkɔ di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kamɛ, ni baabla nle mmle nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 31:12" />Ninfɛ baale onukwale baayɔ asaa ya baakũ ni akyuu fosile ku akyɛsaa ya baakleklesa ni baawako nɛ. Lewi otii onwii bɔɔlɛɛ ni Konania niayila di asaa ya mmle kanya, obilɛma-suɔtɔbi Simei kafɔɔ niale nnwɔ niatikanko nwɔ nii. <verse eid="2CH 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 31:13" />Yehiel, Asasia, Nahat, Asahel, Yerimot, Yosabad, Eliel, Ismakia, Mahat ku Benaia niala banyuntɛ di Konania ku obilɛma-suɔtɔbi kalɔ, di Ɔka Hesekia ku ɔnɔɔfotii Asaria wɔ niayila ni di Yaa olekatakɔ kanya ladiki ni nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 31:14" />Lewi otii nwu Imna obisuɔtɔbi Kore, aale ni Kufĩ katunkɔ Kayoko nyuntɛ niayila di otu fãa asaaɔta ya manta ni Yaa kanya, aatɔɔsɛ asaa okũ ya manta ni SAATE nwu ku akyɛsaa ya beekleklesa nii. <verse eid="2CH 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 31:15" />Eden, Miniamin, Yesua, Semaia, Amaria ku Sekania lakyakaako nwɔ di onukwale ole kamɛ di olebatatɛ sekpoo kamɛ, baatɔɔsɛ nya baatɔɔta olebatatɛ wo lɛma di akudi lɛma kanya, banɔɔfo ku babisɔ kyɛkyɛ.<verse eid="2CH 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 31:16" />Diɛkyakaa nii, baasɛ baata basuɔtɔbi ba niafũ ni alɛɛ atiɛ ee baalenkee nii, di ayooto lɛma lasiɛ ni di ayooto akũ kamɛ- mba bamuu nimabuo ni SAATE nwu olekatakɔ mambla ni dii biala sɛkpɛ lɛma ateate, di sɛkpɛ lɛma ku akudi lɛma kanya. <verse eid="2CH 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 31:17" />Baasɛ asaa kafɔɔ baata olebatatɛ ba ayooto di ayo lɛma kamɛ batii lakpana baakpee ni di ayooto akũ kamɛ, baabla nkpo okle baata kafɔɔ Lewi batii ba niafũ ni alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ ee baalenkee nii, di sɛkpɛ lɛma ɔbla ku akudi lɛma kanya. <verse eid="2CH 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 31:18" />Baayɔ babifɔɔle lɛma bamuu, basɔfɔ lɛma, okpoo nwu omuu babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi ba ayooto niasiɛ ni di ayooto akũ ya mmle kamɛ baakyakaa. Diekye baale onukwale di suoto lɛma okleklesa kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 31:19" />Kafɔɔ olebatatɛ, Aron banantii ba niasiɛ ni di nkpɛnsɔ be niamana sekpoo lɛma ee sekpoo bamba siakyi ni mma yi, baadiki batii di ayooto kanya alɛ basɛ asaa nwu awo bata osuɔtɔbi biala di kamɛ lɛma ku mba bamuu ayooto baakpana baakpee ni di Lewi batii ayooto akũ kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 31:20" />Nle mmle ninle lɛsaa le di Hesekia labla aafenko ni di Yuda kasɔ kamuu suoto nɛ. Aatɔɔbla lɛsaa le niale ni dibiene diate ni tinini ku anukwale di SAATE Yaa nɔɔ anu. <verse eid="2CH 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 31:21" />Di lɛsaa biala aabla ni di Yaa olekatakɔ ɔkpɛ ɔbla kamɛ ku kufiofa nwu atoko ɔkyɔɔ ku asaa otuo nwu yi, aawolaa Yaa nɔɔ, aabla ɔkpɛ kafɔɔ ku otu nɔɔ omuu. Nioso asaa lalɛ ɔkyɛ aatɔɔ.<verse eid="2CH 31:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="2CH 32" />
  <para style="s1">Asiria Batii Lataka Kakpɛ Di Yerusalem Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 32:1" />Di asaa ya amuu di Hesekia labla ni di onukwale ole kamɛ sɛmaa yi, Asiria ɔka Senakerib lawa aabadieko Yuda. Aate kala aamana sekpoo siene nwu aakyi, aanyu alɛ abalenkee sĩ anta suoto nɔɔ. <verse eid="2CH 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 32:2" />Di Hesekia lanya alɛ Senakerib ntɔɔwa ni ku disibu alɛ ɔɔbadieko ni Yerusalem kakpɛ yi, <verse eid="2CH 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 32:3" />ni aakpee asi baawo ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ ku bakpɛtɛ di mmle baasɛɛ ni ntu be niekye ni ntu ntaakɔ di okpoo kplɛ nwu sɛmaa osuku, ni baakyakaako nwɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 32:4" />Batii dikudi kplɛ lasi, ni baasɛɛ ntu ntaakɔ ku seklenyii nwu simuu se nimbiɛ sinfe ni di kasɔ nwu suoto nɛ. Ninfɛ baabuɛ alɛ, “Obe oso di Asiria baka kamawa mamawɛ ntu nkpinwu ninfũ?” <verse eid="2CH 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 32:5" />Ninfɛ aabla ɔkpɛ osie kanya aatoololaa oyoyiɛ nwu aba ya niabiɛ nii, aatootofo kafɔɔ ayo takale ninnwu suoto. Aatofo oyiyiɛ bamba di nnwu nkpo sɛmaa aasiensa Dawid Okpoo kplɛ nwu seyoyiɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ninle ni Milo</char></note>. Aabla kafɔɔ akpɛsaa ku kubiafunsaa di lɛpɔ kplɛ kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 32:6" />Aadiki bakpɛtɛ banɔɔfo aase di batii nwu kanya ni aasiisa ma di anu nɔɔ di kablɛfɛɛkɔ nwu di okpoo kplɛ nwu kayoko ni aakpee ma osie ku sɛlaa se mmle alɛ: <verse eid="2CH 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 32:7" />“Biwɛ osie ku sɛkambi. Bitanyɛkɛ ee nnɛɛ lafee ye ta Asiria ɔka ku bakpɛtɛ dikudi kplɛ le akyɛnko nii, diekye osie kplɛ nkpe wo kulenke nnwɔ ninkpe nwɔ nii. <verse eid="2CH 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 32:8" />Di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ yi, suoto sina lete akle, kafɔɔ awo yi, SAATE Yaa loo kamakyakaako wo, munkpɛ nkpɛ loo.” Ni di batii nwu lawɛ sɛkambi di ɔlaa wɔ di Yuda ɔka Hesekia labuɛ ni suoto nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 32:9" />Di obe owo sɛmaa, di Asiria ɔka Senakerib ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu latɔɔtɛ ni kalà di Lakis yi, ni aakpee banɔɔfotii nɔɔ Yerusalem ku ɔlaa wɔ mmle aata ni Yuda ɔka Hesekia ku Yuda batii ba bamuu niawɛ ni ninfa alɛ:<verse eid="2CH 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 32:10" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di Asiria ɔka Senakerib kobuɛ ni alɛ: Obe lɛsaa suoto bietika disi oso bilɛ biosiɛ osiɛ di Yerusalem ɔmana okyi nwu nkpo kamɛ? <verse eid="2CH 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 32:11" />Nse Hesekia lebuɛ alɛ, ‘SAATE Yaa loo kamadiki wo ankyeko Asiria ɔka nnɛɛ yi,’ ɔɔkyɔnkyɔ ye, anta kɔka ku otukɔnsɔ nlo ye. <verse eid="2CH 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 32:12" />Diele Hesekia omu niakpakpaa yaa wɔ mmle ntakalekɔ nwu ku seleɔta akyikye nwu, aatɔkɔ Yuda ku Yerusalem alɛ, ‘Dikpeni biesumu di oleɔta akyikye anwii anu, biefiɛ kafɔɔ seleɔta ninwu suoto’?<verse eid="2CH 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 32:13" />“Bieye lɛsaa le di ami ku bate nii labla ni nsɔ nwu bamba batii bamuu? Nnle nwu nkpo bayaa lafuo kasɔ lɛma ofũ di nnɛɛ nii? <verse eid="2CH 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 32:14" />Bawe di bayaa ba mmle bamuu kamɛ, di bate nii lawɔɔsa ni niafuo batii nɔɔ odiki di nnɛɛ nii? Ni lɛ nfɛ di yaa lee kamafuo ye odiki okyeko nnɛɛ nii? <verse eid="2CH 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 32:15" />Nkpo oso bitanta Hesekia lakyɔnkyɔ ye aata ye biayu osuku kafɔɔ fɛle mmle. Bitanfũ nwɔ bianu, diekye kale ee sɛkakalekɔ kukanwii yaa diifuo batii nɔɔ odiki okyeko nnɛɛ nii ee bate nii nnɛɛ. Lɛ nfɛ di yaa lee kafuo ye odiki okyeko nnɛɛ nii!”<verse eid="2CH 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 32:16" />Ni oso Senakerib banɔɔfo nwu lakakatɛ sɛlaa kpinwu di SAATE Yaa nwu ku kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ Hesekia suoto. <verse eid="2CH 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 32:17" />Ɔka kafɔɔ lakpana akũ aatootufa SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu, aabuɛ sɛlaa se mmle kafɔɔ di suoto nɔɔ alɛ: “Fɛ mmle okle di nsɔ bamba nwu batii bayaa ditafuo ni batii lɛma odiki ni di nnɛɛ nii yi, nkpo di Hesekia yaa dilɔbafuo batii nɔɔ odiki di nnɛɛ nii nɛ.” <verse eid="2CH 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 32:18" />Ninfɛ baafaa baalɛɛ Yerusalem batii ba niawɛ ni di oyoyiɛ nwu suoto di Yuda sele kamɛ alɛ bookpee ma difu manyɛkɛsa ma di mmle baafũ ni okpoo kplɛ nwu nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 32:19" />Baakakatɛ di Yerusalem Yaa suoto fɛ mmle baabla ni di batii bamba bayaa suoto di kayi ka mmle- ninle ni batii nnɛɛ ɔkpɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 32:20" />Ni di Ɔka Hesekia ku ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yesaia wɔ niale ni Amos obisuɔtɔbi lapɛ ɔlaa baawi baalɛɛ osi di nle mmle suoto nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 32:21" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu lakpee Yaa tɔkyɛntɛ onwii, aabalo bakpɛtɛ ku batunletɛ ku banɔɔfotii lɛma nwu bamuu di Asiria ɔka kasiɛkɔ nwu nɛ. Nioso aapɛakple aasifi nnwɔɔ omu kasɔ suoto ku sinunsɔ. Di obe wɔ aabuo ni yaa nɔɔ olekatakɔ kamɛ yi, ni di babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ bawo lasasafɔ nwɔ kapamii baatɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 32:22" />Nioso SAATE nwu lafũ Hesekia ku Yerusalem batii nkpa aakyeko Asiria ɔka Senakerib ku batii bamba bamuu nnɛɛ. SAATE nwu lanyu ma di ɔfankyi biala. <verse eid="2CH 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 32:23" />Batii kpinwu lawako asaaɔta Yerusalem baabata SAATE nwu ku akyɛsaa ya niefũ ni kɔya baabata Yuda ɔka Hesekia. Diayɔ ni di obe nwu kamɛ diasifi nii yi, nnle nwu mmuu latɔɔta Hesekia dibu nwaa.<verse eid="2CH 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hesekia Ofiɛ Ku Suoto Nɔɔ Katoo Ɔtakatɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 32:24" />Di obe nwu kamɛ, Hesekia labuo ofiɛ, aaloo ni okpi. Ni aapɛ ɔlaa aata SAATE nwu, ni aatuna aatɔɔ, aatuo nwɔ dituosaa le niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 32:25" />Kafɔɔ Hesekia latakatɛ suoto nɔɔ katoo di otu nɔɔ kamɛ, ni atapɛ SAATE nwu sɛfa di sifutulɛ se aale nwɔ ni suoto nɛ; nni oso SAATE nwu ɔblɔ lawa di nnwɔɔ ku Yuda ku Yerusalem suoto. <verse eid="2CH 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 32:26" />Ninfɛ di Hesekia lakyi di otu nɔɔ kamɛ aawakosa suoto kasɔ, fɛ mmle di Yerusalem batii labla ni nɛ; nioso SAATE nwu ɔblɔ ditawa ma di suoto di Hesekia obe kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hesekia Lɛsaawɛ Ku Lɛklɛɛ Nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 32:27" />Hesekia lawɛ lɛsaawɛ kpinwu ku dibu, ni aabla asaa ntɛkɔ aata koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle nɔɔ, afuɔ ya niafũ ni kɔya, akɔnɔkɔnɔsaa, kubiafunsaa ku asaa ya niafũ ni kɔya ateate amuu nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 32:28" />Aatofo ayo kafɔɔ aata atitabi, nta fɔle ku nnɔnyi ɔtɛ; aabla kafɔɔ ntenkɔ aata banankyue ateate, aakpee abà aata bafoso ku batie. <verse eid="2CH 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 32:29" />Aabudi sekpoo, aawɛ kafɔɔ bafoso ku banankyue di lɛpɔ kplɛ kamɛ, diekye Yaa latɔɔ lɛsaawɛ kpinwu.<verse eid="2CH 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 32:30" />Hesekia nwu niasɛɛ Gihon kasɔ ntu kataakɔ di osi lɛkyɛ, ni aadiki ntu nwu kafenkɔ aasifiko kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ lɛkyɛ di Dawid Okpoo kplɛ nwu nɛ. Asaa lalɛ nwɔ ɔkyɛ di lɛsaa biala aabla ni suoto. <verse eid="2CH 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 32:31" />Kafɔɔ obe wɔ di Babel batunletɛ lakpee batii alɛ balaakaalɛ nwɔ ni atuosaa ya niawa ni di kasɔ nwu suoto yi, Yaa ladiɛ nwɔ nnɛɛ alɛ ɔɔsɔ nwɔ annyu antofo kafɔɔ lɛsaa biala le niasiɛ nwɔ ni di otu kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hesekia Sɛka Ole Kayɛntɛkɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 32:32" />Hesekia sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba ku sɛsaabla nɔɔ tinini yi, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di Amos obisuɔtɔbi, ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yesaia odiki otuo kamɛ, asi ni di Yuda ku Israel baka kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 32:33" />Hesekia latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ ni baakookaa nwɔ di lekpenkpe di lɛba le di Dawid banantii sɛkya nte ni nɛ. Ni di Yuda ku Yerusalem batii bamuu latɔɔ dibu di obe wɔ aakpi ni nɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Manase layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 32:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="2CH 33" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Manase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 33:1" />Lefosi alɛɛ anyɔ di Manase lafũ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ afosi-anɔɔ-anɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 33:2" />Aabla okpile di SAATE nwu anu, aatikanko nnle be di SAATE nwu latososa aadiki ni di Israel batii anu ta ayududusaa sɛsaabla lɛma oso. <verse eid="2CH 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 33:3" />Aase ntakalekɔ nwu di ote Hesekia labibiɛ nii letofo; aapɛ kafɔɔ seleɔta akyikye aata Baal, ni aabla Asera sewoso aase nɛ. Aawakasɔ aata osi asaa nwu amuu, ni aasumu nya kafɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 33:4" />Aapɛ seleɔta akyikye di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ di SAATE nwu labuɛ ni alɛ, “Leyooto nii kamaka di Yerusalem kamɛ dinaa ni kaloo.” <verse eid="2CH 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 33:5" />Aapɛ seleɔta akyikye aata osi asaa nwu amuu di SAATE nwu nflɔnkɔ akyuu nwu anyɔ. <verse eid="2CH 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 33:6" />Aayɔ babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ aata ole di ɔtɔ kamɛ di Ben Hinom Ɔtaata kamɛ, ni aabla afasaa, sɛbɔ ɔpɛ, sɛsɛɛ ku asaa ɔkaalɛ di bakpi ku anwuna kamɛ nɛ. Aale sikpile kpinwu di SAATE nwu anu, aata ɔblɔ lafiɛ nwɔ.<verse eid="2CH 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 33:7" />Manase layɔ Asera owoso letembi le aawola ni aalaase di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ, nle di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ni Dawid ku obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Solomon alɛ, “Di olekatakɔ ka mmle ku Yerusalem, ntoodiki ni di Israel ana nwu amuu kamɛ kamatɛ Leyooto nii dinaa ni kaloo. <verse eid="2CH 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 33:8" />Namasinta kafɔɔ Israel batii nkpaa didie di kasɔ ka lata ni bawa lee, nse babalolaa mannyu, mambla kafɔɔ lɛsaa biala le lɛtɔkɔ ma ni di afiofa nwu amuu, sisuku ku kanya ninii ka lata lafenko ni di Mose suoto.” <verse eid="2CH 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 33:9" />Kafɔɔ Manase laleko Yuda ku Yerusalem batii katũ baayu osuku, nioso baabla okpile baalenkee nnle be di SAATE nwu lawɔɔsa ni di Israel batii anu.<verse eid="2CH 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Manase Lakyisa Nkpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 33:10" />SAATE nwu lakakatɛ aata Manase ku batii nɔɔ, kafɔɔ batakyɔɔ nwɔ atoko. <verse eid="2CH 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 33:11" />Nioso SAATE nwu latɔɔ Asiria ɔka kakpɛ kanyabayilatɛ aakpee ma, ni baamufũ Manase baalaatɛ di leyo katenkɔ, baayɔ lɛkɔnĩi baakpee nwɔ di onwu, baanii nwɔ ku lɛbɔɔsaa sɛɛlɛ anyɛnɛ, ni baakpaa nwɔ baasifiko Babel nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 33:12" />Di nimiina nɔɔ kamɛ yi, ni aawakosa suoto nɔɔ kasɔ buɛɛ, aakaalɛ SAATE Yaa nɔɔ sibualɛ, di bate nɔɔ Yaa anu nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 33:13" />Di obe wɔ aapɛ ɔlaa aatɔɔ nii, ɔlaa nɔɔ lakpanko SAATE nwu di Manase suoto kasɔ ɔwakosa nwu, ni aanu lekoto nɔɔ otikiti nɛ; nioso aakplesa nwɔ aawako Yerusalem ku sɛkakalekɔ nɔɔ. Ninfɛ di Manase latofo alɛ SAATE nwu ninle Yaa nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 33:14" />Nni sɛmaa yi, aase Dawid Okpoo kplɛ nwu oyoyiɛ wɔ sɛɛmaa, di Gihon ntu kataakɔ kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ di ɔtaata nwu kamɛ letofo, dialaadu bia Kakpaku Kayoko kanya, kuafe kuakyi Ofel lekpenkpe; aata nwu kafɔɔ kuataka nwaa. Ni di Manase layɔ bakpɛtɛ kanyabailatɛ aatɛ di sekpoo siene nwu simuu di Yuda nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 33:15" />Aadiki bafɔɔ bayaa nwu, ni aakpakpaa atembi nwu aadieko di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ nɛ. Aakpakpaa kafɔɔ seleɔta akyikye ya aapɛ ni amuu di olekatakɔ lekpenkpe nwu ku Yerusalem; ni aadiki nya di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ aafuki aayu nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 33:16" />Ninfɛ aase SAATE nwu oleɔta akyikye lɛpɛ, aata atoko ɔkyɛ ole asaaɔta ku sɛfa ɔpɛ asaaɔta ninnya suoto nɛ. Ni aatɔkɔ Yuda alɛ basumu SAATE Israel Yaa nwu nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 33:17" />Kafɔɔ yi, batii nwu lanwini baatɔɔta ole di ntakalekɔ nwu, kafɔɔ SAATE Yaa lɛma nwu lete baatɔɔta seleɔta nwu baatɔɔta.<verse eid="2CH 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Manase Sɛka Ole Kayɛntɛkɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 33:18" />Manase sɛka olebee sɛsaabla bamba, diakyakaa ni di ɔlaa nɔɔ ɔpɛ ɔta Yaa nɔɔ ku sɛlaa se di asaa banyatɛ lakakatɛ baatɔɔ ni di SAATE Israel Yaa nwu leyooto kamɛ yi, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di Israel baka sekofolaa akũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 33:19" />Ɔlaa nɔɔ ɔpɛ ku mmle di ɔlaa nɔɔ lakpanko ni Yaa, diakyakaa ni di sikpile nɔɔ simuu ku onukwale nɔɔ ɔtanle, ku aba ya aatofo ni ntakalekɔ, aase ni kafɔɔ Asera sewoso ku afiɔ fiɛ nfɛ aawakosa ni suoto nɔɔ kasɔ yi- bɛɛkpana amuu beekpee di asaa banyatɛ akũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 33:20" />Manase latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ, ni baakookaa nwɔ di lɛkayo nɔɔ kamɛ nɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Amon layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Amon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 33:21" />Alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-anyɔ di Amon lafũ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ anyɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 33:22" />Aabla okpile di SAATE nwu anu, fɛ mmle di ote Manase labla nii. Amon lasumu afiɔ ya amuu di ote Manase labla nii, aatɔɔta kafɔɔ seleɔta aatɔɔta nya. <verse eid="2CH 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 33:23" />Kafɔɔ atawakosa suoto nɔɔ kasɔ di SAATE nwu anu fɛ mmle di ote Manase labla nii; Amon lata lɛpɔɔ nɔɔ okpi lapɔ diakyakaa.<verse eid="2CH 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 33:24" />Ni di Amon banɔɔfotii lakũ kanwumbe di suoto nɔɔ, ni baalo nwɔ di lɛkayo nɔɔ kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 33:25" />Ninfɛ di kasɔ nwu batii lalo batii ba bamuu niataka baayila ni di Ɔka Amon suoto, ni baayɔ obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yosia baase sɛka di disi nɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 33:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="2CH 34" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Yosia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 34:1" />Alɛɛ anɛ di Yosia lafũ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ-ninwii di Yerusalem nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 34:2" />Aabla lɛsaa le niasiɛko ni di SAATE nwu anu, aakyɛ kafɔɔ di ɔwa nɔɔ Dawid sisuku suoto, atakyi aafe oletanɛɛkyɛ ee ɔmɛntukyɛ.<verse eid="2CH 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 34:3" />Di sɛka nɔɔ olebee lɛlɛɛ nɛnle kamɛ, di obe wɔ eekple ale ni okosopo yi, ni aakye kasɔ aatoowolaa ɔwa nɔɔ Dawid Yaa nɛ. Di lefosi lɛlɛɛ nyɔɔfa nɔɔ kamɛ yi, aakye kasɔ aatɔɔkpakpaa ntakalekɔ nwu, Asera sewoso, afiɔ ya baawola ni ku asaa ya baanyanakĩisa ni di atembi awo kanya di Yuda ku Yerusalem. <verse eid="2CH 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 34:4" />Di kanyu nɔɔ kalɔ baabibiɛ Baal seleɔta akyikye baatɛ kaasɔ; aakpakpaa olufui seleɔta akyikye ya niataka katoo aalenkee nya ni wɛkyɛwɛkyɛ, ni aakpakpaa Asera sewoso nwu, afiɔ ku atembi nwu nɛ. N-ya mmle aabibiɛ wɔkyɔwɔkyɔ ni aasamiisa nya aakpete di batii ba niatɔɔta ole baatɔɔta nya ni sɛkya suoto nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 34:5" />Ni aafiɛ olebatatɛ nwu akufi di seleɔta akyikye lɛma nwu suoto, ni aakleklesa Yuda ku Yerusalem nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 34:6" />Di Manase, Efraim ku Simeon sekpoo, dialaadu ni bia Naftali, ku sekpoo biɛle se niamana ma siakyi ni yi, <verse eid="2CH 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 34:7" />aabibiɛ seleɔta akyikye nwu ku Asera sewoso aatɛ kaasɔ, ni aakuɔ afiɔtii nwu aabla mpu, aakpakpaa kafɔɔ olufui seleɔta akyikye amuu di Israel omuu. Ninfɛ aapɛakple aasifi Yerusalem nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baase Olekatakɔ Nwu Lelolaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 34:8" />Di Yosia sɛka olebee di lefosi lɛlɛɛ nɛnle kamɛ, alɛ okleklesa ni kasɔ nwu ku olekatakɔ nwu yi, aakpee Asalia obisuɔtɔ Safan ku okpoo kplɛ nwu ɔka Maaseia, ku nnwɔ nintɛ ni asaa nsũ, Yoahas obisuɔtɔbi Yoah, alɛ balalolaa SAATE Yaa nɔɔ olekatakɔ.<verse eid="2CH 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 34:9" />Ni baakyɛ oletatɛ nɔɔfo Hilkia ɔkyɛ baalaayɔ koto ko baawako ni Yaa olekatakɔ kamɛ baatɔɔ nɛ. Nko di Lewi batii ba niale ni n-yoko banyuntɛ lafũ baakyeko ni Manase, Efraim ku Israel batii ba niabu ni bamuu nfũ ku nko baafũ baakyeko ni Yuda ku Benyamin batii ku Yerusalem okpoo basiɛtɛ bamuu nfũ. <verse eid="2CH 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 34:10" />Ninfɛ baayɔ koto nwu baata basuɔtɔ ba baadiki alɛ bayila ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ɔkpɛ kanya nɛ. Basuɔtɔ ba mmle lata bakpɛntɛ ba nialolaa, baase ni kafɔɔ olekatakɔ lɛbla nwu nkpo koto. <verse eid="2CH 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 34:11" />Baata kafɔɔ ayo babantɛ ku ayo batofotɛ koto alɛ baya afuɔ ya baakyɛkyɛsa ni kasɔ ku sewoso se bababla ni sewoso sanale ku selenle ku akpaka bata ni ayo ya di Yuda baka lata aalalaa nii.<verse eid="2CH 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 34:12" />Basuɔtɔ nwu labla ɔkpɛ di onukwale kanya. Batii ba niayila ma ni kaanya baatootuo ma ni mmle baabla ni ɔkpɛ nwu niale Yahat ku Obadia, Lewi batii banantii ba niakye ni Merari, ku Sakaria ku Mesulam ba niakye ni Kohat. Lewi batii- mba bamuu niatofo ni sinu asansaa ɔsa kamɛ nwaa- <verse eid="2CH 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 34:13" />layila di akpɛnsaa batukatɛ kanya, baatoonyu kafɔɔ bakpɛntɛ nwu bamuu di ɔkpɛ nwu biala suoto. Lewi batii nwu bawo lale akũ bakpanatɛ, asaa batuotɛ ku n-yoko banyuntɛ.<verse eid="2CH 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baanya Kufiofa Kukũ Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 34:14" />Di obe wɔ baatoodieko ni koto ko baalaatɛ ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ yi, ni di oletatɛ Hilkia lanya Kufiofa Kukũ ko di SAATE nwu lata aafenko ni di Mose suoto nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 34:15" />Ni di Hilkia latɔkɔ kukũ kpanatɛ Safan alɛ, “Ntɔɔnya Kufiofa Kukũ nwu di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kamɛ.” Ni aayɔ kũ aata Safan nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 34:16" />Ninfɛ di Safan layɔ kukũ nwu aakyɛnko ɔka, aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ: “Banɔɔfotii lɛfɔ kɔbla lɛsaa biala le bɛɛyɔ beekpee ma ni ninnɛɛ. <verse eid="2CH 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 34:17" />Batɔɔyɔ koto ko niate ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ bɛɛta ato, bɛɛyɔ kũ kafɔɔ beekpee di ɔkpɛ nwu banyuntɛ ku bakpɛntɛ nwu nnɛɛ.” <verse eid="2CH 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 34:18" />Ninfɛ di kukũ kpanatɛ Safan latɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Oletatɛ Hilkia lɛtɛɛ kukũ kunwii.” Ni di Safan laka kukũ nwu kamɛ sɛlaa di ɔka nwu anu nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 34:19" />Di ɔka lanu ni Kufiofa nwu kamɛ sɛlaa yi, aabɛbɛɛ akpeele wua nɔɔ nwu. <verse eid="2CH 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 34:20" />Ni di ɔka lakpee Hilkia, Safan obisuɔtɔbi Ahikam, Mika obisuɔtɔbi Abdon, kukũ kpanatɛ Safan ku ɔka tɔkyɛntɛ Asaia alɛ: <verse eid="2CH 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 34:21" />“Bikyɛ biɛlaawolaa asaa kamɛ di SAATE nwu ɔkyɛ, di lɛsaa le bɛɛkpana beekpee ni di kukũ ko mmle bɛɛnya ni suoto, bita ami ku batii ba niebu busi ni di Israel ku Yuda. SAATE nwu ɔblɔ wɔ niɛwa wo ni di suoto latɛ kukpe osie ta bate loo ditamufũ ni SAATE nwu ɔlaa baaklee ni oso; batakyɛ di asaa ya amuu bɛɛkpana beekpee ni di kukũ ko mmle kanya.”<verse eid="2CH 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 34:22" />Ninfɛ di Hilkia ku batii ba baakpee alɛ baatikanko nwɔ ni lakyɛ baalaakakatɛko ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ-sanko Hulda wɔ niale ni Salum ɔsɔfɔ. Salum lale akpeele katɛkɔ nyuntɛ, ote niale Tokat wɔ niale ni Hasra obisuɔtɔbi nɛ. Ɔsanko nwu lasiɛ di Yerusalem, di Kale Dikudi nyɔɔfa kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 34:23" />Ni di ɔsanko nwu latɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Israel Yaa nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Bitɔkɔ osuɔtɔ wɔ niekpee ye ni ɔkyɛ nii bilɛ, <verse eid="2CH 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 34:24" />‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kamayɔ letokonanfi nwako di kasɔ ka mmle ku batii ba ninsi ni ninka suoto- akpaani ya amuu bɛɛkpana beekpee ni di kukũ nwu batɔɔka ni kamɛ di Yuda ɔka anu. <verse eid="2CH 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 34:25" />Ta batosĩ mi beefiɛ ni kafɔɔ olufui bɛɛta ni bayaa bamba, beekpee mi ni ɔblɔ kafɔɔ di asaa ya amuu di nnɛɛ lɛma labla ni oso yi, ɔblɔ nii kamasoo kunkpete di lɛba le mmle kunɔɔwa ni ɔbanii.’ <verse eid="2CH 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 34:26" />Bitɔkɔ Yuda ɔka wɔ niekpee ye alɛ bibawolaa ni asaa kamɛ di SAATE nwu ɔkyɛ bilɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Israel Yaa nwu kobuɛ ni di sɛlaa se feenu ni suoto alɛ: <verse eid="2CH 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 34:27" />Ta faakyi ni di otu lɛfɔ kamɛ, faawakosa ni suoto lɛfɔ kasɔ di SAATE nwu anu di obe wɔ faanu ni ɔlaa wɔ aabuɛ ni di lɛba le mmle ku batii nini suoto, ta faawakosa ni suoto lɛfɔ kasɔ di anu nii, faabɛbɛɛ ni kafɔɔ akpeele wua lɛfɔ nwu, faawi ni di anu nii oso yi, ntoonu fɔ ɔlaa, SAATE nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="2CH 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 34:28" />Nfɛ kamata fansifi bate lɛfɔ nfũ, babakokaa fɔ kafɔɔ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ. Anu lɛfɔ dilɔbanya letoko nanfi le nimuu kamayɔ nwako ni di lɛba le mmle ku mba ninsi ni ninfũ suoto.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 34:28">Nioso baayɔ ɔsanko nwu kanya didiki baakyɛnko ɔka.<verse eid="2CH 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosia Lanii Kanya Alɛ Abakyɔɔ SAATE Nwu Ɔlaa Kotoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 34:29" />Ninfɛ di ɔka nwu lalɛɛ Yuda ku Yerusalem banɔɔfo bamuu aasiisa nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 34:30" />Ni di ɔka lakata aakyɛ SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ku Yuda batii, Yerusalem batii, olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii- diɛyɔ ni di obisɔ dialaadu ni ɔnɔɔfo. Ni aaka Kanya Ninii Kukũ ko baanya ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kamɛ sɛlaa simuu aakpee di atoko lɛma kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 34:31" />Ninfɛ di ɔka layila di lɛkpaka nɔɔ ɔlɔɔkɔ, ni aase kanya ninii nwu lɛfɔle lɛbla di SAATE nwu anu- alɛ abatikanko SAATE nwu, anklee kafɔɔ sɛlaa nɔɔ, afiofa ku sɛsaabla ku otu nɔɔ omuu ku ɔkla nɔɔ omuu, an-le kafɔɔ kanya ninii nwu sɛlaa se bɛɛkpana beekpee ni di kukũ ko mmle kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 34:32" />Ninfɛ aata otii biala di Yerusalem ku Bennyamin layɔ suoto lɛma baakpee di ntam nwu kalɔ nɛ; Yerusalem batii labla nle mmle di Yaa kanya ninii kanya, bate lɛma Yaa nwu.<verse eid="2CH 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 34:33" />Ni di Yosia ladiki afiɔ ayududusaa nwu amuu di nsɔ be mmuu niale ni Israel batii nle, aata kafɔɔ batii ba bamuu niawɛ ni di Israel lasumu SAATE Yaa lɛma nwu. Di obe wɔ aasiɛ ni nkpa kamɛ yi, batasĩ SAATE nwu, bate lɛma Yaa otikanko.<verse eid="2CH 34:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="2CH 35" />
  <para style="s1">Yosia Lale Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 35:1" />Yosia lale Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii aata SAATE nwu di Yerusalem, ni baalo Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii ole lefosobi di Yuda batii kɔwɛntɛ kasale kamɛ, di lefosi dii naafa suoto nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 35:2" />Ni aadiki olebatatɛ aase di sɛkpɛ lɛma kanya, ni aakpee ma osie di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ɔkpɛ ɔbla kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 35:3" />Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ Lewi batii ba nintuo ni Israel omuu asaa, mba suoto baakleklesa baata ni SAATE nwu alɛ: “Biyɔ lɛlakaa klekle nwu bise di olekatakɔ ka di Israel ɔka Dawid obisuɔtɔ Solomon latofo ni kamɛ. Diɛkaatɛ alɛ bietuka ni di amuusi lee biekyiko. Nunua yi, bisumu SAATE Yaa lee nwu ku batii nɔɔ Israel nfɛ. <verse eid="2CH 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 35:4" />Bilolaa suoto lee di ayo kanya di akudi lee kamɛ, di mmle di Israel ɔka Dawid ku obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Solomon lakpana baatɛ ni kanya.<verse eid="2CH 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 35:5" />“Biyila di kakleklekɔ nwu ku Lewi batii dikudi nwu, baayila bata okpoo lee batii ayo kamɛ kukudii biala, batii ba ninansi ni di kuninwii kamɛ. <verse eid="2CH 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 35:6" />Bilo Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii afosobi, bikleklesa suoto lee biɛlolaa afosobi nwu bita okpoo lee batii, alɛ baabla lɛsaa le di SAATE nwu lata ni kufiofa aafenko ni di Mose suoto.”<verse eid="2CH 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 35:7" />Yosia lata batii ba bamuu nitasiɛ ni di kuninwii kamɛ bafoso ku batie nkpe afosi-atiɛ diata Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii asaaɔta nwu, aata kafɔɔ banankyue nkpe ntiɛ- amuu lakye ɔka omu lɛsaawɛ kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 35:8" />Banɔɔfotii nɔɔ kafɔɔ lakũ asaa niakye ni otu lɛma kamɛ baata batii nwu ku olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii. Ni di Hilkia, Sakaria ku Yehiel ba niale ni Yaa olekatakɔ nwu banyuntɛ lata olebatatɛ nwu Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii asaaɔta nkpe nnyɔ-alafa-akuɔ ku banankyue alafa atiɛ. <verse eid="2CH 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 35:9" />Ni di Konania ku Semaia ku Netanel, babilɛma-suɔtɔbi, ku Hasabia, Yeiel ku Yosabad, ba niale ni Lewi batii batunletɛ kafɔɔ lata Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii asaaɔta nkpe nnɔɔ ku banankyue alafa anɔɔ baata Lewi batii.<verse eid="2CH 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 35:10" />Baatɛ kasumu nwu sɛsaabla, ni di olebatatɛ layila di n-yilakɔ lɛma, di Lewi batii kafɔɔ di akudi lɛma kamɛ fɛ mmle di ɔka nwu labuɛ ni nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 35:11" />Baalo Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii afosobi nwu, ni di olebatatɛ layɔ ntɔ be baayɔ baakpee ma ni ninnɛɛ baanwanwanyi, di obe wɔ di Lewi batii kafɔɔ latoodiki ni babɔkɛɛ nwu akũ. <verse eid="2CH 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 35:12" />Baadiki ofiɛ asaaɔta nwu baatɛ lete alɛ babayɔ nya manta batii nwu ayo kamɛ kukudi nwu, alɛ baayɔ manta SAATE nwu, fɛ mmle bɛɛkpana ni di Mose kukũ kamɛ. Baabla banankyue nwu kafɔɔ nkpo. <verse eid="2CH 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 35:13" />Ni baafiɛ Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii babɔkɛɛ nwu di ɔtɔ suoto fɛ mmle baabuɛ baatɛ ni kanya, ni baawa asaaɔta klekle nwu di abukii, sɛkakutu ku babɛɛsi kamɛ, ni baasɛ sĩ wlawla baata batii nwu bamuu nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 35:14" />Di nle mmle sɛmaa yi, baalolaa sina baata suoto lɛma ku olebatatɛ, diekye olebatatɛ ba niale ni Aron banantii latɔɔta ofiɛ asaaɔta ku babɔkɛɛ lɛla oleɔta dialaadu obe wɔ di kale laloo nii. Nioso Lewi batii lalolaa sina baata suoto lɛma ku Aron olebatatɛ banantii.<verse eid="2CH 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 35:15" />Sinu basantɛ, Asaf banantii layila di aba ya di Dawid, Asaf, Heman ku Yedutun, ɔka asaanyatɛ nwu labuɛ baatɛ nii. Ditasiɛko alɛ n-yoko banyuntɛ di kayoko biala kanya kakyɛ mandiɛ sɛkpɛ lɛma, diekye Lewi batii wo lɛma labla alesaa baata ma.<verse eid="2CH 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 35:16" />Nioso di obe nwu kamɛ yi, baatɛ SAATE nwu kasumu kamuu baata Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii nwu ole ku ofiɛ asaaɔta ɔta di SAATE nwu oleɔta akyikye suoto, fɛ mmle di Ɔka Yosia labuɛ nii. <verse eid="2CH 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 35:17" />Israel batii ba niawɛ ni ninfa lale Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii nwu di obe nwu kamɛ. Baale kafɔɔ Bloblo wɔ Ninantaka ni Dii ayi akuɛnsĩ. <verse eid="2CH 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 35:18" />Diayɔ ni di ɔlabuɛtɛtɛ Samuel obe kamɛ yi, badile Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii le mmle okle banya; Israel baka kuonwii kafɔɔ diile Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii le mmle okle diidii, fɛ mmle di Yosia, olebatatɛ, Lewi batii, Yuda ku Israel omuu ba niawɛ ni ninfa ku Yerusalem batii lale nii. <verse eid="2CH 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 35:19" />Baale Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii le mmle di Yosia sɛka olebee lefosi lɛlɛɛ nɛnle kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosia Sɛka Ole Kayɛntɛkɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 35:20" />Di n-ya mmle amuu sɛmaa yi, di Yosia lalolaa asaa di olekatakɔ nwu aatɛ nii, ni di Egipte ɔka Neko lakata aakyɛ Karkemis di Eufrate sekle kotoko aalaakpɛ nɛ. Ninfɛ di Yosia ladie aalaakyakako nwɔ di kakpɛ kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 35:21" />Kafɔɔ Neko lakpee batɔkyɛntɛ ɔkyɛ nɔɔ alɛ, “Oo Yuda ɔka, kamɛnlɔ ninsi di afɔ ku ami ntɛɛ? Diele afɔ kodieko di obe wɔ mmle kamɛ, kafɔɔ munko kale ka ninkpe ni kakpɛ. Yaa latɔkɔ mi alɛ mpɛsɛwa; nioso diɛ ɔtaka oyila di Yaa suoto, nnwɔ ninsikoe nii, se diele nkpo abawɔɔsa fɔ.”<verse eid="2CH 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 35:22" />Kafɔɔ, Yosia ditakyɛ aadiɛ nwɔ, kafɔɔ aakyɛlɛnsa asaa di suoto nɔɔ alɛ ɔɔlaakpɛko nwɔ. Atakyɔɔ atoko di ɔlaa wɔ di Neko labuɛ ni di Yaa ɔlaa kanya, kafɔɔ aakyɛ aalaakpɛko nwɔ di Megido kasɔ lakataa suoto.<verse eid="2CH 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 35:23" />Ni di akplɔ bataatɛ lataa Ɔka Yosia nɛ, ni aatɔkɔ bakpɛtɛ banɔɔfotii nɔɔ alɛ, “Bikpaa mi bisifiko; batootika mi nkɔ osie kanya.” <verse eid="2CH 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 35:24" />Nioso baakɛnkɛ nwɔ baadiki di keke nɔɔ kamɛ, baayɔ nwɔ baakpee di keke wɔ bamba aawɛ ni kamɛ, ni baakpaa nwɔ baawako Yerusalem nɛ. Ni aakpi, baakokaa nwɔ di bate nɔɔ sɛkya kamɛ, ni di Yuda ku Yerusalem omuu lawi nwɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 35:25" />Yeremia lawola sikunu aata Yosia, diɛbadu ni mmiɛ dii le mmle yi, basuɔtɔ ku basanko sinu basantɛ nnyuma Yosia di sikunu se mmle ɔsa kamɛ. Nle mmle labakple ɔsaabla di Israel bɛɛkpana kafɔɔ beekpee di Sikunu kukũ kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 35:26" />Yosia sɛka olebee sɛsaabla bamba ku kasumu nɔɔ sɛkpɛ, di lɛsaa le bɛɛkpana ni di SAATE nwu Kufiofa kamɛ kanya yi- <verse eid="2CH 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 35:27" />asaa ya aabla ni amuu, diayɔ ni di kasɔkakyekɔ dialaadu ni kayɛntɛkɔ yi, bɛɛkpana nya di Israel ku Yuda baka kukũ kamɛ.<verse eid="2CH 35:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="2CH 36" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Yehoahas</para>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 36:1" />Ni di kasɔ nwu batii layɔ Yosia obisuɔtɔbi Yehoahas baase sɛka di ote kanya nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 36:2" />Alɛɛ afosi anyɔ-atiɛ di Yehoahas lafũ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem awɛntɛ atiɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 36:3" />Egipte ɔka latakatɛ nwɔ di sɛka suoto di Yerusalem, ni aanyinka Yuda batii alɛ bata koto fututu bakilo nkpe ntiɛ-alafa-ana ku koto sɛɛle bakilo afosi atiɛ-bana nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 36:4" />Ni di Egipte ɔka layɔ Yehoahas obilɛma-suɔtɔbi, Eliakim aase sɛka di Yuda ku Yerusalem suoto, ni aakyɛlɛnsa Eliakim leyooto aabla Yehoiakim nɛ. Kafɔɔ Neko lakpaa Eliakim obilɛma-suɔtɔbi Yehoahas aasifiko Egipte.<verse eid="2CH 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Yehoiakim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 36:5" />Alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-anɔɔ di Yehoiakim lafũ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem lefosi lɛlɛɛ ninwii nɛ. Aabla okpile di SAATE Yaa nɔɔ anu. <verse eid="2CH 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 36:6" />Ni di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar ladieko nwɔ, aaninii nwɔ ku lɛbɔɔsaa anyɛnɛ alɛ ɔɔkpaa nwɔ ansifiko Babel. <verse eid="2CH 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 36:7" />Nebukadnesar layɔ kafɔɔ anwansaa aakyeko SAATE nwu olekatakɔ aasifiko Babel, ni aayɔ nya aalaase di olekatakɔ nɔɔ ninfa nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 36:8" />Yehoiakim sɛka olebee sɛsaabla bamba, ayududusaa ya aabla ni ku asaa ya amuu baanya ni di suoto nɔɔ yi, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di Israel ku Yuda baka kukũ kamɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yehoiakin labayila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Yehoiakin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 36:9" />Lefosi alɛɛ anɛ di Yehoiakin lafũ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem awɛntɛ atiɛ ku ayi lefosi nɛ. Aabla okpile di SAATE nwu anu. <verse eid="2CH 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 36:10" />Di kabienle kamɛ yi, Ɔka Nebukadnesar lakpee baalaakpaa Yehoiakin, diakyakaa ni ku anwansaa ya niafũ ni kɔya di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ baawako Babel. Ni aayɔ Yehoiakin ote obilɛma-suɔtɔbi, Sedekia aase sɛka di Yuda ku Yerusalem suoto nɛ.<verse eid="2CH 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Sedekia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 36:11" />Alɛɛ afosi anyɔ-ninwii di Sedekia lafũ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem lefosi lɛlɛɛ ninwii nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 36:12" />Aabla okpile di SAATE Yaa nɔɔ anu, atawakosa suoto nɔɔ kasɔ kafɔɔ di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yeremia anu, nnwɔ niabuɛ ni SAATE nwu ɔlaa aatɔɔ nii.<verse eid="2CH 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 36:13" />Sedekia lataka aayila kafɔɔ di Ɔka Nebukadnesar wɔ niatɔɔ aaka ni ntam di Yaa leyooto kamɛ. Aabla otokopĩ, aata otu nɔɔ lawɛ osie, ni aasĩ alɛ olookyi afe SAATE Israel Yaa nfũ nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 36:14" />Diɛkyakaa ni yi, olebatatɛ batunletɛ bamuu ku batii nwu onukwale ɔtanle latɔɔpɔ osie kanya, baatikanko nnle bamba ayududusaa sɛsaabla simuu, baatɔɔkpɔnɔfɔsa SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kafɔɔ, nka aakleklesa ni di Yerusalem.<verse eid="2CH 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem Kanɔɔkɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 36:15" />SAATE nwu, bate lɛma Yaa lakple aatɔɔta ɔɔta ma ɔlaa aatoofenko di batɔkyɛntɛ nɔɔ suoto, ta nyaami ɔnya wɔ aawɛ aata ni batii nɔɔ ku kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ nwu oso. <verse eid="2CH 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 36:16" />Kafɔɔ baama Yaa batɔkyɛntɛ nwu, baanyu sɛlaa nɔɔ nyakatãa, baayolee ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ nɔɔ dialaase di obe wɔ di SAATE nwu ɔblɔ lataka ni osie kanya di batii nɔɔ suoto di nyaami ɔnya kuninwii kafɔɔ ditasinwɛ nii. <verse eid="2CH 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 36:17" />Ni aatakatɛ Babel ɔka aakpee ma, ni aalo bakosopo lɛma ku kapamii di kakleklekɔ nwu nɛ. Atadiɛ okosopo ee okpeele, ɔnɔɔfo ee ɔnɔɔfo beene. Yaa layɔ bamuu lɛma aakpee di Nebukadnesar nnɛɛ. <verse eid="2CH 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 36:18" />Ni aayɔ anwansaa ya amuu di Yaa olekatakɔ nwu aasifiko Babel nɛ. Aayɔ akplɛ ku abibii akyuu nwu anyɔ, ku SAATE nwu olekatakɔ lɛsaawɛ, ɔka ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ lɛsaawɛ aasifiko. <verse eid="2CH 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 36:19" />Baakpee SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ɔtɔ, baabibiɛ Yerusalem oyoyiɛ baatɛ kaasɔ nɛ; baafiɛ akayo amuu baalalaasa kafɔɔ lɛsaa biala niafũ ni kɔya ninfa.<verse eid="2CH 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 36:20" />Ninfɛ di Nebukadnesar lakpaa batii ba niabu baasiɛ ni nkpa, batakpi ni di kapamii kanya aasifiko sɛlanle kamɛ di Babel, ni baalakple bakpɛmblatɛ baata nnwɔɔ ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ dialaadu obe wɔ di Persia sɛkakalekɔ labafũ ni osie nɛ. <verse eid="2CH 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 36:21" />Kasɔ nwu lawɛ ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ nika; kaatɛ ɔnyɛɛ di obe wɔ omuu kaate ni kafukuti, dialaase di obe wɔ di alɛɛ afosi-akuɛnsĩ laloo ni, di mmle di SAATE nwu ɔlaa wɔ di Yeremia labuɛ ni kawa ni kaanya.<verse eid="2CH 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kores Ladiki Kanya Alɛ Yuda Batii Bapɛbakple Basifi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 36:22" />Di Persia ɔka Kores lɛlɛɛ kasale kamɛ, di mmle di SAATE nwu ɔlaa wɔ di Yeremia labuɛ ni kawa ni kaanya oso yi, SAATE nwu lakpanko Persia ɔka Kores otu alɛ ayie lɛkya di sɛkakalekɔ nɔɔ kamuu kamɛ, aakpana nwu kafɔɔ di kukũ kamɛ alɛ:<verse eid="2CH 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 36:23" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di Persia ɔka Kores kobuɛ nɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="2CH 36:23">“ ‘SAATE, Yaa wɔ ninkpe ni di osi ntɔɔyɔ sɛkanlekɔ be mmuu di kasɔ suoto ɛɛtɛɛ, ni eediki mi alɛ ntofo olekatakɔ ntɔɔ di Yerusalem di Yuda nɛ. Batii nɔɔ lele ninsi di kamɛ lee yi- Yaa nɔɔ asiɛko nwɔ, aatɔɔ akata akyɛ osi.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 36:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 36" />
</usx>